(440086, 40916, 12661, '<td valign="top">There are several things wrong with this picture. 1) I happen to love bats. 2) This one is especially cure, and 3) the blur/motion on the right wing &amp; foot is detracting. Since I am one of the few to hold the 1st and 2nd opinion, I won''t hold that against you. And aside from 3, it is a nice shot and a dificult shot to pull off. Good job.</td>', 'There are several things wrong with this picture. 1) I happen to love bats. 2) This one is especially cure, and 3) the blur/motion on the right wing & foot is detracting. Since I am one of the few to hold the 1st and 2nd opinion, I won''t hold that against you. And aside from 3, it is a nice shot and a dificult shot to pull off. Good job.', '2003-10-06 01:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(440087, 40916, 10720, '<td valign="top">Nice eye highlight, would be scarry if not drinking from a humingbird feeder.</td>', 'Nice eye highlight, would be scarry if not drinking from a humingbird feeder.', '2003-10-06 01:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
