(440304, 40637, 5728, '<td valign="top">Hilarious! I hope you didn''t ruin a good camera just for a challenge! Love it - 10.</td>', 'Hilarious! I hope you didn''t ruin a good camera just for a challenge! Love it - 10.', '2003-10-06 06:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(440306, 40743, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, and almost works for me.<br/>It\''s a fine line between a blurry shot that works artistically and one that doesn\''t, and this is just the wrong side of it for me. Maybe if you\''d included a background (or something in the background) that was blurred while the subject was sharp this would have been much stronger. 6</td>', 'Interesting idea, and almost works for me.It\''s a fine line between a blurry shot that works artistically and one that doesn\''t, and this is just the wrong side of it for me. Maybe if you\''d included a background (or something in the background) that was blurred while the subject was sharp this would have been much stronger. 6', '2003-10-06 06:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(440307, 40656, 4258, '<td valign="top">A good setup but poorly executed</td>', 'A good setup but poorly executed', '2003-10-06 06:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(440308, 40900, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, you have a good imagination. Love the sepia toning your nightmare has - 10.</td>', 'Wonderful, you have a good imagination. Love the sepia toning your nightmare has - 10.', '2003-10-06 06:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(440309, 40542, 8522, '<td valign="top">Interesting, and nice application of motion blur. However, I don''t think the framing has helped here. IMO, to give an impression of falling you need a lot more negative space, and a portrait oriented frame as opposed to a square one. The square frame makes it look like he''s just falling to the bottom of a box. 6</td>', 'Interesting, and nice application of motion blur. However, I don''t think the framing has helped here. IMO, to give an impression of falling you need a lot more negative space, and a portrait oriented frame as opposed to a square one. The square frame makes it look like he''s just falling to the bottom of a box. 6', '2003-10-06 06:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(440310, 40868, 6025, '<td valign="top">Pretty picture (hot air balloon? airplane?), but not too dreamlike. (3)</td>', 'Pretty picture (hot air balloon? airplane?), but not too dreamlike. (3)', '2003-10-06 06:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(440311, 40956, 6025, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect, but doesn''t give me any association to dreams, unfortunately.</td>', 'Interesting effect, but doesn''t give me any association to dreams, unfortunately.', '2003-10-06 06:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(440312, 40219, 6025, '<td valign="top">a very nice shot indeed. Not terribly dreamlike, but cool nevertheless (6)</td>', 'a very nice shot indeed. Not terribly dreamlike, but cool nevertheless (6)', '2003-10-06 06:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(440313, 40857, 6025, '<td valign="top">This is a winner. The sheer insanity is typical dreamlike. Great work. (10)</td>', 'This is a winner. The sheer insanity is typical dreamlike. Great work. (10)', '2003-10-06 06:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(440314, 40827, 6025, '<td valign="top">The idea is good, but the flying dutchman was a different type of boat. Also, I don''t get the black vignetting or the other boats. (3)</td>', 'The idea is good, but the flying dutchman was a different type of boat. Also, I don''t get the black vignetting or the other boats. (3)', '2003-10-06 06:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(440315, 40708, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model and dress. Shame about the white balance... the skin seems very orange. The photo is just a little underexposed for my taste. Great idea, it made me laugh out loud (not because I''m heartless! It''s a great idea for nightmare). The background could enhance the foreground more if it were darker. On the whole, I like this though! 8</td>', 'Beautiful model and dress. Shame about the white balance... the skin seems very orange. The photo is just a little underexposed for my taste. Great idea, it made me laugh out loud (not because I''m heartless! It''s a great idea for nightmare). The background could enhance the foreground more if it were darker. On the whole, I like this though! 8', '2003-10-06 06:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(440316, 40708, 6025, '<td valign="top">Excellent studio portrait, but not too much of a dreamlike state. The lighting is spot-on and the colours are gorgeous. Great model as well. (7)</td>', 'Excellent studio portrait, but not too much of a dreamlike state. The lighting is spot-on and the colours are gorgeous. Great model as well. (7)', '2003-10-06 06:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(440317, 40934, 6025, '<td valign="top">PRetty bear, but not dream-related enough. (3)</td>', 'PRetty bear, but not dream-related enough. (3)', '2003-10-06 06:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(440318, 40779, 6025, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, very Ansel Adam-esque. I love the fog and the detail. Could have done with holding the camera straigt, but other than that: Excellent work. (8)<br/></td>', 'Beautiful, very Ansel Adam-esque. I love the fog and the detail. Could have done with holding the camera straigt, but other than that: Excellent work. (8)', '2003-10-06 06:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(440319, 40960, 6025, '<td valign="top">V. cool. Excellent dreamlike thing. Not sure about the background, though. (7)</td>', 'V. cool. Excellent dreamlike thing. Not sure about the background, though. (7)', '2003-10-06 06:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(440321, 40964, 6025, '<td valign="top">A decent picture of a statue, but arguably, the statue is the artwork of someone else, and you documenting it isn''t nearly a big a feat as their work. Sorry. (3)</td>', 'A decent picture of a statue, but arguably, the statue is the artwork of someone else, and you documenting it isn''t nearly a big a feat as their work. Sorry. (3)', '2003-10-06 06:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(440322, 40930, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very edgy. It could do with a much tighter crop though... I don''t see why the frame is needed both above and to the right of your subject. Perhaps you could focus more on the arm in your composition, this would really add to the shock value. 6</td>', 'Very edgy. It could do with a much tighter crop though... I don''t see why the frame is needed both above and to the right of your subject. Perhaps you could focus more on the arm in your composition, this would really add to the shock value. 6', '2003-10-06 06:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(440323, 40348, 6025, '<td valign="top">Very dark, and the picture gives no impression of nightmare - especially not the one in the title. (2)</td>', 'Very dark, and the picture gives no impression of nightmare - especially not the one in the title. (2)', '2003-10-06 06:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(440324, 40780, 6025, '<td valign="top">Cool and the noise really adds to this one. The sheer fear in his eyes - excellent. I love it. (9)</td>', 'Cool and the noise really adds to this one. The sheer fear in his eyes - excellent. I love it. (9)', '2003-10-06 06:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(440326, 40893, 6025, '<td valign="top">Dramatic, cool, dreamlike and exciting. (8)</td>', 'Dramatic, cool, dreamlike and exciting. (8)', '2003-10-06 06:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(440327, 40544, 6025, '<td valign="top">pretty flower, but - honestly - a sorry excuse for a dream. (2)</td>', 'pretty flower, but - honestly - a sorry excuse for a dream. (2)', '2003-10-06 06:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(440328, 40637, 6025, '<td valign="top">That''s your nightmare? Hmm. Fair enough, I suppose, but photographing photography always seemed a bit silly to me. (3)</td>', 'That''s your nightmare? Hmm. Fair enough, I suppose, but photographing photography always seemed a bit silly to me. (3)', '2003-10-06 06:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(440329, 40509, 6025, '<td valign="top">There''s something very sinister about this, in a way. Looks like a tiny doll rather than a baby, but the doll is so lifelike that it seems out of place. This would be a bloody nightmare to me, methinks. But a good shot nevertheless. (8)</td>', 'There''s something very sinister about this, in a way. Looks like a tiny doll rather than a baby, but the doll is so lifelike that it seems out of place. This would be a bloody nightmare to me, methinks. But a good shot nevertheless. (8)', '2003-10-06 06:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(440330, 40689, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, but I don''t tend to have arty, set-up dreams like this! I see this more as something in the room you sleep in which might trigger dreams. Strange use of negative space... I wonder what you were trying to achieve with it. Maybe this would be more effective with the subject to one side of the frame, or more tightly cropped. 6<br/>Edit: of course this isn''t helpful. I don''t see any constructive criticism in there (/sarcasm)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-10-13 10:23:42.</i></td>', 'Beautiful shot, but I don''t tend to have arty, set-up dreams like this! I see this more as something in the room you sleep in which might trigger dreams. Strange use of negative space... I wonder what you were trying to achieve with it. Maybe this would be more effective with the subject to one side of the frame, or more tightly cropped. 6Edit: of course this isn''t helpful. I don''t see any constructive criticism in there (/sarcasm)', '2003-10-06 06:39:47.000000', '2003-10-13 11:23:42.000000', 1),
(440331, 40656, 6025, '<td valign="top">Watch your lighting in this one, the light spillage into your lens has effectively ruined the image for me. Sorry. (3)</td>', 'Watch your lighting in this one, the light spillage into your lens has effectively ruined the image for me. Sorry. (3)', '2003-10-06 06:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(440332, 40478, 6025, '<td valign="top">You dream of harvests? Fair enough. Cool picture, but it doesn''t actually make me think of dreams. (5)</td>', 'You dream of harvests? Fair enough. Cool picture, but it doesn''t actually make me think of dreams. (5)', '2003-10-06 06:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(440333, 40808, 6025, '<td valign="top">A bit daft title, and I dislike your effect. Good pose on the model though. (6)</td>', 'A bit daft title, and I dislike your effect. Good pose on the model though. (6)', '2003-10-06 06:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(440335, 40900, 6025, '<td valign="top">Woulda been a great journalistic shot, but I''m not sure about the dream-qualities of this. Still, the sheer quality of the shot is enough to give you a 7</td>', 'Woulda been a great journalistic shot, but I''m not sure about the dream-qualities of this. Still, the sheer quality of the shot is enough to give you a 7', '2003-10-06 06:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(440336, 40846, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lol, very amusing. I don''t like the orange background... it''s too close to the colours you get when shooting in artificial light with daylight white balance. Shame about the circular reflection in front of the lens, and about the glare on the body. Great idea and motion blur. 6</td>', 'Lol, very amusing. I don''t like the orange background... it''s too close to the colours you get when shooting in artificial light with daylight white balance. Shame about the circular reflection in front of the lens, and about the glare on the body. Great idea and motion blur. 6', '2003-10-06 06:41:55.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(440337, 40823, 6025, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but arguably not your artwork - I''m sure if you tried to sell this image, that Giger would be rather upset. (2)</td>', 'Interesting, but arguably not your artwork - I''m sure if you tried to sell this image, that Giger would be rather upset. (2)', '2003-10-06 06:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(440338, 40457, 6025, '<td valign="top">Very 1950s horror film. her look is so fake that it almost becomes funny. The point is that this is often how dreams are - mixed signals etc. Combine it with the technical quality, and I am convinced this picture is gonna do a lot better than mine. (10)</td>', 'Very 1950s horror film. her look is so fake that it almost becomes funny. The point is that this is often how dreams are - mixed signals etc. Combine it with the technical quality, and I am convinced this picture is gonna do a lot better than mine. (10)', '2003-10-06 06:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(440340, 40658, 6025, '<td valign="top">That is one scary kid. Can''t stand the black/white combined with colour tones effect you have used here though. (3)</td>', 'That is one scary kid. Can''t stand the black/white combined with colour tones effect you have used here though. (3)', '2003-10-06 06:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(440341, 40172, 6025, '<td valign="top">Very, very good. Strong colours, pretty damn scary-looking, good effect, and very dreamlike. (9)</td>', 'Very, very good. Strong colours, pretty damn scary-looking, good effect, and very dreamlike. (9)', '2003-10-06 06:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(440342, 40539, 6025, '<td valign="top">I can''t see anything but darkness. Sorry. (1)</td>', 'I can''t see anything but darkness. Sorry. (1)', '2003-10-06 06:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(440343, 40735, 6025, '<td valign="top">Great technical quality, and pretty spooky too. (7)</td>', 'Great technical quality, and pretty spooky too. (7)', '2003-10-06 06:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(440344, 40789, 6025, '<td valign="top">I can''t stand the inverted effect thing you have done here. "instant art" doesn''t save a bad picture, in my opinion. (1)</td>', 'I can''t stand the inverted effect thing you have done here. "instant art" doesn''t save a bad picture, in my opinion. (1)', '2003-10-06 06:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(440345, 40673, 6025, '<td valign="top">v cool and dreamlike. (10)</td>', 'v cool and dreamlike. (10)', '2003-10-06 06:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(440346, 40434, 6025, '<td valign="top">Inverting a picture = instant art. Unfortunately, instant art doesn''t save a picture that was bad in the first place - although it might improve one that started off good. Sorry, not impressed by this one. (1)</td>', 'Inverting a picture = instant art. Unfortunately, instant art doesn''t save a picture that was bad in the first place - although it might improve one that started off good. Sorry, not impressed by this one. (1)', '2003-10-06 06:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(440347, 40444, 6025, '<td valign="top">Dark, sinister, gloomy, great quality picture, cool lighting, fun idea. (10)<br/></td>', 'Dark, sinister, gloomy, great quality picture, cool lighting, fun idea. (10)', '2003-10-06 06:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(440348, 40946, 6130, '<td valign="top">very funny 8</td>', 'very funny 8', '2003-10-06 06:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(440349, 40529, 6025, '<td valign="top">Wow. A truly astonishing mooon picture. If you took it yourself (as opposed to taking a picture of another picture, something I''d assume you''d never do), this is one of the best pictures of a moon I''ve ever seen. Mind you, it has nothing to do with dreams, but just because of the sheer picture quality, I won''t mark you down for it. (9)</td>', 'Wow. A truly astonishing mooon picture. If you took it yourself (as opposed to taking a picture of another picture, something I''d assume you''d never do), this is one of the best pictures of a moon I''ve ever seen. Mind you, it has nothing to do with dreams, but just because of the sheer picture quality, I won''t mark you down for it. (9)', '2003-10-06 06:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(440350, 40870, 6025, '<td valign="top">Truly harrowing and very imaginative. Great shot. (9)</td>', 'Truly harrowing and very imaginative. Great shot. (9)', '2003-10-06 06:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(440351, 40545, 5728, '<td valign="top">I didn''t see the guy with the knife at first, it took me a few seconds. This is amazing, and easily my favourite photo for the challenge. This must have cost you a lot of practice shots right? Great, well done and deserves my 10 for sure.</td>', 'I didn''t see the guy with the knife at first, it took me a few seconds. This is amazing, and easily my favourite photo for the challenge. This must have cost you a lot of practice shots right? Great, well done and deserves my 10 for sure.', '2003-10-06 06:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(440352, 40808, 6130, '<td valign="top">very good</td>', 'very good', '2003-10-06 06:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(440353, 40733, 6025, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, but her lips look extremely unnatural to me for some reason.</td>', 'Cool shot, but her lips look extremely unnatural to me for some reason.', '2003-10-06 06:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(440354, 40960, 5728, '<td valign="top">Excellent, I love this effect, and it is so fitting for this challenge - 10.</td>', 'Excellent, I love this effect, and it is so fitting for this challenge - 10.', '2003-10-06 06:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(440356, 40971, 6025, '<td valign="top">In terms of photography, this is just a little too self-referential to be of any value, in my opinion. (1)</td>', 'In terms of photography, this is just a little too self-referential to be of any value, in my opinion. (1)', '2003-10-06 06:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(440357, 40876, 6025, '<td valign="top">Not sure about your effect. I don''t like it. (2)</td>', 'Not sure about your effect. I don''t like it. (2)', '2003-10-06 06:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(440358, 40972, 5728, '<td valign="top">Ausgezeichnet, besonders die Helligkeitsverlauf! (9)</td>', 'Ausgezeichnet, besonders die Helligkeitsverlauf! (9)', '2003-10-06 06:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(440359, 40975, 6025, '<td valign="top">Whey - gorgeous colours and the obscuration of her makes her somewhat dreamlike. Very good idea and execution. (8)</td>', 'Whey - gorgeous colours and the obscuration of her makes her somewhat dreamlike. Very good idea and execution. (8)', '2003-10-06 06:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(440360, 40949, 6025, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like your title. Very realistic picture though. (9)</td>', 'Not sure I like your title. Very realistic picture though. (9)', '2003-10-06 06:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(440361, 40457, 5728, '<td valign="top">This made me laugh! It could easily be a scene from an old western movie. Well executed :-) Just a pity you can see it is in a room and not outside (9)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-10-13 03:34:26.</i></td>', 'This made me laugh! It could easily be a scene from an old western movie. Well executed :-) Just a pity you can see it is in a room and not outside (9)', '2003-10-06 06:55:28.000000', '2003-10-13 04:34:26.000000', 1),
(440362, 40673, 5728, '<td valign="top">The way you''ve created the effect of the path, still visible, disappearing into the darkness out the back is amazing. For some reason it reminds me of the Twilight Zone, don''t ask me why. Excellent composition.</td>', 'The way you''ve created the effect of the path, still visible, disappearing into the darkness out the back is amazing. For some reason it reminds me of the Twilight Zone, don''t ask me why. Excellent composition.', '2003-10-06 06:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(440363, 40975, 5728, '<td valign="top">What an effect huh? I love it, the sun burning in the background behind the girl''s silohuette, great. That deep blue sky and the sun shining of the girl''s hair bring all the warmth into the image.</td>', 'What an effect huh? I love it, the sun burning in the background behind the girl''s silohuette, great. That deep blue sky and the sun shining of the girl''s hair bring all the warmth into the image.', '2003-10-06 07:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(440369, 40977, 5728, '<td valign="top">Such a simple photo, but with amazing impact. The composition, the lighting and the whole idea is exceptional.</td>', 'Such a simple photo, but with amazing impact. The composition, the lighting and the whole idea is exceptional.', '2003-10-06 07:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(440371, 40916, 5728, '<td valign="top">Ewww yuk, scarey. But still a very good capture!</td>', 'Ewww yuk, scarey. But still a very good capture!', '2003-10-06 07:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(440372, 40733, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is just so funny! Top composition, really. How did you get her to hold that thing? I hope you paid your model most handsomely for doing that :-)</td>', 'This is just so funny! Top composition, really. How did you get her to hold that thing? I hope you paid your model most handsomely for doing that :-)', '2003-10-06 07:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(440374, 40954, 5728, '<td valign="top">The blue works very well here. I do like the set up, good on you!</td>', 'The blue works very well here. I do like the set up, good on you!', '2003-10-06 07:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(440375, 40971, 5728, '<td valign="top">Now this is the nightmare of all nightmares! Well thought out and executed.</td>', 'Now this is the nightmare of all nightmares! Well thought out and executed.', '2003-10-06 07:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(440377, 40846, 5728, '<td valign="top">Agh! I can''t even look at this without cringing. How painfull! I''ll give you an 8 and move on quickly to the next pic :-)</td>', 'Agh! I can''t even look at this without cringing. How painfull! I''ll give you an 8 and move on quickly to the next pic :-)', '2003-10-06 07:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(440378, 40689, 5728, '<td valign="top">Great light contrasts and tones here - 8.</td>', 'Great light contrasts and tones here - 8.', '2003-10-06 07:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(440379, 40946, 5728, '<td valign="top">What a nightmare! Has it ever happened to you :-) Never happened to me either, thank goodness. Very good submission, only wish you had the whole shoe in the pic and not cropped out - 8.</td>', 'What a nightmare! Has it ever happened to you :-) Never happened to me either, thank goodness. Very good submission, only wish you had the whole shoe in the pic and not cropped out - 8.', '2003-10-06 07:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(440382, 40576, 5728, '<td valign="top">You have got both subjects as main subjects in your title however you have blurred one subject out. Other than that this is very good, purdy gurl :-)</td>', 'You have got both subjects as main subjects in your title however you have blurred one subject out. Other than that this is very good, purdy gurl :-)', '2003-10-06 07:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(440384, 40755, 5728, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture, those colors are amazing and what a killer reflection, choice!</td>', 'Beautiful capture, those colors are amazing and what a killer reflection, choice!', '2003-10-06 07:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(440386, 40831, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is a very good photo. The composition, the tight crop, the boy''s expression, all wonderful. But I personally think you have reduced the quality of the image by desaturating all the colors except red. The redness in the boy''s face and hands gives me feeling he has some kind of illness or something. This one I would have left fully in color or gone fully B &amp; W.</td>', 'This is a very good photo. The composition, the tight crop, the boy''s expression, all wonderful. But I personally think you have reduced the quality of the image by desaturating all the colors except red. The redness in the boy''s face and hands gives me feeling he has some kind of illness or something. This one I would have left fully in color or gone fully B & W.', '2003-10-06 07:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(440387, 40539, 5728, '<td valign="top">Yep this is nightmare! It is a very dark pic, but I see it was your intention to do that, using the little light at the bottom right to lighten everything only just enough to let us see what is happening. This is great, I like it.</td>', 'Yep this is nightmare! It is a very dark pic, but I see it was your intention to do that, using the little light at the bottom right to lighten everything only just enough to let us see what is happening. This is great, I like it.', '2003-10-06 07:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(440393, 40723, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting and props give a dreamlike quality.</td>', 'Interesting lighting and props give a dreamlike quality.', '2003-10-06 08:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(440395, 40637, 12733, '<td valign="top">Quite a nightmare. Is there a glass plate above the camera to hold the water droplets?</td>', 'Quite a nightmare. Is there a glass plate above the camera to hold the water droplets?', '2003-10-06 08:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(440396, 40870, 12733, '<td valign="top">Is it hot in there? The blur creates the dreamlike atmosphere, especially in contrast to the solid-looking brick.</td>', 'Is it hot in there? The blur creates the dreamlike atmosphere, especially in contrast to the solid-looking brick.', '2003-10-06 08:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(440397, 40658, 5728, '<td valign="top">For some reason when I saw this photo I had to think of "Lord of the Rings". Don''t ask me why, maybe the colors and toning perhaps.  I love it, it doesn''t matter how hard someone tries to look evil and bad, it is absolutely impossible for someone with some of their teeth missing. I always have to laugh. Good work.</td>', 'For some reason when I saw this photo I had to think of "Lord of the Rings". Don''t ask me why, maybe the colors and toning perhaps.  I love it, it doesn''t matter how hard someone tries to look evil and bad, it is absolutely impossible for someone with some of their teeth missing. I always have to laugh. Good work.', '2003-10-06 08:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(440398, 40890, 12733, '<td valign="top">The smoky background adds the dream effect; the busy background behind the smoke distracts a bit.</td>', 'The smoky background adds the dream effect; the busy background behind the smoke distracts a bit.', '2003-10-06 08:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(440401, 40949, 5728, '<td valign="top">Eww! Man that blood even looks real! And the skin on the hand looks .... naaaa this isn''t real is it? If that is fake then you''ve made an awesome job of making it look authentic.</td>', 'Eww! Man that blood even looks real! And the skin on the hand looks .... naaaa this isn''t real is it? If that is fake then you''ve made an awesome job of making it look authentic.', '2003-10-06 08:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(440402, 40381, 12733, '<td valign="top">How do you get the weird colors? An interesting shot.</td>', 'How do you get the weird colors? An interesting shot.', '2003-10-06 08:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(440403, 40870, 5728, '<td valign="top">You''ve done a very good job with this image. She fits pefectly into the hole on all sides, that must have been difficult to do. The sepia is a nice warm tone which really lends itself well to your pic.</td>', 'You''ve done a very good job with this image. She fits pefectly into the hole on all sides, that must have been difficult to do. The sepia is a nice warm tone which really lends itself well to your pic.', '2003-10-06 08:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(440404, 40935, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is such a sad sight (that is if it is not a set-up and you used a model, only saying that because his bag looks quite new). Luckily we don''t see much of this around here. But you are right, a real nightmare.</td>', 'This is such a sad sight (that is if it is not a set-up and you used a model, only saying that because his bag looks quite new). Luckily we don''t see much of this around here. But you are right, a real nightmare.', '2003-10-06 08:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(440405, 40667, 12733, '<td valign="top">Like most dreams, this leaves a lot of room for interpretation. Also, like dreams, it leaves the question open as to what it is exactly. Interesting shot.</td>', 'Like most dreams, this leaves a lot of room for interpretation. Also, like dreams, it leaves the question open as to what it is exactly. Interesting shot.', '2003-10-06 08:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(440407, 40735, 5728, '<td valign="top">Now that is a kewl pic of a spider, I love the silohuette effect and the blue/black toning in the background.</td>', 'Now that is a kewl pic of a spider, I love the silohuette effect and the blue/black toning in the background.', '2003-10-06 08:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(440408, 40925, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice sky and silhouette. A person to represent the dreamer in the tower would make this a real winner.</td>', 'Nice sky and silhouette. A person to represent the dreamer in the tower would make this a real winner.', '2003-10-06 08:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(440409, 40509, 12733, '<td valign="top">Quite a prop! Created just for the photo?</td>', 'Quite a prop! Created just for the photo?', '2003-10-06 08:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(440412, 40977, 12733, '<td valign="top">The near monochrome gives this photo a dreamlike quality. The hand can also be percieved as a threat!</td>', 'The near monochrome gives this photo a dreamlike quality. The hand can also be percieved as a threat!', '2003-10-06 08:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
