(440459, 40831, 8522, '<td valign="top">Superb picture, great in every way. I do feel though that it hasn''t really met the spirit of the challenge, and has been shoehorned in a bit. Normally I''d give it a 9 or a 10 (the desat has left a bit of an unattractive grey in places), but here I think I''m going to go for 6.</td>', 'Superb picture, great in every way. I do feel though that it hasn''t really met the spirit of the challenge, and has been shoehorned in a bit. Normally I''d give it a 9 or a 10 (the desat has left a bit of an unattractive grey in places), but here I think I''m going to go for 6.', '2003-10-06 09:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(440461, 40834, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting, but the composition and frame bother me. The frame is just obtrusive and unnecessary. I feel that there is an odd amount of negative space, and wish that there was either more or less of it. I''d have been tempted to crop out the right of the frame just after her hair and remove the shoulder. And have more negative space to the left. Score without the frame: 7. With frame: 6. (and with no border and cropped effectively: 8)</td>', 'Beautiful lighting, but the composition and frame bother me. The frame is just obtrusive and unnecessary. I feel that there is an odd amount of negative space, and wish that there was either more or less of it. I''d have been tempted to crop out the right of the frame just after her hair and remove the shoulder. And have more negative space to the left. Score without the frame: 7. With frame: 6. (and with no border and cropped effectively: 8)', '2003-10-06 09:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(440462, 40841, 6536, '<td valign="top">Scary.... Nice macro shot. It has a good color balance. Nice angle and composition. Good job. 7.</td>', 'Scary.... Nice macro shot. It has a good color balance. Nice angle and composition. Good job. 7.', '2003-10-06 09:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
