(440578, 40337, 12226, '<td valign="top">Good job, better if not for the blown out spot on forehead.....7</td>', 'Good job, better if not for the blown out spot on forehead.....7', '2003-10-06 11:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(440580, 40833, 12226, '<td valign="top">Excellent,  I feel as if I am really fallng.....10</td>', 'Excellent,  I feel as if I am really fallng.....10', '2003-10-06 11:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(440581, 40893, 1368, '<td valign="top">What is this?</td>', 'What is this?', '2003-10-06 11:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(440582, 40710, 10414, '<td valign="top">Wow....this is a great picture!  What was this burning? I''m sure it was a nightmare for someone!</td>', 'Wow....this is a great picture!  What was this burning? I''m sure it was a nightmare for someone!', '2003-10-06 11:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(440583, 40977, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this, it really makes a statement that everyone can relate too. Simple, clean and to the point. Nice job.</td>', 'I like this, it really makes a statement that everyone can relate too. Simple, clean and to the point. Nice job.', '2003-10-06 11:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(440584, 40780, 10673, '<td valign="top">Great depiction!  10</td>', 'Great depiction!  10', '2003-10-06 11:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(440585, 40789, 12226, '<td valign="top">I like it!  This is a great infrared shot!  10</td>', 'I like it!  This is a great infrared shot!  10', '2003-10-06 11:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(440586, 40976, 10643, '<td valign="top">This would benefit from a more intentional-looking perspective. The color and repetition are great, but the vanishing point is not quite in the center and not off-center enough to throw the viewer off-balance.</td>', 'This would benefit from a more intentional-looking perspective. The color and repetition are great, but the vanishing point is not quite in the center and not off-center enough to throw the viewer off-balance.', '2003-10-06 11:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(440587, 40695, 327, '<td valign="top">Very good. This has a Salvador Dali feeling. Interest for the eye with good colors and clean focus.</td>', 'Very good. This has a Salvador Dali feeling. Interest for the eye with good colors and clean focus.', '2003-10-06 11:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(440588, 40936, 5333, '<td valign="top">Giving my 2 cents,<br/> including the ottoman in the pic made the lower part dark, and the top part (the main focus) lost contrast. Plus tho i like to see a semi nude model, :P i don''t find the ''attire'' fitting the the model and mood, but if you try to present a ''erotic dream'', that''s another story....</td>', 'Giving my 2 cents, including the ottoman in the pic made the lower part dark, and the top part (the main focus) lost contrast. Plus tho i like to see a semi nude model, :P i don''t find the ''attire'' fitting the the model and mood, but if you try to present a ''erotic dream'', that''s another story....', '2003-10-06 11:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(440590, 40823, 327, '<td valign="top">That thing is so spooky....the teeth. Alien is going to pop out of the mouth!!!! Kool shot.</td>', 'That thing is so spooky....the teeth. Alien is going to pop out of the mouth!!!! Kool shot.', '2003-10-06 11:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(440592, 40972, 10643, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites. The flash (I assume) gives a nice sharp outline to the statue, distinguishing it from the sky in the way dreamers are separate from their dreams.</td>', 'One of my favorites. The flash (I assume) gives a nice sharp outline to the statue, distinguishing it from the sky in the way dreamers are separate from their dreams.', '2003-10-06 11:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(440593, 40741, 10643, '<td valign="top">Good idea, and excellent execution (no pun intended)</td>', 'Good idea, and excellent execution (no pun intended)', '2003-10-06 11:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(440594, 40779, 10643, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, and the mist gives it an unmistakable dreamy effect.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, and the mist gives it an unmistakable dreamy effect.', '2003-10-06 11:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(440597, 40808, 327, '<td valign="top">Strange shot with a great feeling. This is really interesting and I like it very much. She is floating away, over and over again.</td>', 'Strange shot with a great feeling. This is really interesting and I like it very much. She is floating away, over and over again.', '2003-10-06 11:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(440598, 40695, 10643, '<td valign="top">It''s difficult to get a dreamy effect from a still life but you''ve managed something interesting here. These objects have that time-standing-still air about them and the clock pointing to "almost midnight" helps with a strong nighttime feel.</td>', 'It''s difficult to get a dreamy effect from a still life but you''ve managed something interesting here. These objects have that time-standing-still air about them and the clock pointing to "almost midnight" helps with a strong nighttime feel.', '2003-10-06 11:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(440599, 40975, 10643, '<td valign="top">I like this but I think a faster exposure or faster ISO to get the hair more frozen would help. as it is, the motion looks unintentional because it isn''t emphasized.</td>', 'I like this but I think a faster exposure or faster ISO to get the hair more frozen would help. as it is, the motion looks unintentional because it isn''t emphasized.', '2003-10-06 11:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(440600, 40749, 327, '<td valign="top">Well done.....YUCKie. Not sure what is on those teeth, but you really pulled this off. Great idea, and execution.</td>', 'Well done.....YUCKie. Not sure what is on those teeth, but you really pulled this off. Great idea, and execution.', '2003-10-06 11:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(440602, 40545, 10643, '<td valign="top">believe it or not I think this would work better without the masked murderer. The look on her face as she wakes up is very good, and it can be left to the viewer''s imagination what she was dreaming about. shame about the window frame too, a blank wall that didn''t interfere with the facial expression would have helped.</td>', 'believe it or not I think this would work better without the masked murderer. The look on her face as she wakes up is very good, and it can be left to the viewer''s imagination what she was dreaming about. shame about the window frame too, a blank wall that didn''t interfere with the facial expression would have helped.', '2003-10-06 11:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(440603, 40868, 10643, '<td valign="top">amazing blue color, like a river of sapphire. definitely a surreal photo, nice job.</td>', 'amazing blue color, like a river of sapphire. definitely a surreal photo, nice job.', '2003-10-06 11:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(440604, 40933, 10673, '<td valign="top">Fantastic depiction...looks truly evil! 10</td>', 'Fantastic depiction...looks truly evil! 10', '2003-10-06 11:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(440607, 40933, 327, '<td valign="top">He is spooky because he looks like a clown...they are definitely spooky. I think you did this very well...it creeps me out!!</td>', 'He is spooky because he looks like a clown...they are definitely spooky. I think you did this very well...it creeps me out!!', '2003-10-06 11:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(440608, 40337, 10643, '<td valign="top">spooky subject, excellent lighting. 8</td>', 'spooky subject, excellent lighting. 8', '2003-10-06 11:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(440609, 40733, 10414, '<td valign="top">Great picture!!  The lipstick color, along with the shape of the lips,  makes this picture!  9</td>', 'Great picture!!  The lipstick color, along with the shape of the lips,  makes this picture!  9', '2003-10-06 11:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(440610, 40977, 12226, '<td valign="top">Well done  nice use of color and texture....10</td>', 'Well done  nice use of color and texture....10', '2003-10-06 11:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(440611, 40833, 10643, '<td valign="top">can''t wait to see how you did this. the picture actually seems to be moving, pulling me into it. this is an outstanding special effect.</td>', 'can''t wait to see how you did this. the picture actually seems to be moving, pulling me into it. this is an outstanding special effect.', '2003-10-06 11:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(440612, 40493, 10414, '<td valign="top">Ahhhh.....that''s so sad.....I''m sorry! :(</td>', 'Ahhhh.....that''s so sad.....I''m sorry! :(', '2003-10-06 11:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(440613, 40710, 10643, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot, definitely has that nightmare feel. I''d like to see more sky above (and not have the flames cut off) and less black at the bottom.</td>', 'beautiful shot, definitely has that nightmare feel. I''d like to see more sky above (and not have the flames cut off) and less black at the bottom.', '2003-10-06 11:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(440615, 40876, 327, '<td valign="top">Most dangerous and seen often around flowers, cats and small children. LOL Great idea, cool shot.</td>', 'Most dangerous and seen often around flowers, cats and small children. LOL Great idea, cool shot.', '2003-10-06 11:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(440616, 40784, 10643, '<td valign="top">very well done. has just enough mystery to suit the challenge. 7</td>', 'very well done. has just enough mystery to suit the challenge. 7', '2003-10-06 11:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(440617, 40637, 10414, '<td valign="top">That WOULD be a nightmare!!!   Great shot!!!!</td>', 'That WOULD be a nightmare!!!   Great shot!!!!', '2003-10-06 11:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(440618, 40434, 327, '<td valign="top">One of my personal fears. You''ve captured it well. Good idea.</td>', 'One of my personal fears. You''ve captured it well. Good idea.', '2003-10-06 11:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(440619, 40977, 10643, '<td valign="top">seems like there are a lot of "hand and glass" shots this challenge. this is by far the best. the orange color is wonderful.</td>', 'seems like there are a lot of "hand and glass" shots this challenge. this is by far the best. the orange color is wonderful.', '2003-10-06 11:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(440620, 40509, 10673, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully depicted!  10</td>', 'Wonderfully depicted!  10', '2003-10-06 11:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(440621, 40737, 10643, '<td valign="top">I hope I''m not the only one that sees "nightmare" in dancing teddy bears, not "dream." This is a scary picture!</td>', 'I hope I''m not the only one that sees "nightmare" in dancing teddy bears, not "dream." This is a scary picture!', '2003-10-06 11:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(440622, 40915, 10643, '<td valign="top">very nice seasonal shot. sort of a stretch for the challenge but great dof and color.</td>', 'very nice seasonal shot. sort of a stretch for the challenge but great dof and color.', '2003-10-06 11:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(440623, 40972, 10414, '<td valign="top">Wow....this is fascinating!!  I can''t wait to see what you''ve written about this. Great shot!!!!!    10</td>', 'Wow....this is fascinating!!  I can''t wait to see what you''ve written about this. Great shot!!!!!    10', '2003-10-06 11:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(440624, 40914, 327, '<td valign="top">He fits the title and the challenge.....sure would hate to meet him in an alley!!! lol Good find and nice shot.</td>', 'He fits the title and the challenge.....sure would hate to meet him in an alley!!! lol Good find and nice shot.', '2003-10-06 11:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(440625, 40576, 10643, '<td valign="top">I looked at this for a long time trying to figure out if these are real people or mannequins. The skin tone or makeup almost makes it hard to tell. that alone adds a dream quality to this portrait.</td>', 'I looked at this for a long time trying to figure out if these are real people or mannequins. The skin tone or makeup almost makes it hard to tell. that alone adds a dream quality to this portrait.', '2003-10-06 11:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(440626, 40539, 10643, '<td valign="top">it''s hard to tell what''s going on here. the title helps but it shouldn''t be necessary. using the night light as the only "effect" lighting is great, but I think you need at least a little light for exposure, maybe coming in from the window or the upper left.</td>', 'it''s hard to tell what''s going on here. the title helps but it shouldn''t be necessary. using the night light as the only "effect" lighting is great, but I think you need at least a little light for exposure, maybe coming in from the window or the upper left.', '2003-10-06 11:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(440627, 40857, 10643, '<td valign="top">VERY dreamy and cool! nice job</td>', 'VERY dreamy and cool! nice job', '2003-10-06 11:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(440629, 40211, 10643, '<td valign="top">the reflection of the clouds on the water is what this is about for me, it''s hard to tell which way is up and which is down, which is certainly a dream effect.</td>', 'the reflection of the clouds on the water is what this is about for me, it''s hard to tell which way is up and which is down, which is certainly a dream effect.', '2003-10-06 11:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(440631, 40503, 10643, '<td valign="top">even without the title I see "dance" in this. it''s kind of scary, like they''re moving towards us. what are they?</td>', 'even without the title I see "dance" in this. it''s kind of scary, like they''re moving towards us. what are they?', '2003-10-06 11:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(440632, 40834, 327, '<td valign="top">Fantastic lighting...I like this and like her expression. [pout]</td>', 'Fantastic lighting...I like this and like her expression. [pout]', '2003-10-06 11:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(440633, 40914, 10414, '<td valign="top">Wow!!!    10</td>', 'Wow!!!    10', '2003-10-06 11:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(440635, 40827, 327, '<td valign="top">The vignette is so perfect here!</td>', 'The vignette is so perfect here!', '2003-10-06 11:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(440636, 40834, 10643, '<td valign="top">lovely portrait and the light is perfect. a brighter facial expression and maybe a little more exposure in the background would help sell the "daydream" idea.</td>', 'lovely portrait and the light is perfect. a brighter facial expression and maybe a little more exposure in the background would help sell the "daydream" idea.', '2003-10-06 11:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(440638, 40862, 10643, '<td valign="top">the blurred and oversaturated greens definitely help the dream effect. good job.</td>', 'the blurred and oversaturated greens definitely help the dream effect. good job.', '2003-10-06 12:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(440640, 40656, 327, '<td valign="top">Super idea, and I love the steam too.</td>', 'Super idea, and I love the steam too.', '2003-10-06 12:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(440642, 40780, 10643, '<td valign="top">Best I\''ve seen so far. The grain, the black and white, the shadow, the look on the boy\''s face ... this is a classic nightmare shot. I can''t get over how well this meets the challenge; I keep coming back to look!</td>', 'Best I\''ve seen so far. The grain, the black and white, the shadow, the look on the boy\''s face ... this is a classic nightmare shot. I can''t get over how well this meets the challenge; I keep coming back to look!', '2003-10-06 12:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(440644, 40780, 327, '<td valign="top">His expression is wonderful. Very nicely done. Love the grain and the lighting. Good work.</td>', 'His expression is wonderful. Very nicely done. Love the grain and the lighting. Good work.', '2003-10-06 12:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(440646, 40946, 327, '<td valign="top">lol This is a hoot. Wonderfully done. Only negative comment is the tight crop on the lower right. All in all this is fun, well executed and right on target for the challenge.</td>', 'lol This is a hoot. Wonderfully done. Only negative comment is the tight crop on the lower right. All in all this is fun, well executed and right on target for the challenge.', '2003-10-06 12:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(440648, 40637, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this one. Not crazy about the frame but that is a minor point. Very neat shot, neat light, and color.</td>', 'I like this one. Not crazy about the frame but that is a minor point. Very neat shot, neat light, and color.', '2003-10-06 12:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(440649, 40958, 8522, '<td valign="top">I''m really puzzled as to how you achieved this... inverting it doesn''t seem to make it any clearer! I really like the textures, idea and composition... the outline of the spider make it seem more primal than seeing an actual spider. 10</td>', 'I''m really puzzled as to how you achieved this... inverting it doesn''t seem to make it any clearer! I really like the textures, idea and composition... the outline of the spider make it seem more primal than seeing an actual spider. 10', '2003-10-06 12:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(440651, 40780, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very effective use of grain, excellent expression captured. Good use of light and shadow, excellent composition. 10</td>', 'Very effective use of grain, excellent expression captured. Good use of light and shadow, excellent composition. 10', '2003-10-06 12:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(440653, 40808, 8522, '<td valign="top">A very effective use of filter, the v shape at the nun''s waist is the icing on the cake. The overall effect is one of going mad with obsession and desire, and fits the challenge nicely. Black and white works well here. 10</td>', 'A very effective use of filter, the v shape at the nun''s waist is the icing on the cake. The overall effect is one of going mad with obsession and desire, and fits the challenge nicely. Black and white works well here. 10', '2003-10-06 12:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(440655, 40946, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great comical picture, with a lot of impact. Fantastic burnt out background. Good composition. Very imaginative. Shame about the glare on the shoes, but this is really a minor point. 10</td>', 'Great comical picture, with a lot of impact. Fantastic burnt out background. Good composition. Very imaginative. Shame about the glare on the shoes, but this is really a minor point. 10', '2003-10-06 12:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(440658, 40954, 8522, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, my favourite of the challenge. This is the best border I''ve seen on a photo at DPC, and really enhances the mood of the picture. Great idea for a dream... sex and photography! The fact that the woman has her back to the viewer really adds to the sense of mystery, along with the use of blue and rippley textures. The pictures on the wall are great, to me they represent the way that dreams have of uniting seperate elements that drift into consciousness. Excellent work. 10</td>', 'Lovely shot, my favourite of the challenge. This is the best border I''ve seen on a photo at DPC, and really enhances the mood of the picture. Great idea for a dream... sex and photography! The fact that the woman has her back to the viewer really adds to the sense of mystery, along with the use of blue and rippley textures. The pictures on the wall are great, to me they represent the way that dreams have of uniting seperate elements that drift into consciousness. Excellent work. 10', '2003-10-06 12:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(440663, 40971, 2223, '<td valign="top">NOOOOOOOOOOOOOO!!!!!!!!</td>', 'NOOOOOOOOOOOOOO!!!!!!!!', '2003-10-06 12:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(440665, 40890, 11793, '<td valign="top">her top is a bit over exposed<br/>spot metering -maybe?<br/> <br/>soup</td>', 'her top is a bit over exposedspot metering -maybe? soup', '2003-10-06 12:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(440681, 40733, 11793, '<td valign="top">i think the story goes that when you kiss the frog he turns into a prince<br/>remind me not to kiss you ;}<br/> <br/>soup</td>', 'i think the story goes that when you kiss the frog he turns into a princeremind me not to kiss you ;} soup', '2003-10-06 12:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(440683, 40870, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very original.  I wanna see the settings on this one.  The brickwork is really clear but not over exposed.  The moving person is disturbing...  Nicely done  Great balance between lighting and exposure!  8<br/>TC</td>', 'Very original.  I wanna see the settings on this one.  The brickwork is really clear but not over exposed.  The moving person is disturbing...  Nicely done  Great balance between lighting and exposure!  8TC', '2003-10-06 12:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
