(440687, 40741, 9906, '<td valign="top">Love the concept.  Decent execution.  GREAT focus!  What would Cool change???  Crop out more to the right to get the whole thumb.  And that one piece of green is very distractiong and changes the dark feeling for me at least!  Other than the one leaf I''m glad you kept what little color their is though.  My score is 7<br/>TC</td>', 'Love the concept.  Decent execution.  GREAT focus!  What would Cool change???  Crop out more to the right to get the whole thumb.  And that one piece of green is very distractiong and changes the dark feeling for me at least!  Other than the one leaf I''m glad you kept what little color their is though.  My score is 7TC', '2003-10-06 12:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(440690, 40946, 9441, '<td valign="top">good one.  I like the level and angle.  Good color clarity.  Fun photo, I think we''ve all probably dreamed this one before....</td>', 'good one.  I like the level and angle.  Good color clarity.  Fun photo, I think we''ve all probably dreamed this one before....', '2003-10-06 13:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(440691, 40749, 9441, '<td valign="top">nice effect, good color to portray this one...</td>', 'nice effect, good color to portray this one...', '2003-10-06 13:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(440693, 40870, 9441, '<td valign="top">awesome photo...I like the effect, and the color is exceptional...good job..a 10 in my opinion.</td>', 'awesome photo...I like the effect, and the color is exceptional...good job..a 10 in my opinion.', '2003-10-06 13:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
