(440996, 40933, 8522, '<td valign="top">Fabulous shot, full of character. Great textures and composition. Effective range of tones, I like the low key background. Great model, very effective. Reminds me of German expressionist silent films. My only quibble is that the man''s forehead looks a bit odd... there''s a bit too much tonal contrast there. Shame you can''t dodge and burn. Excellent work. 9</td>', 'Fabulous shot, full of character. Great textures and composition. Effective range of tones, I like the low key background. Great model, very effective. Reminds me of German expressionist silent films. My only quibble is that the man''s forehead looks a bit odd... there''s a bit too much tonal contrast there. Shame you can''t dodge and burn. Excellent work. 9', '2003-10-06 20:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(440997, 40831, 12131, '<td valign="top">I hope this is just the start and not the completion of that dream, otherwise, he''s not reaching very high.</td>', 'I hope this is just the start and not the completion of that dream, otherwise, he''s not reaching very high.', '2003-10-06 20:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(440998, 40576, 12131, '<td valign="top">Something about this shot is spooky.  While it is ordinary in appearance and I don''t honestly see the dream idea in it, I do think that the vacant look on her face and the focus on her seem to merit somewhat.  I just can''t put my finger on it.</td>', 'Something about this shot is spooky.  While it is ordinary in appearance and I don''t honestly see the dream idea in it, I do think that the vacant look on her face and the focus on her seem to merit somewhat.  I just can''t put my finger on it.', '2003-10-06 20:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(441000, 40946, 12131, '<td valign="top">You know, it''s not as bad as that, but I have actually woken up and gone to class completely forgetting my glasses until I realize that everything is blurry.  I guess that just tells you that you need more sleep, as with this guy here.  Funny picture.</td>', 'You know, it''s not as bad as that, but I have actually woken up and gone to class completely forgetting my glasses until I realize that everything is blurry.  I guess that just tells you that you need more sleep, as with this guy here.  Funny picture.', '2003-10-06 20:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(441001, 40846, 12131, '<td valign="top">Yeah, that does look like a painful nightmare.</td>', 'Yeah, that does look like a painful nightmare.', '2003-10-06 20:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(441002, 40643, 8522, '<td valign="top">At first, I was going to give this a six, but it grabbed my attention and grew on me as I pndered on it. I''m not sure the title really helps you here, I think there are all sorts of ways to interpret this which should be left to the viewer and I wonder how many people are going to limit their appreciation of the shot by relying on the title to make sense of it. The combination of black and white and vivid red is very effective. The use of light and shadow, both of the sillhouette and the shadow of the garment is great. I love the composition. There is something very vivid and dreamlike about this shot. The use of shadow and red really communicate the feel of raising repressed sexuality through a dream environment. Ambitious stuff. 8</td>', 'At first, I was going to give this a six, but it grabbed my attention and grew on me as I pndered on it. I''m not sure the title really helps you here, I think there are all sorts of ways to interpret this which should be left to the viewer and I wonder how many people are going to limit their appreciation of the shot by relying on the title to make sense of it. The combination of black and white and vivid red is very effective. The use of light and shadow, both of the sillhouette and the shadow of the garment is great. I love the composition. There is something very vivid and dreamlike about this shot. The use of shadow and red really communicate the feel of raising repressed sexuality through a dream environment. Ambitious stuff. 8', '2003-10-06 20:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(441004, 40974, 12131, '<td valign="top">Well done, the face within the image makes this look like someone who is really working the cosmos.  Very cool.</td>', 'Well done, the face within the image makes this look like someone who is really working the cosmos.  Very cool.', '2003-10-06 20:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(441006, 40971, 12131, '<td valign="top">Oh, I hope that doesn''t happen.  I like the color choice here, I can litterally just feel the sudden shock of finding something you love gone.  Nice computer by the way.</td>', 'Oh, I hope that doesn''t happen.  I like the color choice here, I can litterally just feel the sudden shock of finding something you love gone.  Nice computer by the way.', '2003-10-06 20:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
