(441094, 40470, 11506, '<td valign="top">The first thing I think of is laying on an operating table being probed and proded which is what I think you were trying to convey.  Which means you did a good job capturing it in my book.</td>', 'The first thing I think of is laying on an operating table being probed and proded which is what I think you were trying to convey.  Which means you did a good job capturing it in my book.', '2003-10-06 21:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
