(441097, 40545, 11506, '<td valign="top">I like this.  This image causes your eyes to travel around the entire shot.  I notice the girl sitting up first then laying down, and the stalker comes into view after your eyes leave the girl in the bed. The only thing I''m not too keen on is the size of the stalker relative to everything else in the shot.</td>', 'I like this.  This image causes your eyes to travel around the entire shot.  I notice the girl sitting up first then laying down, and the stalker comes into view after your eyes leave the girl in the bed. The only thing I''m not too keen on is the size of the stalker relative to everything else in the shot.', '2003-10-06 21:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(441100, 40673, 11506, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot.  I love the way the way the dock/bridge winds back from the near side.</td>', 'beautiful shot.  I love the way the way the dock/bridge winds back from the near side.', '2003-10-06 21:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(441101, 40529, 11506, '<td valign="top">HOLY ZOOM BATMAN!  And what forklift do you use to hold the lens on that camera?  I''m assuming this is through a telescope.  Seriously though, this is a great shot.  Something out of a NASA mission book.  wow.</td>', 'HOLY ZOOM BATMAN!  And what forklift do you use to hold the lens on that camera?  I''m assuming this is through a telescope.  Seriously though, this is a great shot.  Something out of a NASA mission book.  wow.', '2003-10-06 21:49:06.000000', NULL, 1);
