(441134, 40833, 10263, '<td valign="top">Makes me dizzy. At first glance I didn''t think I liked this photo but as I look at it longer I realize its fantastic. It certainly has the desired effect on me. The grass looks fairly soft but I still hope I wake up before I hit!! I hope you will explain how you did this.  10</td>', 'Makes me dizzy. At first glance I didn''t think I liked this photo but as I look at it longer I realize its fantastic. It certainly has the desired effect on me. The grass looks fairly soft but I still hope I wake up before I hit!! I hope you will explain how you did this.  10', '2003-10-06 22:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
