(441601, 40949, 11283, '<td valign="top">I, too consider ketchup a salvation. Seriously though, this picture would have more punch if the hand were dangling along the side of a porcelin bath tub, blood dripping on the floor. That simple pose would show the viewer that the subject is dead or dying and give a sense of direction. RIght now the image shows a red mess. It looks less like a suicide attempt and more like finger painting. IMHO.</td>', 'I, too consider ketchup a salvation. Seriously though, this picture would have more punch if the hand were dangling along the side of a porcelin bath tub, blood dripping on the floor. That simple pose would show the viewer that the subject is dead or dying and give a sense of direction. RIght now the image shows a red mess. It looks less like a suicide attempt and more like finger painting. IMHO.', '2003-10-07 15:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(441602, 40444, 11283, '<td valign="top">Weird and funny.</td>', 'Weird and funny.', '2003-10-07 15:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(441603, 40545, 11283, '<td valign="top">Cool idea but the even lighing makes it look like she sleeps with the light on. Maybe some bright light through a slightly ajar door would add to the realism.</td>', 'Cool idea but the even lighing makes it look like she sleeps with the light on. Maybe some bright light through a slightly ajar door would add to the realism.', '2003-10-07 15:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(441604, 40780, 2764, '<td valign="top">I love this photo - the light is exquisite, the graininess reminds me of black and whte TV from my childhood.  This is a really scary image.  His eye is the focal point but his ear  is almost equally emphasized.  His mouth, careful not to make a sound, forms the third point of a triangle which in turn is cut by the shadow - Lots of great leading lines here especially the lineof his gaze which leads, not off the photo but somewhere out in front of it.  I like that the shadow is formlless, makes it much scarier if you let the view supply his own personal terror. 10</td>', 'I love this photo - the light is exquisite, the graininess reminds me of black and whte TV from my childhood.  This is a really scary image.  His eye is the focal point but his ear  is almost equally emphasized.  His mouth, careful not to make a sound, forms the third point of a triangle which in turn is cut by the shadow - Lots of great leading lines here especially the lineof his gaze which leads, not off the photo but somewhere out in front of it.  I like that the shadow is formlless, makes it much scarier if you let the view supply his own personal terror. 10', '2003-10-07 15:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(441606, 40930, 11283, '<td valign="top">Wow you are probably gonna get a lot of neg comments with this one...but I like the photos that make you think, even if it''s anger or revulsion. I Think what would have made this more efective is using the available light and not the flash. It pulls the reality out of the photo.</td>', 'Wow you are probably gonna get a lot of neg comments with this one...but I like the photos that make you think, even if it''s anger or revulsion. I Think what would have made this more efective is using the available light and not the flash. It pulls the reality out of the photo.', '2003-10-07 15:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(441614, 40779, 2764, '<td valign="top">This is so pretty - and moody.  I suppose it could fit either the dream or the nightmare.  To be it seems very peaceful.  9</td>', 'This is so pretty - and moody.  I suppose it could fit either the dream or the nightmare.  To be it seems very peaceful.  9', '2003-10-07 15:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(441619, 40936, 10720, '<td valign="top">My husband said if I was a guy I would get this. Guess I have to take his word for it.</td>', 'My husband said if I was a guy I would get this. Guess I have to take his word for it.', '2003-10-07 15:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(441620, 40503, 2764, '<td valign="top">this is so wierd - it looks like it''s a set for a movie and those things are animated.  It is impossible for me to tell the scale.  They could be as tall as trees or as short as moss stems or anything in between.  Very effective sureal image. 8</td>', 'this is so wierd - it looks like it''s a set for a movie and those things are animated.  It is impossible for me to tell the scale.  They could be as tall as trees or as short as moss stems or anything in between.  Very effective sureal image. 8', '2003-10-07 15:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(441623, 40172, 2764, '<td valign="top">This is very very scarey.  It looks like I am cought under the ice and can''t find the way out.  I like the smokey dark border around the edges, it works to close the image in and adds to the trapped feeling - 8</td>', 'This is very very scarey.  It looks like I am cought under the ice and can''t find the way out.  I like the smokey dark border around the edges, it works to close the image in and adds to the trapped feeling - 8', '2003-10-07 15:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(441629, 40708, 6477, '<td valign="top">Terrific idea... a real nightmare for some women!:) <br/>The excecution is pretty good, the light and crop are perfect. And the model is for sure a great actress!!</td>', 'Terrific idea... a real nightmare for some women!:) The excecution is pretty good, the light and crop are perfect. And the model is for sure a great actress!!', '2003-10-07 15:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(441636, 40637, 10151, '<td valign="top">Noooooooooooooooooooooooooo..............</td>', 'Noooooooooooooooooooooooooo..............', '2003-10-07 16:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(441641, 40722, 2883, '<td valign="top">The photo is too dark and a bit out of focus. Its also difficult to tell if there is even a bed there. Maybe someone lifting a cover to find the monster would help this scene.</td>', 'The photo is too dark and a bit out of focus. Its also difficult to tell if there is even a bed there. Maybe someone lifting a cover to find the monster would help this scene.', '2003-10-07 16:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(441643, 40503, 2883, '<td valign="top">This could be a very interesting photo if the depth of field was set to blur the trees in the background. The photo as a whole appears overly sharpened.</td>', 'This could be a very interesting photo if the depth of field was set to blur the trees in the background. The photo as a whole appears overly sharpened.', '2003-10-07 16:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(441646, 40784, 2883, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea, but there''s just too much dark space. The subject is so far away from the camera that it''s hard to tell what''s going on.</td>', 'This is a good idea, but there''s just too much dark space. The subject is so far away from the camera that it''s hard to tell what''s going on.', '2003-10-07 16:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(441671, 40946, 11283, '<td valign="top">Hehe-great idea and photo. One crit would be the crop of the left toe. Other than that-great!</td>', 'Hehe-great idea and photo. One crit would be the crop of the left toe. Other than that-great!', '2003-10-07 16:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(441673, 40870, 3846, '<td valign="top">Scared me.  Save for Halloween.</td>', 'Scared me.  Save for Halloween.', '2003-10-07 16:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
