(441686, 40470, 11283, '<td valign="top">At first I didn''t get it, then hey I was like COOL! Ceative.</td>', 'At first I didn''t get it, then hey I was like COOL! Ceative.', '2003-10-07 17:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(441688, 40743, 11283, '<td valign="top">cool</td>', 'cool', '2003-10-07 17:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(441695, 40936, 2764, '<td valign="top">This is nice- It is almost but not quite great.  She feels very crowded at the top, why is it cropped so close to her head?? and she feels a littlee crowded at the bottom, a little more room would make the cloud like feling better,  Also what''s with the foot stool.  couldn''t that be moved out of the way?  or is it supposed to be a bed?  Maybe if it was white it wouldn''t dominate that corner of the photo so much.  The rest I love- I like the glint on her ring and bracelt that matches the glint on her shoes.  I like the way her hair looks like the feathers on her wings.  I like the smokey cloudy background.  I wonder if you could have done more with er pose - she looks a little slouchy. 7</td>', 'This is nice- It is almost but not quite great.  She feels very crowded at the top, why is it cropped so close to her head?? and she feels a littlee crowded at the bottom, a little more room would make the cloud like feling better,  Also what''s with the foot stool.  couldn''t that be moved out of the way?  or is it supposed to be a bed?  Maybe if it was white it wouldn''t dominate that corner of the photo so much.  The rest I love- I like the glint on her ring and bracelt that matches the glint on her shoes.  I like the way her hair looks like the feathers on her wings.  I like the smokey cloudy background.  I wonder if you could have done more with er pose - she looks a little slouchy. 7', '2003-10-07 17:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(441717, 40977, 8624, '<td valign="top">I love the composition here. The hand pressed against the glass is very effective where you have placed it in the bottom of the frame. The splayed fingers and fingertips pressed against the glass convey emotion well. good use of negative space.</td>', 'I love the composition here. The hand pressed against the glass is very effective where you have placed it in the bottom of the frame. The splayed fingers and fingertips pressed against the glass convey emotion well. good use of negative space.', '2003-10-07 19:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(441724, 40708, 2130, '<td valign="top">fantastic job, great idea...10</td>', 'fantastic job, great idea...10', '2003-10-07 19:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(441739, 40667, 7364, '<td valign="top">I can''t vote but honorary 10!</td>', 'I can''t vote but honorary 10!', '2003-10-07 19:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(441750, 40833, 10077, '<td valign="top">Very nice effect. You can really feel like falling when watching the picture.  My favorite.</td>', 'Very nice effect. You can really feel like falling when watching the picture.  My favorite.', '2003-10-07 19:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(441805, 40960, 12076, '<td valign="top">Well executed.   Very minor, but I would have removed the water bottle and fireplace tools from the bottom left...   8</td>', 'Well executed.   Very minor, but I would have removed the water bottle and fireplace tools from the bottom left...   8', '2003-10-07 21:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(441890, 40960, 7350, '<td valign="top">Lots of people used this effect, but this is my favorite.  Very well done.  I think my only gripe would be the water bottle in front of the fireplace, and maybe the fireplace tools there on the left.  10 from me.</td>', 'Lots of people used this effect, but this is my favorite.  Very well done.  I think my only gripe would be the water bottle in front of the fireplace, and maybe the fireplace tools there on the left.  10 from me.', '2003-10-07 23:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(441891, 40936, 7350, '<td valign="top">Excellent toning and composition.  Very well done.  10.  The soft focus is very effective to give it a dream-like feel.</td>', 'Excellent toning and composition.  Very well done.  10.  The soft focus is very effective to give it a dream-like feel.', '2003-10-07 23:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(441892, 40470, 11800, '<td valign="top">Like how it''s a little akilter. All the circles. Looking up as if into a spaceship.  <br/>Don''t like the color fringing, might have avoided it with a lower ev or a less sunny day or later time in the day. The washed out sky and colors. Seems to be overexposed. 5</td>', 'Like how it''s a little akilter. All the circles. Looking up as if into a spaceship.  Don''t like the color fringing, might have avoided it with a lower ev or a less sunny day or later time in the day. The washed out sky and colors. Seems to be overexposed. 5', '2003-10-07 23:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(441894, 40780, 7350, '<td valign="top">I really hope this places.  I know I''ve been having nightmares about it since I first saw it.  The graininess is perfect and the shadow is fantastic.  The expression on his face is absolutely haunting.  Very well done.  I wish I could give it an 11.  Congratulations.</td>', 'I really hope this places.  I know I''ve been having nightmares about it since I first saw it.  The graininess is perfect and the shadow is fantastic.  The expression on his face is absolutely haunting.  Very well done.  I wish I could give it an 11.  Congratulations.', '2003-10-07 23:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(441896, 40947, 11800, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  Hard to comment. Don''t know what you were trying to express.  One thing for sure, the background doesn''t help at all.</td>', 'Hmmm.  Hard to comment. Don''t know what you were trying to express.  One thing for sure, the background doesn''t help at all.', '2003-10-07 23:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(441897, 40954, 7350, '<td valign="top">Very surreal.  I like the toning and the border. 9.</td>', 'Very surreal.  I like the toning and the border. 9.', '2003-10-07 23:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(441898, 40211, 7350, '<td valign="top">This is indeed a stunning sunrise.  The reflection is wonderful, and the clouds/tree provide a lovely composition.  9.</td>', 'This is indeed a stunning sunrise.  The reflection is wonderful, and the clouds/tree provide a lovely composition.  9.', '2003-10-07 23:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(441901, 40868, 7350, '<td valign="top">Nice coloring of the water.  It gives it a very dreamlike feel.  9.</td>', 'Nice coloring of the water.  It gives it a very dreamlike feel.  9.', '2003-10-07 23:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(441902, 40755, 7350, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning.  I really like the creative title, too.  9 from me.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning.  I really like the creative title, too.  9 from me.', '2003-10-07 23:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(441904, 40863, 7350, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how others are viewing this, but I''m giving it a 9.  I love the composition.  I used to drive a car that looked about this hard to keep running!  It was indeed a nightmare.</td>', 'I''m not sure how others are viewing this, but I''m giving it a 9.  I love the composition.  I used to drive a car that looked about this hard to keep running!  It was indeed a nightmare.', '2003-10-07 23:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(441906, 40576, 7350, '<td valign="top">I hope others are seeing this the way I am.  The plane of focus and the depth of field are perfectly placed.  I like that the boy is out of focus, the girl in focus, and the background neatly blurred.  I like that I can''t see the top of the boy''s head, or even his eyes.  I like the colors, and I think their clothes are very appropriate.  This is a 9 from me.  Congratulations.</td>', 'I hope others are seeing this the way I am.  The plane of focus and the depth of field are perfectly placed.  I like that the boy is out of focus, the girl in focus, and the background neatly blurred.  I like that I can''t see the top of the boy''s head, or even his eyes.  I like the colors, and I think their clothes are very appropriate.  This is a 9 from me.  Congratulations.', '2003-10-07 23:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(441908, 40673, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nice job. The light part of the water on the left looks like a monster. The crooked pier fading from lightness to darkness really makes me feel apprehensive. The way it seems to go on forever in the frame also works really well.  I want to see the other entries before I decide, but this just might be a winner. The only thing I don''t like is being able to see part of the horizon where the water meets the background. Wouldn''t mind if if was more/less visable.</td>', 'Nice job. The light part of the water on the left looks like a monster. The crooked pier fading from lightness to darkness really makes me feel apprehensive. The way it seems to go on forever in the frame also works really well.  I want to see the other entries before I decide, but this just might be a winner. The only thing I don''t like is being able to see part of the horizon where the water meets the background. Wouldn''t mind if if was more/less visable.', '2003-10-07 23:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(441909, 40960, 10170, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this photo!<br/> <br/>I would be very interesed in knowing quite how it was done.  I am assuming a loooong apperture and then you jumped into the shot briefly.  If so then any chance of a guideline as to times involved?  If not then how done?<br/> <br/>Excellent!</td>', 'I absolutely love this photo! I would be very interesed in knowing quite how it was done.  I am assuming a loooong apperture and then you jumped into the shot briefly.  If so then any chance of a guideline as to times involved?  If not then how done? Excellent!', '2003-10-07 23:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(441912, 40922, 7350, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  Frightning.  Whatever is on the ground behind "him" really improves the composition.  8 from me.</td>', 'Very well done.  Frightning.  Whatever is on the ground behind "him" really improves the composition.  8 from me.', '2003-10-07 23:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(441913, 40673, 10170, '<td valign="top">Very clever, that really does depict anxiety for me.</td>', 'Very clever, that really does depict anxiety for me.', '2003-10-07 23:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(441916, 40337, 7350, '<td valign="top">This is scary.  I like the detail you have shown on the doll''s one eye.  that''s what really makes this nightmare-ish.  Good shot!  8.</td>', 'This is scary.  I like the detail you have shown on the doll''s one eye.  that''s what really makes this nightmare-ish.  Good shot!  8.', '2003-10-07 23:37:43.000000', NULL, 1);
