(441927, 40708, 7350, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  Skin tones are even and well highlighted.  I only hope this didn''t really happen to her!  8 from me.</td>', 'Very well done.  Skin tones are even and well highlighted.  I only hope this didn''t really happen to her!  8 from me.', '2003-10-07 23:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
