(441929, 40935, 7350, '<td valign="top">Well done.  I think this is my own nightmare, not just my parents''!  8.  B/W is a good choice.</td>', 'Well done.  I think this is my own nightmare, not just my parents''!  8.  B/W is a good choice.', '2003-10-07 23:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(441930, 40935, 11800, '<td valign="top">The dark hidden face really works to show how invisible runaways become in society. Did you do that on purpose? I like how the men are walking away from him. It is really sharp too.<br/>I don''t like the stick with the cup on it.  I don''t live in a big city, so I wouldn''t know about the prop(money cup?), but it just doesn''t look right.</td>', 'The dark hidden face really works to show how invisible runaways become in society. Did you do that on purpose? I like how the men are walking away from him. It is really sharp too.I don''t like the stick with the cup on it.  I don''t live in a big city, so I wouldn''t know about the prop(money cup?), but it just doesn''t look right.', '2003-10-07 23:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(441931, 40844, 7350, '<td valign="top">Well done.  The nice window in the background depicts a very serene setting, but you have contrasted it very nicely with the forground.  Great shot!  8.</td>', 'Well done.  The nice window in the background depicts a very serene setting, but you have contrasted it very nicely with the forground.  Great shot!  8.', '2003-10-07 23:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(441932, 40733, 7350, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Good focus and texture.  I think your model has just a touch too much makeup on!  8.</td>', 'Nicely done.  Good focus and texture.  I think your model has just a touch too much makeup on!  8.', '2003-10-07 23:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(441933, 40833, 7350, '<td valign="top">Great effect!  I''d like to know how this was done.  8.</td>', 'Great effect!  I''d like to know how this was done.  8.', '2003-10-07 23:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(441934, 40545, 7350, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  I looked twice before I saw the knife guy in the back!  Very scarey.  8.</td>', 'Nicely done.  I looked twice before I saw the knife guy in the back!  Very scarey.  8.', '2003-10-07 23:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(441935, 40789, 7350, '<td valign="top">I like this one.  It''s the nightmare express!  The toning makes it fit the challenge very well, and the composition is right on.  8.</td>', 'I like this one.  It''s the nightmare express!  The toning makes it fit the challenge very well, and the composition is right on.  8.', '2003-10-07 23:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
