(443288, 40730, 10263, '<td valign="top">Interesting shaped tree. There is a lot of compression residue about the limbs. I can''t tell you how to prevent that, but if you post it in the forums after the challenge is over, I''m sure someone could tell you what you are doing wrong.  Its a good composition, so keep trying.</td>', 'Interesting shaped tree. There is a lot of compression residue about the limbs. I can''t tell you how to prevent that, but if you post it in the forums after the challenge is over, I''m sure someone could tell you what you are doing wrong.  Its a good composition, so keep trying.', '2003-10-08 13:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
