(443305, 40808, 10263, '<td valign="top">No, I don\''t think so. Doesn''''t do anything for me. It would be good to keep working on the technique and find something that really works though. Lots of possibilities. Mirrors?</td>', 'No, I don\''t think so. Doesn''''t do anything for me. It would be good to keep working on the technique and find something that really works though. Lots of possibilities. Mirrors?', '2003-10-08 14:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
