(443699, 40527, 6870, '<td valign="top">Negative space works well  here to imply further mystery and space; the demon guy is a bit dark for my tastes, though even though it is supposed to be. Perhaps some of the darkness can be implied and suggested rather than actually demonstrated? Well, nice work and composition.</td>', 'Negative space works well  here to imply further mystery and space; the demon guy is a bit dark for my tastes, though even though it is supposed to be. Perhaps some of the darkness can be implied and suggested rather than actually demonstrated? Well, nice work and composition.', '2003-10-08 17:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(443705, 40690, 6870, '<td valign="top">The sky here is lovely and, though dramatic, it does not really contribute to a tormented feel for me. Your use of sillhouette is very  nice here; perhaps a different object sillhouetted would work better to convey a tormented mood: a twisted tree, or dead branches or something? I''m also just a bit colorblind, so may be missing some colors that lead to a tormented mood.</td>', 'The sky here is lovely and, though dramatic, it does not really contribute to a tormented feel for me. Your use of sillhouette is very  nice here; perhaps a different object sillhouetted would work better to convey a tormented mood: a twisted tree, or dead branches or something? I''m also just a bit colorblind, so may be missing some colors that lead to a tormented mood.', '2003-10-08 17:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(443706, 40434, 6870, '<td valign="top">That little motion blur is sure nice. I like the special effects here. Nice tensive body posture on the fleeing man.</td>', 'That little motion blur is sure nice. I like the special effects here. Nice tensive body posture on the fleeing man.', '2003-10-08 17:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(443709, 40722, 6870, '<td valign="top">Aha! So THAT''s what it looks like! This image has a nice, dark mood to it. The whimsy present in the obviously fake monster is an interesting choice. Perhaps putting this monster on a third, off center, would add even more drama and exaggeration.</td>', 'Aha! So THAT''s what it looks like! This image has a nice, dark mood to it. The whimsy present in the obviously fake monster is an interesting choice. Perhaps putting this monster on a third, off center, would add even more drama and exaggeration.', '2003-10-08 17:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(443710, 40708, 6870, '<td valign="top">Bummer. She''s a pretty good actor! Nice point of view. You could go in even closer, perhaps, for even more mood.</td>', 'Bummer. She''s a pretty good actor! Nice point of view. You could go in even closer, perhaps, for even more mood.', '2003-10-08 17:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(443713, 40537, 6870, '<td valign="top">The tones and colors of this image add to a mysterious, nightmarish mood. I must admit to some confusion over the title and what I''m actually seeing. But then again, I''m pretty dense, sometimes.</td>', 'The tones and colors of this image add to a mysterious, nightmarish mood. I must admit to some confusion over the title and what I''m actually seeing. But then again, I''m pretty dense, sometimes.', '2003-10-08 17:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(443714, 40885, 6870, '<td valign="top">A fish eating a fisherman; I can certainly see a trout dreaming of that! Nice point of view, though I''d sure like to see the angler in as much focus as the fish for the illusion to be complete.</td>', 'A fish eating a fisherman; I can certainly see a trout dreaming of that! Nice point of view, though I''d sure like to see the angler in as much focus as the fish for the illusion to be complete.', '2003-10-08 17:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(443715, 40925, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of clouds to evoke mood and interest.</td>', 'Very nice use of clouds to evoke mood and interest.', '2003-10-08 17:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(443717, 40956, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract. Colors and lines add up to a feeling of . . . hmmm . . . I''m not sure. I like the look, though.</td>', 'Interesting abstract. Colors and lines add up to a feeling of . . . hmmm . . . I''m not sure. I like the look, though.', '2003-10-08 17:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(443721, 40977, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is like a mime, but this person really IS locked in! Colors add to the sense of drama, and the off center hand creates some negative space that implies the rest of the scene.</td>', 'This is like a mime, but this person really IS locked in! Colors add to the sense of drama, and the off center hand creates some negative space that implies the rest of the scene.', '2003-10-08 17:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(443724, 40348, 6870, '<td valign="top">While you''re up there, check on Quasimodo for me. Nice tones in this shot are dark and imply a sense of danger. The lines lead to the central door, though, and not to the bell tower; is this where you want my attention to go?</td>', 'While you''re up there, check on Quasimodo for me. Nice tones in this shot are dark and imply a sense of danger. The lines lead to the central door, though, and not to the bell tower; is this where you want my attention to go?', '2003-10-08 17:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(443727, 40973, 6870, '<td valign="top">A school where one learns how to dream? Or a school that you could go to if your dreams could come true? Either way, I like the sillouhette-framing effect.</td>', 'A school where one learns how to dream? Or a school that you could go to if your dreams could come true? Either way, I like the sillouhette-framing effect.', '2003-10-08 17:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(443728, 40545, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice work here. The visual clarity for this technique is impressive!</td>', 'Nice work here. The visual clarity for this technique is impressive!', '2003-10-08 17:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(443732, 40946, 6870, '<td valign="top">Ha! Clever one, this. Have you tried the legs in front of office furniture or other office artifacts?</td>', 'Ha! Clever one, this. Have you tried the legs in front of office furniture or other office artifacts?', '2003-10-08 17:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(443736, 40915, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot of pumpkins! The Depth of Field is so nice here, and the lines and shapes are so well captured.</td>', 'Very nice shot of pumpkins! The Depth of Field is so nice here, and the lines and shapes are so well captured.', '2003-10-08 17:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(443738, 40445, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interesting effects! I like the colors you''ve applied.</td>', 'Interesting effects! I like the colors you''ve applied.', '2003-10-08 17:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(443740, 40930, 6870, '<td valign="top">So true. how long did he have to hold his breath for this shot! I can hear you: "Just one more time, son!" "Awwww Mom! (or Dad)" Nice composition; the arm outside the tub is a good touch.</td>', 'So true. how long did he have to hold his breath for this shot! I can hear you: "Just one more time, son!" "Awwww Mom! (or Dad)" Nice composition; the arm outside the tub is a good touch.', '2003-10-08 17:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(443743, 40509, 6870, '<td valign="top">The light is a bit harsh on this, but a fun idea! I like how you''ve used the lovely sky as a background.</td>', 'The light is a bit harsh on this, but a fun idea! I like how you''ve used the lovely sky as a background.', '2003-10-08 17:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(443744, 40919, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast of tree and sword. Interesting photo!</td>', 'Nice contrast of tree and sword. Interesting photo!', '2003-10-08 17:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(443746, 40933, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice, dark tones contrast well with the lighter face.</td>', 'Nice, dark tones contrast well with the lighter face.', '2003-10-08 17:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(443755, 40789, 6870, '<td valign="top">Must be a dream. Interesting effects that do imply something mysterious and even exciting.</td>', 'Must be a dream. Interesting effects that do imply something mysterious and even exciting.', '2003-10-08 17:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(443756, 40972, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice contrasts of figure and sky, colors and tones.</td>', 'Nice contrasts of figure and sky, colors and tones.', '2003-10-08 17:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(443758, 40658, 6870, '<td valign="top">Now this is a good little actress! I love the tones in this image, and the composition. Her face is priceless!</td>', 'Now this is a good little actress! I love the tones in this image, and the composition. Her face is priceless!', '2003-10-08 17:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(443761, 40947, 6870, '<td valign="top">The background stripes is a very interesting and unexpected choice. Bizarre image, but it does elicit a dark mood!</td>', 'The background stripes is a very interesting and unexpected choice. Bizarre image, but it does elicit a dark mood!', '2003-10-08 17:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(443764, 40958, 6870, '<td valign="top">This has a painterly feel to it, that I like. Nice, moody shot.</td>', 'This has a painterly feel to it, that I like. Nice, moody shot.', '2003-10-08 17:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(443987, 40833, 7778, '<td valign="top">Not your average photo.<br/> <br/>In my wildest dreams, I cannot imagine a more succesful rendition of the sensation of falling. The effects of viewing this remarkable shot are almost physical!<br/> <br/>Since my stock measuring tools (for evaluating images) have been rendered absolutely ineffective if not ridiculed by the manner of this shot, I am voting with heart: &gt; 10 minus 1 (for what I consider a redundant coloured border) &gt; 9    <br/> <br/></td>', 'Not your average photo. In my wildest dreams, I cannot imagine a more succesful rendition of the sensation of falling. The effects of viewing this remarkable shot are almost physical! Since my stock measuring tools (for evaluating images) have been rendered absolutely ineffective if not ridiculed by the manner of this shot, I am voting with heart: > 10 minus 1 (for what I consider a redundant coloured border) > 9     ', '2003-10-08 19:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(443996, 40833, 6234, '<td valign="top">OMG !!! when i came to this pic as it opened it felt like i was falling i had to pull away from the screen in a jerking movement, i totally thought i was falling !! GREAT JOB MAN !!! I HOPE YOU WIN, TOTALLY COOL !!</td>', 'OMG !!! when i came to this pic as it opened it felt like i was falling i had to pull away from the screen in a jerking movement, i totally thought i was falling !! GREAT JOB MAN !!! I HOPE YOU WIN, TOTALLY COOL !!', '2003-10-08 20:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(444036, 40780, 6521, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the execution but i don´t like the coarseness in the photo. - 5</td>', 'I like the idea and the execution but i don´t like the coarseness in the photo. - 5', '2003-10-08 20:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(444038, 40900, 7778, '<td valign="top">A very capable treatment, both technically and artistically. <br/> <br/>The strong contrast in a b and w photo, however, evokes a somewhat photo-journalistic/documentary feeling, which would accomodate a nightmare better than a dream-like impression. The precise lighting, too, appears to point a greater concern for accuracy than for suggestion or conjecture.<br/> <br/>Both subject and setting (plain, almost shabby house or cabin; the rustic, hands-on partial man in denims and work boots) portrayed in this manner, instead lead the viewer to expect ''a job needed doing'', i.e. a resolve rather than a nightmare. ??<br/> <br/>In the end, my choice is to rate the dignity of this photograph rather than its effective topicality.</td>', 'A very capable treatment, both technically and artistically.  The strong contrast in a b and w photo, however, evokes a somewhat photo-journalistic/documentary feeling, which would accomodate a nightmare better than a dream-like impression. The precise lighting, too, appears to point a greater concern for accuracy than for suggestion or conjecture. Both subject and setting (plain, almost shabby house or cabin; the rustic, hands-on partial man in denims and work boots) portrayed in this manner, instead lead the viewer to expect ''a job needed doing'', i.e. a resolve rather than a nightmare. ?? In the end, my choice is to rate the dignity of this photograph rather than its effective topicality.', '2003-10-08 20:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(444049, 40545, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great idea. The relative exposure times of the two shots is just right. The motion blur on the model with the knife is perfect. My only complaint is that the two photos interfere with each other too much. It would be better if the sitting-up face was back a bit so it didn''t get bisected by the window frame. But even more, the image would portray "dream" better if the laying-down model wasn''t "ghosted" by shooting the attack photo against a black background. I realize that doing that in-camera is a tall challenge!</td>', 'Great idea. The relative exposure times of the two shots is just right. The motion blur on the model with the knife is perfect. My only complaint is that the two photos interfere with each other too much. It would be better if the sitting-up face was back a bit so it didn''t get bisected by the window frame. But even more, the image would portray "dream" better if the laying-down model wasn''t "ghosted" by shooting the attack photo against a black background. I realize that doing that in-camera is a tall challenge!', '2003-10-08 20:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(444054, 40936, 6521, '<td valign="top">halfnaked woman in a bra, high heels and pantyhose as an angel?<br/>i´m not buying it..</td>', 'halfnaked woman in a bra, high heels and pantyhose as an angel?i´m not buying it..', '2003-10-08 20:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
