(444179, 40833, 10461, '<td valign="top">woah, truly dizzying!</td>', 'woah, truly dizzying!', '2003-10-08 21:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(444191, 40862, 11738, '<td valign="top">This is SO freaky!  Love the oversaturated greens in the forest canopy.</td>', 'This is SO freaky!  Love the oversaturated greens in the forest canopy.', '2003-10-08 21:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(444249, 40946, 5112, '<td valign="top">LOVE IT!  This is a nightmare to which I can relate (even though I''m a woman, and my nightmare would look a bit different).  Excellent entry to the challenge.  My shoes are never that polished.  I like the little gold band at the top of the socks.  ~10</td>', 'LOVE IT!  This is a nightmare to which I can relate (even though I''m a woman, and my nightmare would look a bit different).  Excellent entry to the challenge.  My shoes are never that polished.  I like the little gold band at the top of the socks.  ~10', '2003-10-08 22:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(444250, 40755, 5112, '<td valign="top">Wow, beautiful!  I wish all my dreams were this beautiful! ~10</td>', 'Wow, beautiful!  I wish all my dreams were this beautiful! ~10', '2003-10-08 22:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(444252, 40493, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture of your dog!  I LOVE the colours, and the dog has such a wonderful expression.  ~9</td>', 'Beautiful picture of your dog!  I LOVE the colours, and the dog has such a wonderful expression.  ~9', '2003-10-08 22:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(444253, 40735, 5112, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Good job!  It\''s a nightmare alright. ~8</td>', 'Wow!  Good job!  It\''s a nightmare alright. ~8', '2003-10-08 22:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(444256, 40211, 5112, '<td valign="top">Well, you did!  It''s beautiful!  It looks so peaceful.  I love the foggy patches.  Good work! ~9</td>', 'Well, you did!  It''s beautiful!  It looks so peaceful.  I love the foggy patches.  Good work! ~9', '2003-10-08 22:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(444260, 40779, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  I just love \"foggy\" pictures, and this one is very nice.  I can smell the woods in this picture. ~9</td>', 'Beautiful!  I just love \"foggy\" pictures, and this one is very nice.  I can smell the woods in this picture. ~9', '2003-10-08 22:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(444263, 40503, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like it!  The title is great, and the picture goes with it well.  Good entry! ~8</td>', 'I like it!  The title is great, and the picture goes with it well.  Good entry! ~8', '2003-10-08 22:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(444267, 40780, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like it!  The graininess works well here, the b/w is good, and the boy''s expression excellent.  Good work!  ~10</td>', 'I like it!  The graininess works well here, the b/w is good, and the boy''s expression excellent.  Good work!  ~10', '2003-10-08 22:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(444271, 40930, 5112, '<td valign="top">Ouch!  That really is a nightmare!  This picture is almost too realistic to look at for any lenght of time.  Good entry.</td>', 'Ouch!  That really is a nightmare!  This picture is almost too realistic to look at for any lenght of time.  Good entry.', '2003-10-08 22:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(444282, 40667, 11800, '<td valign="top">Cool effect.  Don''t know how you did it, but very cool. Monitor and mirror? 8</td>', 'Cool effect.  Don''t know how you did it, but very cool. Monitor and mirror? 8', '2003-10-08 22:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(444286, 40844, 11800, '<td valign="top">The doll is too doll like. If it was a little more see thru and the background a little darker, it would have been better. I admire your attempt.</td>', 'The doll is too doll like. If it was a little more see thru and the background a little darker, it would have been better. I admire your attempt.', '2003-10-08 23:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(444299, 40457, 11800, '<td valign="top">I think I would like this more if there was more distance from the woman. I want to see more of her and the train to be able to place the whole picture in context. The model has a convincing expression. She is soft and so is the train. Fun, but needs more work.</td>', 'I think I would like this more if there was more distance from the woman. I want to see more of her and the train to be able to place the whole picture in context. The model has a convincing expression. She is soft and so is the train. Fun, but needs more work.', '2003-10-08 23:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(444306, 40960, 11487, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  Very emotionall charged.</td>', 'Great photo.  Very emotionall charged.', '2003-10-08 23:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(444308, 40545, 11487, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  I hope I never have a night like that.</td>', 'Great photo.  I hope I never have a night like that.', '2003-10-08 23:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(444312, 40529, 11487, '<td valign="top">Great moon shot.  I love the detail.</td>', 'Great moon shot.  I love the detail.', '2003-10-08 23:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(444321, 40949, 11487, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  I''m glad to be on the salvation side. Thank you Jesus!</td>', 'Nice picture.  I''m glad to be on the salvation side. Thank you Jesus!', '2003-10-08 23:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(444324, 40779, 11487, '<td valign="top">Nice dreamy effect with the fog.</td>', 'Nice dreamy effect with the fog.', '2003-10-08 23:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(444325, 40974, 11800, '<td valign="top">It took me the longest time to see that the ball extends almost to the left side. Really great framing and composition and lighting. Especially the lighting. Good concept, expertly executed. You earned a 10. When you can edit it, darken the spot on his nose.</td>', 'It took me the longest time to see that the ball extends almost to the left side. Really great framing and composition and lighting. Especially the lighting. Good concept, expertly executed. You earned a 10. When you can edit it, darken the spot on his nose.', '2003-10-08 23:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(444327, 40833, 11487, '<td valign="top">Good image.  You can feel the movement.</td>', 'Good image.  You can feel the movement.', '2003-10-08 23:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(444340, 40689, 11487, '<td valign="top">A little too dark for me.  More detail would help.</td>', 'A little too dark for me.  More detail would help.', '2003-10-08 23:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(444341, 40975, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nice hair. Her pose doesn''t add anything to the photo.</td>', 'Nice hair. Her pose doesn''t add anything to the photo.', '2003-10-08 23:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(444346, 40946, 11487, '<td valign="top">This is funny.  I hope this never happens to me.</td>', 'This is funny.  I hope this never happens to me.', '2003-10-08 23:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(444349, 40337, 11487, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in this.  Good job.</td>', 'I like the colors in this.  Good job.', '2003-10-08 23:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(444355, 40780, 11800, '<td valign="top">The grain is a little over done, but could really be nice if toned down a bit.  The major thing that might be improved is if I could see more of his other eye. Just a little less contrast, and it''d show up enough to balance out his face.</td>', 'The grain is a little over done, but could really be nice if toned down a bit.  The major thing that might be improved is if I could see more of his other eye. Just a little less contrast, and it''d show up enough to balance out his face.', '2003-10-08 23:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(444360, 40916, 11487, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  How did you mange this one?</td>', 'Great capture.  How did you mange this one?', '2003-10-08 23:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(444363, 40780, 11487, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  I like the graininess and the way the shadow falls across his face.  His eyes tell the story.</td>', 'Nice image.  I like the graininess and the way the shadow falls across his face.  His eyes tell the story.', '2003-10-08 23:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(444372, 40916, 11800, '<td valign="top">Wow. Too much neat image, but nice night shot.</td>', 'Wow. Too much neat image, but nice night shot.', '2003-10-08 23:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(444373, 40846, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming from the shadow and the the lack of a smashed camera that you started with the hammer on the camera and yanked it away after a short delay....Nice work!</td>', 'I''m assuming from the shadow and the the lack of a smashed camera that you started with the hammer on the camera and yanked it away after a short delay....Nice work!', '2003-10-08 23:35:16.000000', NULL, 1);
