(444377, 40527, 11800, '<td valign="top">Can''t tell what it is.</td>', 'Can''t tell what it is.', '2003-10-08 23:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(444382, 40545, 9906, '<td valign="top">I love the idea and the story here....I want a better camera!!!  :-P  From a picture point of view though, it''s a little confusing from the sleeping girls chin to about her hand.  It''s hard to focus on anything in that area....I do want to know though...did you do this with two exposures in camera or one long one???  Some of the shadows aren''t ''right'' around the thing hanging by the window (image top left)</td>', 'I love the idea and the story here....I want a better camera!!!  :-P  From a picture point of view though, it''s a little confusing from the sleeping girls chin to about her hand.  It''s hard to focus on anything in that area....I do want to know though...did you do this with two exposures in camera or one long one???  Some of the shadows aren''t ''right'' around the thing hanging by the window (image top left)', '2003-10-08 23:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(444390, 40919, 9906, '<td valign="top">Focus is off on the sword and right on on the tree behind it.  I would rather see it the other way around or both in focus....I usually don''t like the idea of taking away color to much but in this case I think a B/W or sepia might give it more feel.</td>', 'Focus is off on the sword and right on on the tree behind it.  I would rather see it the other way around or both in focus....I usually don''t like the idea of taking away color to much but in this case I think a B/W or sepia might give it more feel.', '2003-10-08 23:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(444393, 40935, 9906, '<td valign="top">Beggin'' with a beaners cup....Gotta pay for that 4 buck coffee somehow (wink)</td>', 'Beggin'' with a beaners cup....Gotta pay for that 4 buck coffee somehow (wink)', '2003-10-08 23:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(444395, 40503, 11800, '<td valign="top">I guess you''ve been told that the background is too distracting? Maybe would work better with a more norrow dof and getting a little closer to the ones in front of the yellow grass. It could look really eerie with a little more work.</td>', 'I guess you''ve been told that the background is too distracting? Maybe would work better with a more norrow dof and getting a little closer to the ones in front of the yellow grass. It could look really eerie with a little more work.', '2003-10-08 23:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(444397, 40539, 9906, '<td valign="top">Just enough detail!!!  One of the best in show IMHO!  God the lighting is perfect for the feel.</td>', 'Just enough detail!!!  One of the best in show IMHO!  God the lighting is perfect for the feel.', '2003-10-08 23:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(444399, 40673, 7778, '<td valign="top">Anxiety? The bridge appears not only sturdy but also transporting. ;-)<br/> <br/>Beautiful photo, very dreamlike. Flawless too.</td>', 'Anxiety? The bridge appears not only sturdy but also transporting. ;-) Beautiful photo, very dreamlike. Flawless too.', '2003-10-08 23:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(444402, 40975, 9906, '<td valign="top">Is that an over sharpening artifact along the left edge of her arm,  down the chest  and up the leg???  I don''t get what it''s supposed to represent.  Magical boobs??? (just kidding)  Nice silhouette shot though!</td>', 'Is that an over sharpening artifact along the left edge of her arm,  down the chest  and up the leg???  I don''t get what it''s supposed to represent.  Magical boobs??? (just kidding)  Nice silhouette shot though!', '2003-10-08 23:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
