(444407, 40337, 9906, '<td valign="top">Evil looking!  How did ya get the two lighting temps???  The glare on the forehead and nose is kinda distracting.  I think the crop is just a touch off also.  Good nightmare feeling!!!</td>', 'Evil looking!  How did ya get the two lighting temps???  The glare on the forehead and nose is kinda distracting.  I think the crop is just a touch off also.  Good nightmare feeling!!!', '2003-10-08 23:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(444410, 40949, 11800, '<td valign="top">If you are trying to depict the nail through the hand, and thus Jesus, it would have been more effective if there were some rough wood somewhere in the background and just the one hand in the picture. With the current composition, I feel sympathy for the injury, but it could be anyone. There is a disconnect between the title and the image.  Technically good. maybe too much blood of the wrong consistency for it to look real.</td>', 'If you are trying to depict the nail through the hand, and thus Jesus, it would have been more effective if there were some rough wood somewhere in the background and just the one hand in the picture. With the current composition, I feel sympathy for the injury, but it could be anyone. There is a disconnect between the title and the image.  Technically good. maybe too much blood of the wrong consistency for it to look real.', '2003-10-08 23:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(444411, 40960, 7778, '<td valign="top">A FINE photo, precisely topical, so much more than just a dreamy image!<br/> <br/>Ideally, and if possible, I''d consider removing anything distracting from the image (fire place utensils, water bottle, VCR)...<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'A FINE photo, precisely topical, so much more than just a dreamy image! Ideally, and if possible, I''d consider removing anything distracting from the image (fire place utensils, water bottle, VCR)...   ', '2003-10-08 23:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
