(444731, 40954, 11800, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of big noise on the left side.  The lighting effect an colorization is fun. I would have used double stick tape on the pictures to give them a more floating appearance.</td>', 'There is a lot of big noise on the left side.  The lighting effect an colorization is fun. I would have used double stick tape on the pictures to give them a more floating appearance.', '2003-10-09 07:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
