(444735, 40870, 11800, '<td valign="top">There is no black tone in the picture.  but I like the sharpness of the bricks contrasted with the movement of the person. I can''t decide if this last comment is good or bad, the models teeth turned out to be what I keep focusing on and they look so weird.</td>', 'There is no black tone in the picture.  but I like the sharpness of the bricks contrasted with the movement of the person. I can''t decide if this last comment is good or bad, the models teeth turned out to be what I keep focusing on and they look so weird.', '2003-10-09 07:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(444737, 40539, 11800, '<td valign="top">It''s too dark. All I can make out is the night light, and maybe there is a hand and leg and I think there is a crib but it fades to darkness so I can''t be sure. Try using some more lights and if you want a subdued atmosphere use a thin sheet between them and the photo area.</td>', 'It''s too dark. All I can make out is the night light, and maybe there is a hand and leg and I think there is a crib but it fades to darkness so I can''t be sure. Try using some more lights and if you want a subdued atmosphere use a thin sheet between them and the photo area.', '2003-10-09 07:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(444739, 40900, 11800, '<td valign="top">Like the grain. So subtle yet so deadly. Really good job. It could be any farmer,logger or rural scene but the title makes me think of a whole story to go with the picture. Really masterful. Thanks. 10</td>', 'Like the grain. So subtle yet so deadly. Really good job. It could be any farmer,logger or rural scene but the title makes me think of a whole story to go with the picture. Really masterful. Thanks. 10', '2003-10-09 07:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(444740, 40939, 11800, '<td valign="top">This is too overprocessed for my taste.</td>', 'This is too overprocessed for my taste.', '2003-10-09 07:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(444742, 40749, 11800, '<td valign="top">Oh Yuck. Excellent level of unreality. Love the goop coating the teeth.</td>', 'Oh Yuck. Excellent level of unreality. Love the goop coating the teeth.', '2003-10-09 08:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(444753, 40885, 7537, '<td valign="top">CCCCCCHOMP!!.. funny</td>', 'CCCCCCHOMP!!.. funny', '2003-10-09 08:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(444757, 40833, 7537, '<td valign="top">.............. feel... like....... im.... falling.... ahhhhhh!!!<br/> <br/>Amazing how you have captured a sence of movement... whenever i look at it i feel naucious.. and the picture keeps poping in and out... i want to look more closely but it hurts my eyes...  they keep darting around the image for some reason.. have to squint... anyway.... great work..9<br/></td>', '.............. feel... like....... im.... falling.... ahhhhhh!!! Amazing how you have captured a sence of movement... whenever i look at it i feel naucious.. and the picture keeps poping in and out... i want to look more closely but it hurts my eyes...  they keep darting around the image for some reason.. have to squint... anyway.... great work..9', '2003-10-09 08:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(444760, 40735, 7537, '<td valign="top">ahh.... get it away from me!.. some of my worst nightmares as a kid were about spiders... horrible little things.. but... nice shot.. 8</td>', 'ahh.... get it away from me!.. some of my worst nightmares as a kid were about spiders... horrible little things.. but... nice shot.. 8', '2003-10-09 08:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
