(444889, 40958, 11800, '<td valign="top">Looks like a batik. Would like to see more what the actual texture looked like. Looks like you have a lot of artifacts in the image. Other than that and it being almost perfectly centered, I like it. 6</td>', 'Looks like a batik. Would like to see more what the actual texture looked like. Looks like you have a lot of artifacts in the image. Other than that and it being almost perfectly centered, I like it. 6', '2003-10-09 11:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(444896, 40919, 11800, '<td valign="top">The gray clouds add to the photo. The dead tree adds somewhat to the photo, but it starts to destroy  the plus side as one looks higher into the frame. I don''t like the tangled limbs. Overall, I think just the sword against the sky would have made a stronger impact.</td>', 'The gray clouds add to the photo. The dead tree adds somewhat to the photo, but it starts to destroy  the plus side as one looks higher into the frame. I don''t like the tangled limbs. Overall, I think just the sword against the sky would have made a stronger impact.', '2003-10-09 11:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(444903, 40493, 11800, '<td valign="top">I just don''t have the heart to give you a lower score for this one. I don''t think the photo fits the challenge too well. Who am I to say this isn''t your dream? 5</td>', 'I just don''t have the heart to give you a lower score for this one. I don''t think the photo fits the challenge too well. Who am I to say this isn''t your dream? 5', '2003-10-09 11:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
