(445004, 40470, 51167, '<td valign="top">I like this.  It might of been cooler if it was night time though, like the aliens were taking you through space.</td>', 'I like this.  It might of been cooler if it was night time though, like the aliens were taking you through space.', '2003-10-09 13:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(445113, 40673, 7628, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous composition - full of meaning,  I like the light, the shadows - the reflections in the water add dimension, awareness of the surrounding while still making us feel uncertain of where we are or where we are going.</td>', 'Gorgeous composition - full of meaning,  I like the light, the shadows - the reflections in the water add dimension, awareness of the surrounding while still making us feel uncertain of where we are or where we are going.', '2003-10-09 15:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(445117, 40780, 7628, '<td valign="top">captures that feeling of being awake in the darkness and seeing a spooky shadow - scary.  The grainyness mimics the limits of our vision in the dark, adds to the uncertainty that causes the fear.  I like the diagonal light over the face, dramatic.</td>', 'captures that feeling of being awake in the darkness and seeing a spooky shadow - scary.  The grainyness mimics the limits of our vision in the dark, adds to the uncertainty that causes the fear.  I like the diagonal light over the face, dramatic.', '2003-10-09 15:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(445119, 40946, 7628, '<td valign="top">funny.  I like the white and the glowing light - very dream-like.  wish that toe on eht right was all the way in the frame.</td>', 'funny.  I like the white and the glowing light - very dream-like.  wish that toe on eht right was all the way in the frame.', '2003-10-09 15:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(445129, 40478, 12661, '<td valign="top">Tough to capture the significance to the theme without the title. Then again, I''m a city boy, so I''ll give the benefit of the doubt. ;)</td>', 'Tough to capture the significance to the theme without the title. Then again, I''m a city boy, so I''ll give the benefit of the doubt. ;)', '2003-10-09 15:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(445163, 40708, 12992, '<td valign="top">Great job of catching the emotion.</td>', 'Great job of catching the emotion.', '2003-10-09 16:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(445223, 40960, 11022, '<td valign="top">This is just super and surreal.  It fits so well with the theme and is excellently done.  I wish I knew how you did it.</td>', 'This is just super and surreal.  It fits so well with the theme and is excellently done.  I wish I knew how you did it.', '2003-10-09 17:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(445225, 40337, 11022, '<td valign="top">Definitely fits my idea of a nightmare.  The colors are superb to create the mood and your angle, focus and composition are excellent.</td>', 'Definitely fits my idea of a nightmare.  The colors are superb to create the mood and your angle, focus and composition are excellent.', '2003-10-09 17:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(445228, 40780, 11022, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea and very nicely done.  The graininess bothers me a bit even though I''m sure it is deliberate to enhance the nightmarish mood.  I might have tried a soft focus instead  but this is still a super entry and one of my top 5</td>', 'Excellent idea and very nicely done.  The graininess bothers me a bit even though I''m sure it is deliberate to enhance the nightmarish mood.  I might have tried a soft focus instead  but this is still a super entry and one of my top 5', '2003-10-09 17:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(445230, 40946, 11022, '<td valign="top">What fun!  Good job!</td>', 'What fun!  Good job!', '2003-10-09 17:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(445231, 40708, 11022, '<td valign="top">This is really a wonderful photograph.  I surely hope it was staged and this heartbreaking nightmare didn''t really happen.  Beautiful lighting and color and excellent composition.</td>', 'This is really a wonderful photograph.  I surely hope it was staged and this heartbreaking nightmare didn''t really happen.  Beautiful lighting and color and excellent composition.', '2003-10-09 17:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(445232, 40977, 11022, '<td valign="top">Definitely a nightmare.  Well conceived.</td>', 'Definitely a nightmare.  Well conceived.', '2003-10-09 17:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(445234, 40916, 11022, '<td valign="top">An incredible shot!</td>', 'An incredible shot!', '2003-10-09 17:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(445237, 40976, 11800, '<td valign="top">Really like the colors and perspective. The lights got a little blown out and it''s horizion is just that little bit tilted, just enough to be an imperfection but it''s made more obvious because of the framing at the bottom. Nicely in focus fore to aft. 8</td>', 'Really like the colors and perspective. The lights got a little blown out and it''s horizion is just that little bit tilted, just enough to be an imperfection but it''s made more obvious because of the framing at the bottom. Nicely in focus fore to aft. 8', '2003-10-09 17:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(445248, 40834, 11800, '<td valign="top">The photo is everything it should be on the technical side. The child looks as if she is about to cry. When I daydream, I usually am having pleasant thoughts. Maybe it should have a different title.</td>', 'The photo is everything it should be on the technical side. The child looks as if she is about to cry. When I daydream, I usually am having pleasant thoughts. Maybe it should have a different title.', '2003-10-09 17:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(445252, 40337, 11800, '<td valign="top">The extreme closeness ,color and angle does bring a spirit of evilness to this image. Good job.</td>', 'The extreme closeness ,color and angle does bring a spirit of evilness to this image. Good job.', '2003-10-09 18:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(445388, 40313, 12448, '<td valign="top">Cute title, adding the background was a nice touch, but if that''s the sun, then the lighting is all off, if it''s the moon, then the lighting is too bright.    I think that is what is throwing me off overall, is the brightness of the photo, to reality based, if it had a softer focus and a lower lighting I probably would have scored much higher on this one.</td>', 'Cute title, adding the background was a nice touch, but if that''s the sun, then the lighting is all off, if it''s the moon, then the lighting is too bright.    I think that is what is throwing me off overall, is the brightness of the photo, to reality based, if it had a softer focus and a lower lighting I probably would have scored much higher on this one.', '2003-10-09 20:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(445389, 40542, 12448, '<td valign="top">That can be a nightmare for most and good motion capture but I think I would have liked this shot better with a different background or if you could have captured it from above, which would probably be very hard to do.</td>', 'That can be a nightmare for most and good motion capture but I think I would have liked this shot better with a different background or if you could have captured it from above, which would probably be very hard to do.', '2003-10-09 20:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(445390, 40885, 12448, '<td valign="top">Hahaha, very cute!  That would be my brother''s nightmare I''m sure!  I like the concept but the picture is lacking in that the fisherman is too fuzzy.  If you could have captured both of them in a sharper overall image I would have scored much higher on this.  Meets the challenge but the over shot is wanting for me.</td>', 'Hahaha, very cute!  That would be my brother''s nightmare I''m sure!  I like the concept but the picture is lacking in that the fisherman is too fuzzy.  If you could have captured both of them in a sharper overall image I would have scored much higher on this.  Meets the challenge but the over shot is wanting for me.', '2003-10-09 20:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(445392, 40862, 12448, '<td valign="top">Is this a dream or a nightmare?  Not sure what we are conveying here, the brightness doesn''t inspire fear to me and the overall motion of the picture detracts too much for me.  I do like the way the background came out but the runner is neither threatening or looks frightened or happy.</td>', 'Is this a dream or a nightmare?  Not sure what we are conveying here, the brightness doesn''t inspire fear to me and the overall motion of the picture detracts too much for me.  I do like the way the background came out but the runner is neither threatening or looks frightened or happy.', '2003-10-09 20:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(445394, 40958, 12448, '<td valign="top">I feel this shot would have been more effective in it''s original form, the actual spider, as close and real as possible is a very frightening thing to me, when put in this media it loses it''s fear factor and doesn''t capture my attention as well.</td>', 'I feel this shot would have been more effective in it''s original form, the actual spider, as close and real as possible is a very frightening thing to me, when put in this media it loses it''s fear factor and doesn''t capture my attention as well.', '2003-10-09 20:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(445397, 40868, 12448, '<td valign="top">At first I thought this was an arial shot from space, the intensity of the colors is amazing!  The sun playing off the water is wonderful but it makes me wonder, is this supposed to be a dream or a nightmare, for many it could go either way, nice capture!  The only thing that gets to me is the dark line across the top, that is where I feel the nightmare element starts to come into play, what is waiting in the dark?</td>', 'At first I thought this was an arial shot from space, the intensity of the colors is amazing!  The sun playing off the water is wonderful but it makes me wonder, is this supposed to be a dream or a nightmare, for many it could go either way, nice capture!  The only thing that gets to me is the dark line across the top, that is where I feel the nightmare element starts to come into play, what is waiting in the dark?', '2003-10-09 20:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(445406, 40784, 12448, '<td valign="top">I waited to come back to this one until I got my monitor adjusted because before it was very dark and forbidding and the concept wasn''t really being conveyed to me.  After coming back I can see more of what you were going for and agree that this is a nightmare in the making.  The only thing that could have made this shot better for me was more emphasis on the person and the window and not quite a much darkness to the left and bottom.  The shaft of light coming in the bottom is a nice touch.</td>', 'I waited to come back to this one until I got my monitor adjusted because before it was very dark and forbidding and the concept wasn''t really being conveyed to me.  After coming back I can see more of what you were going for and agree that this is a nightmare in the making.  The only thing that could have made this shot better for me was more emphasis on the person and the window and not quite a much darkness to the left and bottom.  The shaft of light coming in the bottom is a nice touch.', '2003-10-09 20:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(445407, 40789, 12448, '<td valign="top">Ah BACK TO THE FUTURE TRAIN!!  Very nice!  The lighting effect makes it even more dream like though just a touch to bright for me.</td>', 'Ah BACK TO THE FUTURE TRAIN!!  Very nice!  The lighting effect makes it even more dream like though just a touch to bright for me.', '2003-10-09 20:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(445414, 40690, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful night shot, the colors are wonderfully muted but don''t really convey a sense of torment to me.    It really seems more serene and calm.</td>', 'This is a wonderful night shot, the colors are wonderfully muted but don''t really convey a sense of torment to me.    It really seems more serene and calm.', '2003-10-09 20:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(445416, 40974, 12448, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the electricity, making one think it''s souls in the making.  The reflection is also clear enough to make out, yet dream like enough to make me say, "Is he really there?"  The soft focus was a great touch.</td>', 'Nice capture of the electricity, making one think it''s souls in the making.  The reflection is also clear enough to make out, yet dream like enough to make me say, "Is he really there?"  The soft focus was a great touch.', '2003-10-09 20:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(445418, 40722, 12448, '<td valign="top">It took me a moment to really try to see what you were going for then i saw the bed post, actually almost got lost on my view.  The monster is too flat to be a really frightening thing, if you had a doll or some other way to make just eyes appear from under the bed it would have conveyed a much larger sense of fear to me.</td>', 'It took me a moment to really try to see what you were going for then i saw the bed post, actually almost got lost on my view.  The monster is too flat to be a really frightening thing, if you had a doll or some other way to make just eyes appear from under the bed it would have conveyed a much larger sense of fear to me.', '2003-10-09 20:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(445421, 40434, 12448, '<td valign="top">Good nightmare for most people, good concept.  As for the photo itself, well, the editing that happened afterwards ruined it for me.  If it wasn''t quite so surreal I probably would have scored this much higher and if you could really see the fear on the person''s face.</td>', 'Good nightmare for most people, good concept.  As for the photo itself, well, the editing that happened afterwards ruined it for me.  If it wasn''t quite so surreal I probably would have scored this much higher and if you could really see the fear on the person''s face.', '2003-10-09 20:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(445424, 40893, 12448, '<td valign="top">Oh God,  I hope not my kids!  LOL!    The image itself doesn''t really say much to me overall, I see the teeth, I see the ferocity of the thing with the teeth and I see the beady red eye but the gree on the left really is distracting to me and this almost looks like  a picture of a picture, maybe if you had a child on the left screaming it would have worked much better for me personally.</td>', 'Oh God,  I hope not my kids!  LOL!    The image itself doesn''t really say much to me overall, I see the teeth, I see the ferocity of the thing with the teeth and I see the beady red eye but the gree on the left really is distracting to me and this almost looks like  a picture of a picture, maybe if you had a child on the left screaming it would have worked much better for me personally.', '2003-10-09 20:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(445428, 40656, 12448, '<td valign="top">Nice smoke effect but honestly, the white masks have lost all their fear factor in my house and the woman''s face, while trying to look frightened doesn''t quite pull it off.  Maybe if there were more face to face, a side view and she was in full scream mode I would have score higher on this.</td>', 'Nice smoke effect but honestly, the white masks have lost all their fear factor in my house and the woman''s face, while trying to look frightened doesn''t quite pull it off.  Maybe if there were more face to face, a side view and she was in full scream mode I would have score higher on this.', '2003-10-09 20:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(445432, 40844, 12448, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing a manniquin in a church, very nice.  The seeming effect of smoke in the area is very appealing and the slightly out of focus "ghost" works very well.  If the vel was spread out slightly more so you could see through part of it would have cinched a much higher score from me.</td>', 'I''m guessing a manniquin in a church, very nice.  The seeming effect of smoke in the area is very appealing and the slightly out of focus "ghost" works very well.  If the vel was spread out slightly more so you could see through part of it would have cinched a much higher score from me.', '2003-10-09 20:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(445442, 40643, 12448, '<td valign="top">It took me three times looking at this to get the message, DUH! :)<br/> <br/>I''m getting that the shadow person is an older woman who dreams of getting her figure of young back?  Nice dream, wish I could have it too! :)<br/> <br/>If the shadow as slightly more defined and you could actually see the figure of the woman compared to the figure of the negligee it would have had more impact for me.</td>', 'It took me three times looking at this to get the message, DUH! :) I''m getting that the shadow person is an older woman who dreams of getting her figure of young back?  Nice dream, wish I could have it too! :) If the shadow as slightly more defined and you could actually see the figure of the woman compared to the figure of the negligee it would have had more impact for me.', '2003-10-09 20:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(445445, 40969, 12448, '<td valign="top">Is that a Colt I see on that helmet?  :)<br/> <br/>Yes it is a young man''s dream and the overall shot is very compelling, sharp, crisp, clear, good colors except for the background pom poms.  I find the green a bit distracting, would have gone for white or silver to make more impact on the shot.</td>', 'Is that a Colt I see on that helmet?  :) Yes it is a young man''s dream and the overall shot is very compelling, sharp, crisp, clear, good colors except for the background pom poms.  I find the green a bit distracting, would have gone for white or silver to make more impact on the shot.', '2003-10-09 20:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(445448, 40348, 12448, '<td valign="top">That would be a bit frightening.  But for me, this picture doesn''t really convey that nightmare, if you had focused just on the bell tower itself, maybe a shot from the bottom looking up with a dark sky would have really worked for me.</td>', 'That would be a bit frightening.  But for me, this picture doesn''t really convey that nightmare, if you had focused just on the bell tower itself, maybe a shot from the bottom looking up with a dark sky would have really worked for me.', '2003-10-09 20:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(445451, 40960, 10402, '<td valign="top">Well done double exposure. I wish the man was a bit darker, but that''s just me. The dark box on the middle of the mantel is a bid distracting.</td>', 'Well done double exposure. I wish the man was a bit darker, but that''s just me. The dark box on the middle of the mantel is a bid distracting.', '2003-10-09 20:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(445452, 40673, 12448, '<td valign="top">Now if there were crocs in the water............ :)  Crossing walkways without siderails can be very imposing for a lot of people so I understand where you are going with this and the idea that it goes on forever, if you had managed to crop it a little tighter on the top or been able to disguise the end of the trail better.</td>', 'Now if there were crocs in the water............ :)  Crossing walkways without siderails can be very imposing for a lot of people so I understand where you are going with this and the idea that it goes on forever, if you had managed to crop it a little tighter on the top or been able to disguise the end of the trail better.', '2003-10-09 20:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(445455, 40857, 12448, '<td valign="top">Why yes it is, once my eyes adjusted again!  I think this would have worked just fine in focus or with a soft focus, the motion of the shot actually ruins the nightmare aspect for me.</td>', 'Why yes it is, once my eyes adjusted again!  I think this would have worked just fine in focus or with a soft focus, the motion of the shot actually ruins the nightmare aspect for me.', '2003-10-09 20:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(445460, 40576, 12448, '<td valign="top">The title suggests that she is the dream to him yet she''s the one in focus and he''s out of focus, the other way around would have worked better for me, personally.  The shot itself is well done, good cropping, excellent colors and the lighting is perfect.</td>', 'The title suggests that she is the dream to him yet she''s the one in focus and he''s out of focus, the other way around would have worked better for me, personally.  The shot itself is well done, good cropping, excellent colors and the lighting is perfect.', '2003-10-09 20:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(445465, 40833, 12448, '<td valign="top">I had to come back to this one a couple of times.  It does give the feeling of falling out of the tree very well, can''t wait to see how you did this.  Very good capture of the challenge and the colors are great, lighting is just spottled enough to keep your eyes going everywhere.  Well done.</td>', 'I had to come back to this one a couple of times.  It does give the feeling of falling out of the tree very well, can''t wait to see how you did this.  Very good capture of the challenge and the colors are great, lighting is just spottled enough to keep your eyes going everywhere.  Well done.', '2003-10-09 20:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(445472, 40337, 12448, '<td valign="top">CHUCKIE!!!!!!!!!!!  EEEEEEK!!!! :)<br/> <br/>Okay, now back to serious comments, the concept is good though I never saw the movies, not much of a horror fan.    The only thing that could have made this a better shot for me would have been blood on the cracks.</td>', 'CHUCKIE!!!!!!!!!!!  EEEEEEK!!!! :) Okay, now back to serious comments, the concept is good though I never saw the movies, not much of a horror fan.    The only thing that could have made this a better shot for me would have been blood on the cracks.', '2003-10-09 21:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(445476, 40445, 12448, '<td valign="top">And yes it is!  Wow!  The coloration does really suggest another realm.  The sharpness of the shot and starkness really add to the shot.</td>', 'And yes it is!  Wow!  The coloration does really suggest another realm.  The sharpness of the shot and starkness really add to the shot.', '2003-10-09 21:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(445555, 40961, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. There is a yellow overcast that I don''t like. It tends to dull the other colors. The composition is too static. <br/>I am updating my comments. Thanks for the explanation. If you try the unicorn again,  I bet it would be really beautiful in a glass of wine in candlelight.</td>', 'I like the idea. There is a yellow overcast that I don''t like. It tends to dull the other colors. The composition is too static. I am updating my comments. Thanks for the explanation. If you try the unicorn again,  I bet it would be really beautiful in a glass of wine in candlelight.', '2003-10-09 22:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(445568, 40537, 11800, '<td valign="top">There isn''t enough information to know what this is. Is it a pregnant woman, a man''s arm or what? It''s overprocessed and there is a lot of motion blur.</td>', 'There isn''t enough information to know what this is. Is it a pregnant woman, a man''s arm or what? It''s overprocessed and there is a lot of motion blur.', '2003-10-09 23:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(445592, 40870, 8953, '<td valign="top">Wow! great image! I like the use of sepia here. the movment confined to the center of the shot also works for me. what might have been even more fun would have been for the model to have moved from the image for the last couple seconds of the shot and have had a fire going to give it even more action. Just the same, I had rated it a 7 but coming through and offering a comment I think more a 9. good luck:)</td>', 'Wow! great image! I like the use of sepia here. the movment confined to the center of the shot also works for me. what might have been even more fun would have been for the model to have moved from the image for the last couple seconds of the shot and have had a fire going to give it even more action. Just the same, I had rated it a 7 but coming through and offering a comment I think more a 9. good luck:)', '2003-10-09 23:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(445602, 40658, 8953, '<td valign="top">Kids can be so much fun:) this is a great shot...I hope I am not out of line saying I see humor in it. but on the other side i love how the eyes are so black and I think the low level of hue works as well...I would have liked to have seen the end of her right hand or what she was holding out. Overall a nice idea 7</td>', 'Kids can be so much fun:) this is a great shot...I hope I am not out of line saying I see humor in it. but on the other side i love how the eyes are so black and I think the low level of hue works as well...I would have liked to have seen the end of her right hand or what she was holding out. Overall a nice idea 7', '2003-10-09 23:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(445613, 40976, 8953, '<td valign="top">It is a nice picture of a hall, but it needs to much help from the title and I do not get the feeling of a maze. I think to have rotated the image about 1 degree clockwize would have helped or rotating it 45 degrees counter clockwize  to give a feeling of off balance. hope this helped 5</td>', 'It is a nice picture of a hall, but it needs to much help from the title and I do not get the feeling of a maze. I think to have rotated the image about 1 degree clockwize would have helped or rotating it 45 degrees counter clockwize  to give a feeling of off balance. hope this helped 5', '2003-10-09 23:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(445618, 40855, 8953, '<td valign="top">I do not get dream or nightmare from this shot:( unless you are the poor soul that has to clean the gum from under the seats:) just to much of a reach..sorry 4</td>', 'I do not get dream or nightmare from this shot:( unless you are the poor soul that has to clean the gum from under the seats:) just to much of a reach..sorry 4', '2003-10-09 23:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(445647, 40954, 6477, '<td valign="top">A great idea and great image. The only thing I don''t like is the border... but the concept is very well executed.<br/> <br/>I got back to add that this pic reminds me to Dalí work...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-10-27 23:33:38.</i></td>', 'A great idea and great image. The only thing I don''t like is the border... but the concept is very well executed. I got back to add that this pic reminds me to Dalí work...', '2003-10-09 23:51:27.000000', '2003-10-27 23:33:38.000000', 1),
(445648, 40946, 6477, '<td valign="top">LOL great sense of humor:) a real nightmare!<br/>I would like to see the left shoe complete... anyway, a good work</td>', 'LOL great sense of humor:) a real nightmare!I would like to see the left shoe complete... anyway, a good work', '2003-10-09 23:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(445655, 40744, 6477, '<td valign="top">what a nightmare!<br/>I agree with this...  <br/>clever idea and good work, the border is something I would change</td>', 'what a nightmare!I agree with this...  clever idea and good work, the border is something I would change', '2003-10-09 23:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(445658, 40780, 6477, '<td valign="top">nice effect. After the challenge I would like to know which filter you used...<br/>The expression of the boy is pefect</td>', 'nice effect. After the challenge I would like to know which filter you used...The expression of the boy is pefect', '2003-10-10 00:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(445664, 40866, 12448, '<td valign="top">I understand where you were going with this shot and it probably would have worked except for two things, the legs on the left, indicating that someone else is in the shot but just sitting there?  And the subject themselves do not look like they are dreaming or relaxing enough to be sleeping at work and dreaming, they look more like they are possibly crying or just putting their heads down like a child might at school.</td>', 'I understand where you were going with this shot and it probably would have worked except for two things, the legs on the left, indicating that someone else is in the shot but just sitting there?  And the subject themselves do not look like they are dreaming or relaxing enough to be sleeping at work and dreaming, they look more like they are possibly crying or just putting their heads down like a child might at school.', '2003-10-10 00:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(445666, 40695, 12448, '<td valign="top">Disjointed, must like dreams but I think a soft focus would have worked much better on this, also if you could have made the items seem suspended, more surreal.</td>', 'Disjointed, must like dreams but I think a soft focus would have worked much better on this, also if you could have made the items seem suspended, more surreal.', '2003-10-10 00:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(445672, 40381, 12448, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing you were going for Alice in Wonderland in reverse here therefore using an older model instead of someone closer to the image of Alice.  Nice touch and the coloring really takes you into another world.  At first glance this picture was a bit disturbing to me but upon a second, closer look I see more of what you might have been going for and like the image you projected.</td>', 'I''m guessing you were going for Alice in Wonderland in reverse here therefore using an older model instead of someone closer to the image of Alice.  Nice touch and the coloring really takes you into another world.  At first glance this picture was a bit disturbing to me but upon a second, closer look I see more of what you might have been going for and like the image you projected.', '2003-10-10 00:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(445675, 40219, 12448, '<td valign="top">WOW!  Great shot, I''m guessing down a well?  Very well done, would be nightmarish to end up down there, makes you think of the children who have been stuck down wells and how frightened they must have been.</td>', 'WOW!  Great shot, I''m guessing down a well?  Very well done, would be nightmarish to end up down there, makes you think of the children who have been stuck down wells and how frightened they must have been.', '2003-10-10 00:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(445680, 40932, 12448, '<td valign="top">This really made me think how it related to a dream and then I thought, a dream date, a dream man, a dream evening?  The overall shot is well done, good cropping and nice black background to help the roses stand out but I would have probably liked it just a bit better with a soft focus for this challenge ;)</td>', 'This really made me think how it related to a dream and then I thought, a dream date, a dream man, a dream evening?  The overall shot is well done, good cropping and nice black background to help the roses stand out but I would have probably liked it just a bit better with a soft focus for this challenge ;)', '2003-10-10 00:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(445685, 40935, 12448, '<td valign="top">Yes it could be.  The overall shot is well done, good light, contrast and showing the indifference of society at times.</td>', 'Yes it could be.  The overall shot is well done, good light, contrast and showing the indifference of society at times.', '2003-10-10 00:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(445691, 40172, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot, I''m trying to figure out if it''s actually underwater or through glass, can''t wait to find out.  As for the shot itself, the light coming through the upper palm of the hand is rather distracting and I think it might have worked better if it wasn''t quite as bright or if it''s to represent the sun could have been more to the side or through the fingers because coming so bright through the hand it should have been more red.</td>', 'This is an interesting shot, I''m trying to figure out if it''s actually underwater or through glass, can''t wait to find out.  As for the shot itself, the light coming through the upper palm of the hand is rather distracting and I think it might have worked better if it wasn''t quite as bright or if it''s to represent the sun could have been more to the side or through the fingers because coming so bright through the hand it should have been more red.', '2003-10-10 00:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(445698, 40889, 12448, '<td valign="top">EEK!  That''s not a very nice looking man but then again he''s not supposed to be, right?  LOL  The shot itself seemed off balance when I first saw it and when I came back to it I looked to see why I felt that, it''s not the balance between the man and the axe but the balance of light that threw me at first.  The man is brighter and from the shadows I''m buessing the light was to the slight side of him, I think if the axe shadow was more defined I''d score this very high</td>', 'EEK!  That''s not a very nice looking man but then again he''s not supposed to be, right?  LOL  The shot itself seemed off balance when I first saw it and when I came back to it I looked to see why I felt that, it''s not the balance between the man and the axe but the balance of light that threw me at first.  The man is brighter and from the shadows I''m buessing the light was to the slight side of him, I think if the axe shadow was more defined I''d score this very high', '2003-10-10 00:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(445701, 40737, 4494, '<td valign="top">Nice black and white.  Maybe crop off that little white part in the lower right, and then a little off the top to make things "even" again.  I really like the reflection on the wall.  Maybe could be a little lighter.</td>', 'Nice black and white.  Maybe crop off that little white part in the lower right, and then a little off the top to make things "even" again.  I really like the reflection on the wall.  Maybe could be a little lighter.', '2003-10-10 00:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(445706, 40749, 12448, '<td valign="top">Ewwwwwwwwwwwwww! :)  Is that vaseline?  I bet it was a bit fun doing this shot for you but not for your model, LOL!<br/> <br/>As for the shot itself, if the lips were more defined, possibly redder I would probably like this shot much more and it would convey even a more nightmarish image to me.</td>', 'Ewwwwwwwwwwwwww! :)  Is that vaseline?  I bet it was a bit fun doing this shot for you but not for your model, LOL! As for the shot itself, if the lips were more defined, possibly redder I would probably like this shot much more and it would convey even a more nightmarish image to me.', '2003-10-10 00:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(445707, 40784, 4494, '<td valign="top">It''s too dark to tell what it is.  All I can see is the ourline of something at the top.  Is your monitor setup correctly?  I''m sure mine is so...</td>', 'It''s too dark to tell what it is.  All I can see is the ourline of something at the top.  Is your monitor setup correctly?  I''m sure mine is so...', '2003-10-10 00:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(445711, 40946, 4494, '<td valign="top">LOL, that''s halarious.  I think everyone has had this "dream" going to work and forgetting to put their pants on!  Excellent idea, and well done on top of that.  8.</td>', 'LOL, that''s halarious.  I think everyone has had this "dream" going to work and forgetting to put their pants on!  Excellent idea, and well done on top of that.  8.', '2003-10-10 00:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(445712, 40973, 12448, '<td valign="top">Not sure what exactly you mean by dream school but the shot itself while the concept is well thought out since you have the forefront so out of focus I would hope the school would be sharp and clear, a more defined dream per say.  The tower seems the sharpest point of the shot while the left of the school looks almost as out of focus as the fore front of the shot.</td>', 'Not sure what exactly you mean by dream school but the shot itself while the concept is well thought out since you have the forefront so out of focus I would hope the school would be sharp and clear, a more defined dream per say.  The tower seems the sharpest point of the shot while the left of the school looks almost as out of focus as the fore front of the shot.', '2003-10-10 00:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(445716, 40444, 4494, '<td valign="top">Freaky.  Makes you think a little.  Great lighting and pretty interesting ta boot.</td>', 'Freaky.  Makes you think a little.  Great lighting and pretty interesting ta boot.', '2003-10-10 00:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(445718, 40723, 12448, '<td valign="top">I wish you had a title with this so I could get a better idea of what you were aiming for.  I''m guessing a child escaping from a fire hence the red and smoke effect?  The blurriness of the shot adds to the nightmare aspect but also distracts at the same time, overall a good effort.</td>', 'I wish you had a title with this so I could get a better idea of what you were aiming for.  I''m guessing a child escaping from a fire hence the red and smoke effect?  The blurriness of the shot adds to the nightmare aspect but also distracts at the same time, overall a good effort.', '2003-10-10 00:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(445723, 40172, 4494, '<td valign="top">That is so cool.  I love the the colors, the abstract well lit hand, the dark area around the hand, and the Title is really wicked and makes you think about the picture!  Very very cool.   Alternate title could be just:  Drowning.   Great job!  9.</td>', 'That is so cool.  I love the the colors, the abstract well lit hand, the dark area around the hand, and the Title is really wicked and makes you think about the picture!  Very very cool.   Alternate title could be just:  Drowning.   Great job!  9.', '2003-10-10 00:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(445725, 40545, 12448, '<td valign="top">How did you do this?  As far as I know you couldn\''t do a double exposure on digital but I can\''t wait to find out how you did this!<br/> <br/>On the shot, if the bed sheets were more tussled, the woman looked more restless I would have given this a 10</td>', 'How did you do this?  As far as I know you couldn\''t do a double exposure on digital but I can\''t wait to find out how you did this! On the shot, if the bed sheets were more tussled, the woman looked more restless I would have given this a 10', '2003-10-10 00:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(445731, 40643, 4494, '<td valign="top">Witty title, and well done with the obviously older women as the shadow.  But instead of the red garment, maybe you should have used a little bikini or something.   Good job.</td>', 'Witty title, and well done with the obviously older women as the shadow.  But instead of the red garment, maybe you should have used a little bikini or something.   Good job.', '2003-10-10 00:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(445733, 40537, 4494, '<td valign="top">A little blurry.  Don''t get the "dream" aspect of this.</td>', 'A little blurry.  Don''t get the "dream" aspect of this.', '2003-10-10 00:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(445738, 40348, 4494, '<td valign="top">What?  Trapped in the bell-tower, I''ve never heard of this dream before.  Anyway, if the bell tower is the theme, you should have zoomed in on it leaving only half of the main building in the shot.</td>', 'What?  Trapped in the bell-tower, I''ve never heard of this dream before.  Anyway, if the bell tower is the theme, you should have zoomed in on it leaving only half of the main building in the shot.', '2003-10-10 00:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(445775, 40808, 6477, '<td valign="top">Nice work. After the challenge I would like to know how did you do this effect...<br/>congrats</td>', 'Nice work. After the challenge I would like to know how did you do this effect...congrats', '2003-10-10 01:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(445778, 40960, 6477, '<td valign="top">Excellent work, very clever</td>', 'Excellent work, very clever', '2003-10-10 01:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(445795, 40539, 4494, '<td valign="top">Too dark.  It''s impossible to tell what the pic is about... I only see a light in the lower right that illuminates some dolls or something.   Check your monitor settings maybe.</td>', 'Too dark.  It''s impossible to tell what the pic is about... I only see a light in the lower right that illuminates some dolls or something.   Check your monitor settings maybe.', '2003-10-10 01:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(445805, 40949, 4494, '<td valign="top">Oh man that is gorey.  Very realistic, but needs more light.  Overall it''s too dark I think.  Also for maximum effect I think I''d have tilted it 90 degrees to the right to make the hand face downwards.... that would explain all the blood on the hand/palm, etc.</td>', 'Oh man that is gorey.  Very realistic, but needs more light.  Overall it''s too dark I think.  Also for maximum effect I think I''d have tilted it 90 degrees to the right to make the hand face downwards.... that would explain all the blood on the hand/palm, etc.', '2003-10-10 01:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(445808, 40893, 4494, '<td valign="top">Can''t who "he" is.</td>', 'Can''t who "he" is.', '2003-10-10 01:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(445809, 40493, 4494, '<td valign="top">You mean he died?  :(  Sorry to hear that.  Great shot.</td>', 'You mean he died?  :(  Sorry to hear that.  Great shot.', '2003-10-10 01:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(445983, 40733, 12902, '<td valign="top">I wish I was allowed to vote so I could give it a 10.  :)</td>', 'I wish I was allowed to vote so I could give it a 10.  :)', '2003-10-10 04:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(446007, 40219, 7570, '<td valign="top">I cant vote in this challenge, but after going thru nightmare entries, this one I can relate strongly to. good work. I''d give an 8 for this if allowed by the way.</td>', 'I cant vote in this challenge, but after going thru nightmare entries, this one I can relate strongly to. good work. I''d give an 8 for this if allowed by the way.', '2003-10-10 04:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(446008, 40976, 7570, '<td valign="top">u know what can make this even better? some "misty" or blur effects if applied correctly, will make the labyrinth even more "real". I cant vote, else I''d give a 9.</td>', 'u know what can make this even better? some "misty" or blur effects if applied correctly, will make the labyrinth even more "real". I cant vote, else I''d give a 9.', '2003-10-10 04:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(446073, 40219, 12902, '<td valign="top">It''s deep... I like it. :)<br/></td>', 'It''s deep... I like it. :)', '2003-10-10 06:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(446074, 40916, 12902, '<td valign="top">Disgusting creature. Great shot.</td>', 'Disgusting creature. Great shot.', '2003-10-10 06:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(446075, 40807, 12902, '<td valign="top">Deserves a 10.</td>', 'Deserves a 10.', '2003-10-10 06:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(446076, 40946, 12902, '<td valign="top">Hope to see that among the first places.</td>', 'Hope to see that among the first places.', '2003-10-10 06:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(446077, 40722, 12902, '<td valign="top">Nice one... Made me smile.</td>', 'Nice one... Made me smile.', '2003-10-10 06:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(446082, 40780, 12902, '<td valign="top">Feels real... I like the picture.</td>', 'Feels real... I like the picture.', '2003-10-10 06:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(446083, 40971, 12902, '<td valign="top">Funny... :):):)</td>', 'Funny... :):):)', '2003-10-10 06:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(446142, 40708, 1204, '<td valign="top">Technically a very good portrait.  I find the set-up a bit "too-much" to express this otherwise very good idea.  Her facial expression and body language is almost enough, perhaps with few tears on the cheek.  This heavy make-up is just over the edge.  Also I find it a bit tightly cropped on the left - I''d have like to see the shoulder.    But this is nitpicking - great picture! 9.</td>', 'Technically a very good portrait.  I find the set-up a bit "too-much" to express this otherwise very good idea.  Her facial expression and body language is almost enough, perhaps with few tears on the cheek.  This heavy make-up is just over the edge.  Also I find it a bit tightly cropped on the left - I''d have like to see the shoulder.    But this is nitpicking - great picture! 9.', '2003-10-10 10:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(446182, 40964, 2764, '<td valign="top">This is a flat image.  I mean it has not much dynamic or interesting.  If you think of the quote "Photography is all about light" as you shoot you will get more interesting photos.  I forget who to attribute the quote to.  What did you mean to convey with this picture?  And have you made that idea the focal point?  I would think that the eyes should be the most intersting but they are slightly out of focus and not well lit.  The hair and the lips are actually what stand out the sharpest.  I bet with some minor post processing adjustments you could make this image much better.</td>', 'This is a flat image.  I mean it has not much dynamic or interesting.  If you think of the quote "Photography is all about light" as you shoot you will get more interesting photos.  I forget who to attribute the quote to.  What did you mean to convey with this picture?  And have you made that idea the focal point?  I would think that the eyes should be the most intersting but they are slightly out of focus and not well lit.  The hair and the lips are actually what stand out the sharpest.  I bet with some minor post processing adjustments you could make this image much better.', '2003-10-10 11:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(446187, 40914, 2764, '<td valign="top">Great charactre, great costume. not a great photo.  Needs a more interesting angle to make him truely frightening or threatening, the straight on approach is boring.  Could use some post processing boost in contrast.  There is too much (albeit interesting) stuff going on in the photo.  I would have prefered a better look at hs horns, or his claws, or the skull on his belt.  Does he have feathered wings?   The colored stuff at the top is also distracting.</td>', 'Great charactre, great costume. not a great photo.  Needs a more interesting angle to make him truely frightening or threatening, the straight on approach is boring.  Could use some post processing boost in contrast.  There is too much (albeit interesting) stuff going on in the photo.  I would have prefered a better look at hs horns, or his claws, or the skull on his belt.  Does he have feathered wings?   The colored stuff at the top is also distracting.', '2003-10-10 11:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(446191, 40545, 10880, '<td valign="top">Very well done. Good effect. Scary!</td>', 'Very well done. Good effect. Scary!', '2003-10-10 11:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(446198, 40930, 10880, '<td valign="top">Maybe to bizzar!</td>', 'Maybe to bizzar!', '2003-10-10 12:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(446200, 40708, 10880, '<td valign="top">Sad her but photo is excellent.Congrat</td>', 'Sad her but photo is excellent.Congrat', '2003-10-10 12:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(446212, 40673, 2011, '<td valign="top">I really love this.  Great shot. 10</td>', 'I really love this.  Great shot. 10', '2003-10-10 12:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(446214, 40823, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun shot! My son says it''s ''scary!'' I agree. Nice mood, though I''m not sure about how bright the forehead is. Still wonderful composition and nice mood!</td>', 'Fun shot! My son says it''s ''scary!'' I agree. Nice mood, though I''m not sure about how bright the forehead is. Still wonderful composition and nice mood!', '2003-10-10 12:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(446216, 40741, 6870, '<td valign="top">A nightmare come true! Nice composition and idea. Fun contrast between light fingers and darker earth.</td>', 'A nightmare come true! Nice composition and idea. Fun contrast between light fingers and darker earth.', '2003-10-10 12:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(446219, 40784, 6870, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what this is about, but the darkness and that single light line through the photo sure build a nice mood.</td>', 'I''m not sure what this is about, but the darkness and that single light line through the photo sure build a nice mood.', '2003-10-10 12:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(446220, 40863, 6870, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, and I like the point of view for this shot. Darker tones help build an appropriate mood, though you could probably go even further.</td>', 'Clever idea, and I like the point of view for this shot. Darker tones help build an appropriate mood, though you could probably go even further.', '2003-10-10 12:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(446222, 40954, 2011, '<td valign="top">This is very cool.  I like everything about it.</td>', 'This is very cool.  I like everything about it.', '2003-10-10 12:30:55.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(446253, 40656, 2883, '<td valign="top">The lighting is too bright and the smoke is not very effective. It almost looks like a conversation is going on instead of fear.</td>', 'The lighting is too bright and the smoke is not very effective. It almost looks like a conversation is going on instead of fear.', '2003-10-10 12:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(446257, 40969, 2883, '<td valign="top">The green pom-pom(?) in the background is distracting. I think it would be more effective shot with a blue sky as the background.</td>', 'The green pom-pom(?) in the background is distracting. I think it would be more effective shot with a blue sky as the background.', '2003-10-10 12:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(446259, 40893, 2883, '<td valign="top">The overall picture is too noisy and has no point of focus.</td>', 'The overall picture is too noisy and has no point of focus.', '2003-10-10 12:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(446266, 40868, 2883, '<td valign="top">I like the enhanced blue of the water. I think it would be more effective if there was someone sitting alone on the beach and the beach was not quite so dark.</td>', 'I like the enhanced blue of the water. I think it would be more effective if there was someone sitting alone on the beach and the beach was not quite so dark.', '2003-10-10 12:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(446273, 40637, 10263, '<td valign="top">What a horrible, horrible nightmare. :) Very interesting setup. I like the red.</td>', 'What a horrible, horrible nightmare. :) Very interesting setup. I like the red.', '2003-10-10 12:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(446274, 40914, 2883, '<td valign="top">Nice outfit, but the photo looks too much like a snapshot.</td>', 'Nice outfit, but the photo looks too much like a snapshot.', '2003-10-10 12:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(446278, 40855, 2883, '<td valign="top">The photo could be a little sharper and the yellowish tint reduced. The angle doesn''t really help the photo and there''s no sense of a dream to it.</td>', 'The photo could be a little sharper and the yellowish tint reduced. The angle doesn''t really help the photo and there''s no sense of a dream to it.', '2003-10-10 12:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(446279, 40470, 5112, '<td valign="top">Yeah ... looks like it.</td>', 'Yeah ... looks like it.', '2003-10-10 12:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(446280, 40972, 10263, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. The shading in the background is excellent</td>', 'Very nicely done. The shading in the background is excellent', '2003-10-10 13:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(446282, 40634, 2883, '<td valign="top">This photo looks more like an accidental picture was taken while the camera was facing up. It might have worked if there were rays of light.</td>', 'This photo looks more like an accidental picture was taken while the camera was facing up. It might have worked if there were rays of light.', '2003-10-10 13:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(446284, 40808, 5112, '<td valign="top">FUNNY!!!!  I love it.  ~10</td>', 'FUNNY!!!!  I love it.  ~10', '2003-10-10 13:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(446287, 40537, 2883, '<td valign="top">The depth of field is off, drawing the eye to the lower most left part of the arm instead of to the tatoo.</td>', 'The depth of field is off, drawing the eye to the lower most left part of the arm instead of to the tatoo.', '2003-10-10 13:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(446288, 40925, 2883, '<td valign="top">The dark building and solar flares are distracting.</td>', 'The dark building and solar flares are distracting.', '2003-10-10 13:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(446293, 40780, 10263, '<td valign="top">I really like this. The light and the shadowing is excellent and I like the grainy effect.</td>', 'I really like this. The light and the shadowing is excellent and I like the grainy effect.', '2003-10-10 13:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(446295, 40539, 2883, '<td valign="top">The contrasts are too high making this photo too dark to see what is suppose to be the subject.</td>', 'The contrasts are too high making this photo too dark to see what is suppose to be the subject.', '2003-10-10 13:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(446324, 40808, 6870, '<td valign="top">In certain respects kind of sick, but I mean that in the best of ways! I love the idea and the technique. Very engaging and interesting photo. 10</td>', 'In certain respects kind of sick, but I mean that in the best of ways! I love the idea and the technique. Very engaging and interesting photo. 10', '2003-10-10 13:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(446326, 40844, 6870, '<td valign="top">Ghostly and nice. Interetsing juxtaposition of ghost and stained glass, where the man is wearing black.</td>', 'Ghostly and nice. Interetsing juxtaposition of ghost and stained glass, where the man is wearing black.', '2003-10-10 13:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(446330, 40857, 6870, '<td valign="top">Huphalumps and woozles are very confoozle, and this photo is, too, and it has an engaging, interesting result because of it. the motion blur does add to a weird, dreamy effect here.</td>', 'Huphalumps and woozles are very confoozle, and this photo is, too, and it has an engaging, interesting result because of it. the motion blur does add to a weird, dreamy effect here.', '2003-10-10 13:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(446331, 40735, 6870, '<td valign="top">Dark and delicious photo. Nice clarity to the sillhouette.</td>', 'Dark and delicious photo. Nice clarity to the sillhouette.', '2003-10-10 13:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(446333, 40975, 6870, '<td valign="top">But is that her? Who knows? I like the way the hair is lit here. Nice sillhouette, too. Good idea!</td>', 'But is that her? Who knows? I like the way the hair is lit here. Nice sillhouette, too. Good idea!', '2003-10-10 13:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(446336, 40847, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice action; he''s really getting into it! Point of view from below is a good idea.</td>', 'Nice action; he''s really getting into it! Point of view from below is a good idea.', '2003-10-10 13:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(446337, 40976, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo. The colors, I feel, do contribute to a dream-like mood. Perhaps some darker tones would enhance the mood even further?</td>', 'Interesting photo. The colors, I feel, do contribute to a dream-like mood. Perhaps some darker tones would enhance the mood even further?', '2003-10-10 13:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(446338, 40900, 6870, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure the image, in and of itself, speaks of murderous intent; it really needs the title to infer that. But the tones are very nice, and the visual clarity is marvelous.</td>', 'I''m not sure the image, in and of itself, speaks of murderous intent; it really needs the title to infer that. But the tones are very nice, and the visual clarity is marvelous.', '2003-10-10 13:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(446341, 40936, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interesting, misty effect that adds to a dream-like atmosphere. The dark irony here works well.</td>', 'Interesting, misty effect that adds to a dream-like atmosphere. The dark irony here works well.', '2003-10-10 13:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(446344, 40949, 6870, '<td valign="top">For others . . . ketchup!  Just kidding. I take it from the title that this is a messianic photo, and infers allusions to Christ? Interesting pose and effect. You might try experimenting with different points of view and other poses to get the allusion solid, even without the title.</td>', 'For others . . . ketchup!  Just kidding. I take it from the title that this is a messianic photo, and infers allusions to Christ? Interesting pose and effect. You might try experimenting with different points of view and other poses to get the allusion solid, even without the title.', '2003-10-10 13:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(446390, 40789, 2883, '<td valign="top">The negative effect is decent, but it also adds a bit of business to the photo, losing its point of focus.</td>', 'The negative effect is decent, but it also adds a bit of business to the photo, losing its point of focus.', '2003-10-10 14:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(446391, 40827, 2883, '<td valign="top">There''s too much haze in this photo which is enhanced by the circle formed by the large black areas. I think it would be better cropped to remove the circle and the contrasts enhanced.</td>', 'There''s too much haze in this photo which is enhanced by the circle formed by the large black areas. I think it would be better cropped to remove the circle and the contrasts enhanced.', '2003-10-10 14:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(446393, 40642, 2883, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. The lighting could be improved so as to not cast such a large shadow. I think it would be better lying on a smooth surface.</td>', 'Nice idea. The lighting could be improved so as to not cast such a large shadow. I think it would be better lying on a smooth surface.', '2003-10-10 14:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(446395, 40744, 12448, '<td valign="top">This image really threw me off at first, can''t quite explain why but upon closer examination I think it''s the missing plate!  LOL!  I get the idea, I''m pretty sure and I like the smoke/dry ice effect (not sure which it is) but for me this shot would have scored close to a 10 with a plate in it and the face mold looked more like something you''d really want to eat.</td>', 'This image really threw me off at first, can''t quite explain why but upon closer examination I think it''s the missing plate!  LOL!  I get the idea, I''m pretty sure and I like the smoke/dry ice effect (not sure which it is) but for me this shot would have scored close to a 10 with a plate in it and the face mold looked more like something you''d really want to eat.', '2003-10-10 14:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(446397, 40658, 12448, '<td valign="top">I have come back to this image several times trying to figure out what is it that just doesn''t quite set right with me.  After viewing it about 5 times I think it''s the expression on the child''s face, the fact that an adorable (sorry it comes through) child would try to look so mean or evil is what I''m guessing you went for here.  The shot itself is overall very well done, good cropping, I like the "sprite" off center and the coloration adds a lot to the image of a nightmare.</td>', 'I have come back to this image several times trying to figure out what is it that just doesn''t quite set right with me.  After viewing it about 5 times I think it''s the expression on the child''s face, the fact that an adorable (sorry it comes through) child would try to look so mean or evil is what I''m guessing you went for here.  The shot itself is overall very well done, good cropping, I like the "sprite" off center and the coloration adds a lot to the image of a nightmare.', '2003-10-10 14:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(446398, 40971, 12448, '<td valign="top">That would be a nightmare for some wouldn''t it!  My original score on this was very low because while it may be your nightmare it wouldn''t have an overall appeal to the general public.  Coming back to examine the shot itself and rate on that, the crispness of the shot, the clairity is very nice, maybe just a tad too sharp.  Score is going up at least 4-5 points for quality alone.</td>', 'That would be a nightmare for some wouldn''t it!  My original score on this was very low because while it may be your nightmare it wouldn''t have an overall appeal to the general public.  Coming back to examine the shot itself and rate on that, the crispness of the shot, the clairity is very nice, maybe just a tad too sharp.  Score is going up at least 4-5 points for quality alone.', '2003-10-10 14:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(446401, 40457, 12448, '<td valign="top">An excellent idea for the challenge without a doubt and the overall shot is good but to me, to make it more realistic I would have had the legs showing they were bound to the hands rather than just the rope leading down to them and be cut off.  Also, possibly have her also actually tied to the track in some manner.</td>', 'An excellent idea for the challenge without a doubt and the overall shot is good but to me, to make it more realistic I would have had the legs showing they were bound to the hands rather than just the rope leading down to them and be cut off.  Also, possibly have her also actually tied to the track in some manner.', '2003-10-10 14:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(446402, 40916, 12448, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of a bat!  I love these guys, wouldn''t want to get upclose to one, but they are fasinating creatures!  If you could have only captured him away from the feeder it would have been perfect!</td>', 'Nice capture of a bat!  I love these guys, wouldn''t want to get upclose to one, but they are fasinating creatures!  If you could have only captured him away from the feeder it would have been perfect!', '2003-10-10 14:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(446406, 40823, 12448, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this is the creature from Alien?  I never saw the movie, only previews.  This almost looks like a printout the clarity and sharpness of the creature itself.  I think an all black background would have contrasted much better, the greyish/brown one is a bit distracting to me.</td>', 'I''m guessing this is the creature from Alien?  I never saw the movie, only previews.  This almost looks like a printout the clarity and sharpness of the creature itself.  I think an all black background would have contrasted much better, the greyish/brown one is a bit distracting to me.', '2003-10-10 14:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(446408, 40509, 12448, '<td valign="top">A nice concept but a soft focus would have worked much better for me in this shot.  The clarity actually takes away from the dreamlike quality of the shot.  Also, if you would have had the ribbons hanging from a star and against a darker backdrop I would have been tempted to score a 9 with this one.</td>', 'A nice concept but a soft focus would have worked much better for me in this shot.  The clarity actually takes away from the dreamlike quality of the shot.  Also, if you would have had the ribbons hanging from a star and against a darker backdrop I would have been tempted to score a 9 with this one.', '2003-10-10 14:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(446487, 40808, 12448, '<td valign="top">I have come back to this image a number of times trying to figure out what exactly about it that bothers me.  At first I did wonder about the legality of the shot but see it''s been validated by the admin. but that isn''t what bothered me the most.  I can''t quite place my finger on it, if it''s the clarity of the center compared to the soft ghostlike images around her, the title itself or what?  But judging strictly on the shot itself I''m raising my initial lower score by at least 4 points.</td>', 'I have come back to this image a number of times trying to figure out what exactly about it that bothers me.  At first I did wonder about the legality of the shot but see it''s been validated by the admin. but that isn''t what bothered me the most.  I can''t quite place my finger on it, if it''s the clarity of the center compared to the soft ghostlike images around her, the title itself or what?  But judging strictly on the shot itself I''m raising my initial lower score by at least 4 points.', '2003-10-10 16:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(446489, 40919, 12448, '<td valign="top">Nice sword and I think I get the message, not 100% sure but for me this shot would look much better with a more head on shot, not quite so angled but if you want to stay on the angle, possibly waiting until it was a little darker or get a shadow effect?  A knight in tarnished armor looking defeated would be perfect!  LOL but how many knights are around these days?</td>', 'Nice sword and I think I get the message, not 100% sure but for me this shot would look much better with a more head on shot, not quite so angled but if you want to stay on the angle, possibly waiting until it was a little darker or get a shadow effect?  A knight in tarnished armor looking defeated would be perfect!  LOL but how many knights are around these days?', '2003-10-10 16:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(446491, 40478, 12448, '<td valign="top">I had to look at this image several times before I realized those are bee hives, right?  Ahhhhhh, I get the dream now!  The fog is a great effect in adding to the dreamlike state but the sun is actually a bit distracting in this one.  Maybe if it was more to the left, half cropped it would seem a little less distracting.  Nice shot overall, the contrast is done well and the colors are muted so not overbearing.</td>', 'I had to look at this image several times before I realized those are bee hives, right?  Ahhhhhh, I get the dream now!  The fog is a great effect in adding to the dreamlike state but the sun is actually a bit distracting in this one.  Maybe if it was more to the left, half cropped it would seem a little less distracting.  Nice shot overall, the contrast is done well and the colors are muted so not overbearing.', '2003-10-10 16:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(446492, 40444, 12448, '<td valign="top">I have pulled this image up about 4 times and I''m guessing this is a dream for the parents, KILL THE TELETUBBY and nightmare for them?  If the stocking over the head was black, like the hangman''s cover and the Teletubby was larger or the perspective was slightly different I would have scored much higher on this one.</td>', 'I have pulled this image up about 4 times and I''m guessing this is a dream for the parents, KILL THE TELETUBBY and nightmare for them?  If the stocking over the head was black, like the hangman''s cover and the Teletubby was larger or the perspective was slightly different I would have scored much higher on this one.', '2003-10-10 16:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(446493, 40946, 12448, '<td valign="top">Hehehe, just no pants or completely nude?  :)  This can be a nightmare for sure, a very bad dream that I''m sure we have all had, mine was to go to school in my pajamas which I accidently did one day (forgot to change my top!).  The shot is well done, the cropping is good, the cut off at the knees is very nice, leaves one looking up for more.  The background is a bit wanting for me, too stark, maybe if it was an office setting, rug, with a chair behind him it would be more appealing overall.</td>', 'Hehehe, just no pants or completely nude?  :)  This can be a nightmare for sure, a very bad dream that I''m sure we have all had, mine was to go to school in my pajamas which I accidently did one day (forgot to change my top!).  The shot is well done, the cropping is good, the cut off at the knees is very nice, leaves one looking up for more.  The background is a bit wanting for me, too stark, maybe if it was an office setting, rug, with a chair behind him it would be more appealing overall.', '2003-10-10 16:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(446497, 40637, 12448, '<td valign="top">EEEEEKKKKKK!!!!!  I''m hoping this is a reflection of your camera flipped over so the lettering is right!  The shot is done well, the red in the shot throws me off at first but in a nightmare I''m guessing red for blood would be the predominant color, make the water look bloodied as if the camera was bleeding, very good.  The darkness on the left side is a bit distracting, if the lighting was a bit more balanced this would have gotten a 9 or 10 from me.</td>', 'EEEEEKKKKKK!!!!!  I''m hoping this is a reflection of your camera flipped over so the lettering is right!  The shot is done well, the red in the shot throws me off at first but in a nightmare I''m guessing red for blood would be the predominant color, make the water look bloodied as if the camera was bleeding, very good.  The darkness on the left side is a bit distracting, if the lighting was a bit more balanced this would have gotten a 9 or 10 from me.', '2003-10-10 16:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(446500, 40948, 12448, '<td valign="top">The brightness of this shot really threw me at first.  The sun reflecting off the sculpture be a bit blinding.  The title made me think and look at it a couple of times and I''m still a little lost but sadly that is nothing new :)  The reflection of the building on the left is distracting and if you could have come at a slightly different angle to get just the sculpture and the reflection of the sky on the building behind it I would have scored much higher on this one.  Also, just a bit of soft focus to inspire a dream, just a bit to sharp for me ;)</td>', 'The brightness of this shot really threw me at first.  The sun reflecting off the sculpture be a bit blinding.  The title made me think and look at it a couple of times and I''m still a little lost but sadly that is nothing new :)  The reflection of the building on the left is distracting and if you could have come at a slightly different angle to get just the sculpture and the reflection of the sky on the building behind it I would have scored much higher on this one.  Also, just a bit of soft focus to inspire a dream, just a bit to sharp for me ;)', '2003-10-10 16:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(446654, 40934, 2567, '<td valign="top">This is a very sad pic. but the facial expression perfectly matches your title.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is a very sad pic. but the facial expression perfectly matches your title.  Good luck.', '2003-10-10 19:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(446657, 40975, 12448, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, the hair, the silouette, the overall effect is stunning.  The only thing that could have made this a 10 for me personally was a bit of soft focus on the leg area, just slightly to sharp for my taste in a dream manner.</td>', 'I love this shot, the hair, the silouette, the overall effect is stunning.  The only thing that could have made this a 10 for me personally was a bit of soft focus on the leg area, just slightly to sharp for my taste in a dream manner.', '2003-10-10 19:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(446660, 40708, 12448, '<td valign="top">This would be a nightmare for the bride no doubt.  The smeared makeup, the runny nose really add to the shot and make it that much more realistic, I hope it wasn''t real!  The anguish on her face and the  clenched fists really finish this portrait for me.</td>', 'This would be a nightmare for the bride no doubt.  The smeared makeup, the runny nose really add to the shot and make it that much more realistic, I hope it wasn''t real!  The anguish on her face and the  clenched fists really finish this portrait for me.', '2003-10-10 19:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(446663, 40972, 12448, '<td valign="top">At first glance I thought this was a real person and thought, "EWWWW, would would allow themselves to have that stuff put all over them?" , LOL!  But upon closer examination I see it''s a statue, DUH! :)<br/> <br/>This is one of my favs for portrait itself, the lighting, the dark to light, the colors on the statue really appeal to me and the statue gives the impression of a day dreamer, wondering what else is out there.  Well done.</td>', 'At first glance I thought this was a real person and thought, "EWWWW, would would allow themselves to have that stuff put all over them?" , LOL!  But upon closer examination I see it''s a statue, DUH! :) This is one of my favs for portrait itself, the lighting, the dark to light, the colors on the statue really appeal to me and the statue gives the impression of a day dreamer, wondering what else is out there.  Well done.', '2003-10-10 19:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(446666, 40960, 12448, '<td valign="top">I have got to know how these shots are done!  I didn''t think you could do double exposure with a digital!  The surreal quality of the photo is excellent, the man really comes off as a someone watching over her from another plain, the slight furrowing of her brow, the sadness on her face is just right to indicate a slightly restless sleep.  The only think that could have made this better for me is just slight more contrast and a little less light.  Otherwise, excellent.</td>', 'I have got to know how these shots are done!  I didn''t think you could do double exposure with a digital!  The surreal quality of the photo is excellent, the man really comes off as a someone watching over her from another plain, the slight furrowing of her brow, the sadness on her face is just right to indicate a slightly restless sleep.  The only think that could have made this better for me is just slight more contrast and a little less light.  Otherwise, excellent.', '2003-10-10 19:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(446669, 40977, 12448, '<td valign="top">The shower!!!!!!!  EEEEEEEKKKKK!  This reminds me slightly of the Alfred Hitchcock movie, one of my favorite producers.  If this was a curtain and in black and white it would have gotten a 10!  Anyway, the shot itself is well cropped, and the lighting is just about perfect, if it was slightly more red or darker orange I would have given this a 9 or 10.</td>', 'The shower!!!!!!!  EEEEEEEKKKKK!  This reminds me slightly of the Alfred Hitchcock movie, one of my favorite producers.  If this was a curtain and in black and white it would have gotten a 10!  Anyway, the shot itself is well cropped, and the lighting is just about perfect, if it was slightly more red or darker orange I would have given this a 9 or 10.', '2003-10-10 19:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(446677, 40846, 12448, '<td valign="top">OMG, when I first saw this shot I thought to myself, "YIKES!!!!!!!!!!"  As I come back to the shot I am amazed and curious how this is done without smashing the camera and I hope you do provide an answer!<br/> <br/>As for the picture, the motion of the hammer to the clarity of the camera is wonderful, the lighting is a little bright for my taste and the background could be slightly darker to make it perfect for me.</td>', 'OMG, when I first saw this shot I thought to myself, "YIKES!!!!!!!!!!"  As I come back to the shot I am amazed and curious how this is done without smashing the camera and I hope you do provide an answer! As for the picture, the motion of the hammer to the clarity of the camera is wonderful, the lighting is a little bright for my taste and the background could be slightly darker to make it perfect for me.', '2003-10-10 19:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(446681, 40211, 12448, '<td valign="top">And you did just that, have a dream fulfilled!  The clouds reflecting on the lake, the rays of sun peeking over the horizon, the mist on the valley to the left, couldn''t ask for much more.</td>', 'And you did just that, have a dream fulfilled!  The clouds reflecting on the lake, the rays of sun peeking over the horizon, the mist on the valley to the left, couldn''t ask for much more.', '2003-10-10 19:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(446683, 40934, 12448, '<td valign="top">He looks so sad!  What a perfect title for this shot.  The background blends in almost too well but otherwise the capture, the cropping is excellent.</td>', 'He looks so sad!  What a perfect title for this shot.  The background blends in almost too well but otherwise the capture, the cropping is excellent.', '2003-10-10 19:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(446712, 40673, 1236, '<td valign="top">Love it!</td>', 'Love it!', '2003-10-10 21:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(446718, 40916, 6202, '<td valign="top">Wow this really works as a nightmare.  Good capture, seems a little soft but could be movement of the bat too.  Worth a 7 cause it is a nightmare</td>', 'Wow this really works as a nightmare.  Good capture, seems a little soft but could be movement of the bat too.  Worth a 7 cause it is a nightmare', '2003-10-10 22:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(446721, 40737, 12448, '<td valign="top">I like the concept but the shadows and light reflections are a bit too distracting to me.  Maybe if you had come at a different angle or lighted them a little differently?</td>', 'I like the concept but the shadows and light reflections are a bit too distracting to me.  Maybe if you had come at a different angle or lighted them a little differently?', '2003-10-10 22:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(446744, 40914, 12448, '<td valign="top">Hummmmmmmmmm, a frightening image but not that much in daylight, if it was a darker it would be much more scary.  The cropping on the bottom makes me want to know what is on his fingers!</td>', 'Hummmmmmmmmm, a frightening image but not that much in daylight, if it was a darker it would be much more scary.  The cropping on the bottom makes me want to know what is on his fingers!', '2003-10-10 22:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(446745, 40890, 12448, '<td valign="top">This would be my daughter''s dream.  Nice idea, decent candid shot, the light on her shirt makes it a bit washed out on my monitor but the cropping is good to me and the overall effect is well done.</td>', 'This would be my daughter''s dream.  Nice idea, decent candid shot, the light on her shirt makes it a bit washed out on my monitor but the cropping is good to me and the overall effect is well done.', '2003-10-10 22:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(446747, 40831, 12448, '<td valign="top">Huh, my comment disappeared!  EEK!  That''s scarey! ;)<br/> <br/>My comment was basically I can relate to this dream as I have three older brothers who loved model cars.  The only thing that really bothers me about the pink on his face and fingers is that it isn''t extended to the hand on the left, it throws the balance of the photo off for me.</td>', 'Huh, my comment disappeared!  EEK!  That''s scarey! ;) My comment was basically I can relate to this dream as I have three older brothers who loved model cars.  The only thing that really bothers me about the pink on his face and fingers is that it isn''t extended to the hand on the left, it throws the balance of the photo off for me.', '2003-10-10 22:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(446749, 40710, 12448, '<td valign="top">The capture of the flames is great, the way it draws you across the photo is very well done.  Hope you didn''t set this just for the challenge!</td>', 'The capture of the flames is great, the way it draws you across the photo is very well done.  Hope you didn''t set this just for the challenge!', '2003-10-10 22:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(446759, 40900, 12448, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good concept but something about it bothered me and I couldn''t quite put my finger on it until the 4th time I looked at it.  The idea is that the person holding the axe is going to kill the person they are coming up on, correct?  I think at that close a range the axe would be in the striking position, I know, I know, picky but that is what was bothering me! ;)  Excellent photo otherwise, well done in black and white, good contrast and light.</td>', 'Nice shot, good concept but something about it bothered me and I couldn''t quite put my finger on it until the 4th time I looked at it.  The idea is that the person holding the axe is going to kill the person they are coming up on, correct?  I think at that close a range the axe would be in the striking position, I know, I know, picky but that is what was bothering me! ;)  Excellent photo otherwise, well done in black and white, good contrast and light.', '2003-10-10 22:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(446760, 40544, 12448, '<td valign="top">I see where you are going for the dream concept but since you are surrounded it doesn''t really give me a sense of center, maybe it''s the cropping.  The shot itself is very well done, excellent colors, the lighting provides just the right shadows on the other petals.</td>', 'I see where you are going for the dream concept but since you are surrounded it doesn''t really give me a sense of center, maybe it''s the cropping.  The shot itself is very well done, excellent colors, the lighting provides just the right shadows on the other petals.', '2003-10-10 22:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(446769, 40915, 12448, '<td valign="top">LINUS!!!!!!!!!!!!  I love watching that show every year especially now with my girls.  This is an excellent overall shot, the main focus in the front, the sea of orange behind, the only thing that would have made this a 10 for me is if you had one MUCH larger pumpkin to depict the Great pumpkin! ;)</td>', 'LINUS!!!!!!!!!!!!  I love watching that show every year especially now with my girls.  This is an excellent overall shot, the main focus in the front, the sea of orange behind, the only thing that would have made this a 10 for me is if you had one MUCH larger pumpkin to depict the Great pumpkin! ;)', '2003-10-10 23:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(446771, 40807, 12448, '<td valign="top">Oh I don''t know if eating apples would be so bad! ;)  Nice macro shot, good lighting and detail on the apple itself, I would have like to seen the whole apple, maybe next to a Barbie doll, but then that would have been nightmare diet, unrealistic body, LOL!</td>', 'Oh I don''t know if eating apples would be so bad! ;)  Nice macro shot, good lighting and detail on the apple itself, I would have like to seen the whole apple, maybe next to a Barbie doll, but then that would have been nightmare diet, unrealistic body, LOL!', '2003-10-10 23:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(446773, 40863, 12448, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure I see the vision of the nightmare for this shot but the overall shot is not bad.  Good focus, nice lighting.  It does make me think a little of Christine, the Steven King Novel but doesn''t really inspire any fear.</td>', 'I''m not really sure I see the vision of the nightmare for this shot but the overall shot is not bad.  Good focus, nice lighting.  It does make me think a little of Christine, the Steven King Novel but doesn''t really inspire any fear.', '2003-10-10 23:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(446779, 40827, 12448, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful ship!  Too bad you had to get all the other icky stuff in the background!  If there was some way you could have made the sailing ship a little more transparent it would be close to a perfect shot.</td>', 'What a beautiful ship!  Too bad you had to get all the other icky stuff in the background!  If there was some way you could have made the sailing ship a little more transparent it would be close to a perfect shot.', '2003-10-10 23:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(446786, 40779, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very dreamlike quality about this one, the mist rolling in, the small amount of light peeking through the trees but the background is so busy, the lines of the trees seem to chop the picture up for me. Maybe if the focus was more on the branches of the middle tree, not really sure.  But still a very good shot otherwise.</td>', 'Very dreamlike quality about this one, the mist rolling in, the small amount of light peeking through the trees but the background is so busy, the lines of the trees seem to chop the picture up for me. Maybe if the focus was more on the branches of the middle tree, not really sure.  But still a very good shot otherwise.', '2003-10-10 23:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(446789, 40841, 12448, '<td valign="top">Having remembering the first time I saw the movie in the theater and the fear I felt watching that movie, this is really a bit of a let down for me, I''m sorry.  The focus is too sharp, maybe if it was a little softer and the background was a more teal, dea color I think this would have worked much better.</td>', 'Having remembering the first time I saw the movie in the theater and the fear I felt watching that movie, this is really a bit of a let down for me, I''m sorry.  The focus is too sharp, maybe if it was a little softer and the background was a more teal, dea color I think this would have worked much better.', '2003-10-10 23:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(446791, 40735, 12448, '<td valign="top">I too am not a fan of spider so this does instill a bit of fear for me, if it was more focused though I think it would be even more frightening or better lighted.</td>', 'I too am not a fan of spider so this does instill a bit of fear for me, if it was more focused though I think it would be even more frightening or better lighted.', '2003-10-10 23:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(446794, 40503, 12448, '<td valign="top">A very busy shot, took me a minute to really sort it out.  And the color seems off to me, wondering if you played with the colors at all.   If some sense of motion could have been instilled it would really be a frightening idea!</td>', 'A very busy shot, took me a minute to really sort it out.  And the color seems off to me, wondering if you played with the colors at all.   If some sense of motion could have been instilled it would really be a frightening idea!', '2003-10-10 23:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(446796, 40933, 12448, '<td valign="top">The smirk on the face is too fun to make this scary.  If the eyes were more evil looking or scary I think it would have worked much better.  Also if the shot could have been taken so all you saw was the head or even just the eyes peering out.  The contrast seems off a bit to me, a tad to bright.</td>', 'The smirk on the face is too fun to make this scary.  If the eyes were more evil looking or scary I think it would have worked much better.  Also if the shot could have been taken so all you saw was the head or even just the eyes peering out.  The contrast seems off a bit to me, a tad to bright.', '2003-10-10 23:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(446797, 40470, 12448, '<td valign="top">The transprancies of the discs really take away from the idea of UFO''s, if they were more solid looking this shot would have been much better to me.</td>', 'The transprancies of the discs really take away from the idea of UFO''s, if they were more solid looking this shot would have been much better to me.', '2003-10-10 23:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(446800, 40847, 12448, '<td valign="top">The motion of this shot really helps add to it, the intense expression on his face shows how much he is really into his music.  The cropping is a bit tight to me, I would have liked to see the entire guitar if possible but otherwise a nice shot.</td>', 'The motion of this shot really helps add to it, the intense expression on his face shows how much he is really into his music.  The cropping is a bit tight to me, I would have liked to see the entire guitar if possible but otherwise a nice shot.', '2003-10-10 23:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(446802, 40667, 12448, '<td valign="top">I cannot wait to hear how this shot was achieved!  I''ve looked and looked and looked trying to figure it out.  It does represent a drug induced dream for me, not that I would know about those things, LOL.  The colors are great, the reflections are wonderful and the door for escape is a nice way to draw you out of the picture while still keeping you hostage! :)</td>', 'I cannot wait to hear how this shot was achieved!  I''ve looked and looked and looked trying to figure it out.  It does represent a drug induced dream for me, not that I would know about those things, LOL.  The colors are great, the reflections are wonderful and the door for escape is a nice way to draw you out of the picture while still keeping you hostage! :)', '2003-10-10 23:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(446804, 40780, 12448, '<td valign="top">This shot is a bit noisy and grainy to me, the look of surprise is great, the unexpected.  I do like the soft focus too, if it was just a little cleaner.</td>', 'This shot is a bit noisy and grainy to me, the look of surprise is great, the unexpected.  I do like the soft focus too, if it was just a little cleaner.', '2003-10-10 23:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
