(446912, 40975, 1280, '<td valign="top">WOW!  THis image invites the viewer to study it.  The form is not readily identified, but then POW!!! it hits ya.  If you''re looking, I hope you find her. Nice strong image.  I bet it will do well. 10 from me.</td>', 'WOW!  THis image invites the viewer to study it.  The form is not readily identified, but then POW!!! it hits ya.  If you''re looking, I hope you find her. Nice strong image.  I bet it will do well. 10 from me.', '2003-10-11 01:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(446914, 40444, 8953, '<td valign="top">funny...has that saturday night live feeling about it...when Mr. Bill kept meeting his fate. I do not get the dream part so much though.</td>', 'funny...has that saturday night live feeling about it...when Mr. Bill kept meeting his fate. I do not get the dream part so much though.', '2003-10-11 01:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(446917, 40710, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nightmare yes!  Hope no one was injured.  You sure captured the terror.</td>', 'Nightmare yes!  Hope no one was injured.  You sure captured the terror.', '2003-10-11 01:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(446919, 40578, 1280, '<td valign="top">spooky!!! Good job!</td>', 'spooky!!! Good job!', '2003-10-11 01:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(446922, 40542, 8953, '<td valign="top">falling...one of the worst kind of nightmares. you did a good job with this. I had given it a 6 but after taking another look I think you did a fine job. Good contrast and great body position with the doll. The blur really adds nice movement to it as well. good luck 8</td>', 'falling...one of the worst kind of nightmares. you did a good job with this. I had given it a 6 but after taking another look I think you did a fine job. Good contrast and great body position with the doll. The blur really adds nice movement to it as well. good luck 8', '2003-10-11 01:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(446926, 40741, 1280, '<td valign="top">Ohhhh gee.  All these nightmare pics are gonna give me nightmares!  Great detail here, revealing the texture of the soil and the skin. Colouring is good and so is exposure, dof, and comp.  A simple but good picture. 10!</td>', 'Ohhhh gee.  All these nightmare pics are gonna give me nightmares!  Great detail here, revealing the texture of the soil and the skin. Colouring is good and so is exposure, dof, and comp.  A simple but good picture. 10!', '2003-10-11 01:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(446930, 40844, 8953, '<td valign="top">This would have been even more intense if you could have made the stain glass window clear with more contrast. I also would have liked the model a bit more centered. still a very artistic take on the challenge.</td>', 'This would have been even more intense if you could have made the stain glass window clear with more contrast. I also would have liked the model a bit more centered. still a very artistic take on the challenge.', '2003-10-11 01:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(446931, 40934, 1280, '<td valign="top">Vg image of a grizzly.  Dream?  Well it''s not convincing, especially since this shows no sign of captivity.  I believe you, but the picture doesn''t tell the story.</td>', 'Vg image of a grizzly.  Dream?  Well it''s not convincing, especially since this shows no sign of captivity.  I believe you, but the picture doesn''t tell the story.', '2003-10-11 01:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(446936, 40656, 8953, '<td valign="top">the mist effect is fun:) and the model is doing a good job with her expression. I think this shot would have faired better if the charaters were facing one another, and the spook were on the attack as though our heroine were facing impending doom. 5</td>', 'the mist effect is fun:) and the model is doing a good job with her expression. I think this shot would have faired better if the charaters were facing one another, and the spook were on the attack as though our heroine were facing impending doom. 5', '2003-10-11 01:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(446939, 40939, 8953, '<td valign="top">very artistic. the colors are rich, giving the image texture. I ask myself though...what would I see with out the title for guidence?</td>', 'very artistic. the colors are rich, giving the image texture. I ask myself though...what would I see with out the title for guidence?', '2003-10-11 01:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(446941, 40932, 8953, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this image more if the hue and saturation were a little higher. also a greater DOF so that all the roses were in focus. Try spraying with water and using a thin piece of white paper over the flash to difuse the light, the shawdow cast was just a bit to harsh. hope I helped 4</td>', 'I would have liked this image more if the hue and saturation were a little higher. also a greater DOF so that all the roses were in focus. Try spraying with water and using a thin piece of white paper over the flash to difuse the light, the shawdow cast was just a bit to harsh. hope I helped 4', '2003-10-11 01:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(446945, 40689, 8953, '<td valign="top">A nice image and lovely colors. I can not say I feel dream or nightmare here though...another challenge this would fair well. 5</td>', 'A nice image and lovely colors. I can not say I feel dream or nightmare here though...another challenge this would fair well. 5', '2003-10-11 01:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(446948, 40211, 8953, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely shot. the mist just adds so much to this image...indeed a nice sunset. Without the help of the tiltle I am not sure I would have seen dream. In another challenge I would have rated this image much higher. 5</td>', 'This is a lovely shot. the mist just adds so much to this image...indeed a nice sunset. Without the help of the tiltle I am not sure I would have seen dream. In another challenge I would have rated this image much higher. 5', '2003-10-11 01:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(446950, 40503, 4767, '<td valign="top">How interesting!  Good imagination, excellent eye to see this!</td>', 'How interesting!  Good imagination, excellent eye to see this!', '2003-10-11 02:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(446952, 40956, 8953, '<td valign="top">art! lots of color! just can not find a single place to rest the eyes. I would have liked more if I could see something that could stir emotion. 5</td>', 'art! lots of color! just can not find a single place to rest the eyes. I would have liked more if I could see something that could stir emotion. 5', '2003-10-11 02:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(446983, 40470, 10275, '<td valign="top">This is fun shot to look at. I love the abstractiveness of it as well as the blue and purple hues of colours. The lines are just beuatiful. I know it''s in a dead centre as others may suggest, but in this case it works because it''s surrounded by other smaller cirles making it into nice complexity without being too busy.<br/> <br/>My only suggestion is to try using a polarizing filter to avoid some of the reflections in the glass. It might make the sky darker as well, and your circles would stand out more. But you would have to experiment with the filter setting.</td>', 'This is fun shot to look at. I love the abstractiveness of it as well as the blue and purple hues of colours. The lines are just beuatiful. I know it''s in a dead centre as others may suggest, but in this case it works because it''s surrounded by other smaller cirles making it into nice complexity without being too busy. My only suggestion is to try using a polarizing filter to avoid some of the reflections in the glass. It might make the sky darker as well, and your circles would stand out more. But you would have to experiment with the filter setting.', '2003-10-11 04:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(446984, 40975, 10275, '<td valign="top">Beautiful silluette. The hair detail and colours are superb. Clever shot into the light really. The sky colour nicely contrasts with the yellows in the hair. The abstract shape of the silluette makes this very dramatic shot.</td>', 'Beautiful silluette. The hair detail and colours are superb. Clever shot into the light really. The sky colour nicely contrasts with the yellows in the hair. The abstract shape of the silluette makes this very dramatic shot.', '2003-10-11 04:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(446986, 40789, 10275, '<td valign="top">This is very unique shot. I bet in it''s original state it wouldn''t be as dramatic as it is in inverted format. It almost looks like an x-ray of a train. The colours are great - subtle browns and oranges with hint of blue oposite colour. The detail is also amazing, considering this is a negative. Good diagonal composition.</td>', 'This is very unique shot. I bet in it''s original state it wouldn''t be as dramatic as it is in inverted format. It almost looks like an x-ray of a train. The colours are great - subtle browns and oranges with hint of blue oposite colour. The detail is also amazing, considering this is a negative. Good diagonal composition.', '2003-10-11 04:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(446989, 40779, 10275, '<td valign="top">Beautiful fog shot. This has such a peaceful feeling. Colours are very subtle and calming. Sharpness is very good for a shot in a fog. I am just missing a tiny bit of the ground in this shot - it might have contrasted nicely witht he dreamy tree tops. But well done.</td>', 'Beautiful fog shot. This has such a peaceful feeling. Colours are very subtle and calming. Sharpness is very good for a shot in a fog. I am just missing a tiny bit of the ground in this shot - it might have contrasted nicely witht he dreamy tree tops. But well done.', '2003-10-11 04:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(446990, 40710, 10275, '<td valign="top">Very well done. Lovely contrast and colour. Sharpness is great for a fire shot. How did you get so close without melting your camera?  You must be a firefighter. I can see this easily published for an article on forest fires...</td>', 'Very well done. Lovely contrast and colour. Sharpness is great for a fire shot. How did you get so close without melting your camera?  You must be a firefighter. I can see this easily published for an article on forest fires...', '2003-10-11 04:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(446991, 40755, 10275, '<td valign="top">Great sunset colours, beautiful symetry. You probably intended the centred horizon, but I bet it would have looked more dramatic if you had positioned it below or above the centre IMO. No points taken off though. It''s still nice to look at.</td>', 'Great sunset colours, beautiful symetry. You probably intended the centred horizon, but I bet it would have looked more dramatic if you had positioned it below or above the centre IMO. No points taken off though. It''s still nice to look at.', '2003-10-11 04:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(446992, 40934, 10275, '<td valign="top">The details in this shot are amazing. I can almost feel the fur. The bear has such a dreamy look in his face. Too bad the background isn''t different colour (you had no control over that though). I would have cropped the top of the background off just below the dark line that runs across. Other than that, there is not a thing I would change. Well done.</td>', 'The details in this shot are amazing. I can almost feel the fur. The bear has such a dreamy look in his face. Too bad the background isn''t different colour (you had no control over that though). I would have cropped the top of the background off just below the dark line that runs across. Other than that, there is not a thing I would change. Well done.', '2003-10-11 04:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(446993, 40493, 10275, '<td valign="top">I can identify with a dream like this. Great use of soft focus here. Healthy colours, love the diagonal composition. The sharpness is good. My only suggestion is not to cut off the ear.</td>', 'I can identify with a dream like this. Great use of soft focus here. Healthy colours, love the diagonal composition. The sharpness is good. My only suggestion is not to cut off the ear.', '2003-10-11 04:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(446994, 40529, 10275, '<td valign="top">You got great clarity and sharpness. One of the best moon shots on DPC. B&amp;W works great in this case. Be careful though, you are close to blowing out the whites in this shot (upper right) and the blackness is becoming unrealistic. If you look at published shots of Moon, the sky is never this perfect black. But you get high score from me - this is one amazing shot.</td>', 'You got great clarity and sharpness. One of the best moon shots on DPC. B&W works great in this case. Be careful though, you are close to blowing out the whites in this shot (upper right) and the blackness is becoming unrealistic. If you look at published shots of Moon, the sky is never this perfect black. But you get high score from me - this is one amazing shot.', '2003-10-11 04:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(446995, 40834, 10275, '<td valign="top">Very nice dreamy feeling. Love the colours in her face and hair. I also like the thin border in this case. I makes ordinary shot look like a professional portrait. The only thing - I would have made the thin line evenly apart from the edge all around (it looks like it has wider space on the side than on top and bottom).</td>', 'Very nice dreamy feeling. Love the colours in her face and hair. I also like the thin border in this case. I makes ordinary shot look like a professional portrait. The only thing - I would have made the thin line evenly apart from the edge all around (it looks like it has wider space on the side than on top and bottom).', '2003-10-11 04:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(446997, 40946, 10275, '<td valign="top">This is funny :-)) Great clarity and sharpness. But a bit too tightly cropped IMO. You need a slightly more white space on the laft side and on the bottom to balance it off. Other than that, this is almost sotck art quality and idea.</td>', 'This is funny :-)) Great clarity and sharpness. But a bit too tightly cropped IMO. You need a slightly more white space on the laft side and on the bottom to balance it off. Other than that, this is almost sotck art quality and idea.', '2003-10-11 04:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(446998, 40977, 10275, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot and idea. Love the texture and colour. Great off-centre composition. It almost looks like a hand trying to break out of a giant orange :-)) Very well done.</td>', 'Amazing shot and idea. Love the texture and colour. Great off-centre composition. It almost looks like a hand trying to break out of a giant orange :-)) Very well done.', '2003-10-11 04:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(447000, 40846, 10275, '<td valign="top">Good sharpenss and use of colour. Great use of lighting and background. I would have positioned the camera more to the right and the hammer more to the left for a better composition (IMO).</td>', 'Good sharpenss and use of colour. Great use of lighting and background. I would have positioned the camera more to the right and the hammer more to the left for a better composition (IMO).', '2003-10-11 04:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(447001, 40659, 10275, '<td valign="top">This is very artistic. I can definitely see the contrasting figures against the blackness. You have great imagination. I like it soft, any sharper and it would loose it''s dreamy effect.</td>', 'This is very artistic. I can definitely see the contrasting figures against the blackness. You have great imagination. I like it soft, any sharper and it would loose it''s dreamy effect.', '2003-10-11 04:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(447002, 40930, 10275, '<td valign="top">Oh, I can definitely identify with this one. It''s great that it is in b&amp;w - more impact that way. It could use slightly more light (maybe lamp light bounced off a ceiling)...<br/>I would also suggest shooting it from a different angle (you standing more to the left and making the tub diagonal). Good idea and good shot.</td>', 'Oh, I can definitely identify with this one. It''s great that it is in b&w - more impact that way. It could use slightly more light (maybe lamp light bounced off a ceiling)...I would also suggest shooting it from a different angle (you standing more to the left and making the tub diagonal). Good idea and good shot.', '2003-10-11 05:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(447004, 40673, 10275, '<td valign="top">Stunning contrast. Good composition and use of perspective. It leads you into the blackness. The only thing, I would have rotated it only tiny bit clockwise - it\''s kind of leaning towards the left. The Border is OK in this case.</td>', 'Stunning contrast. Good composition and use of perspective. It leads you into the blackness. The only thing, I would have rotated it only tiny bit clockwise - it\''s kind of leaning towards the left. The Border is OK in this case.', '2003-10-11 05:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(447005, 40643, 10275, '<td valign="top">Beatiful idea and composition. Like the simplicity of colour and creative use of shadow. This really has artistic touch to it. I don''t know if the shadow is blurred on purpose, but it nicely contrasts with the sharpness of the dress.</td>', 'Beatiful idea and composition. Like the simplicity of colour and creative use of shadow. This really has artistic touch to it. I don''t know if the shadow is blurred on purpose, but it nicely contrasts with the sharpness of the dress.', '2003-10-11 05:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(447006, 40935, 10275, '<td valign="top">Gread sharpness, dof, and good composition. The idea behind the shot is something I can really identify with. Well done.</td>', 'Gread sharpness, dof, and good composition. The idea behind the shot is something I can really identify with. Well done.', '2003-10-11 05:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(447007, 40827, 9906, '<td valign="top">I love what you were trying in this shot but the modern stuff ruins the effect for me.  Maybe if you coulda moved around a bit or done more with the ''croping''...  I do want to know how you got the nice round "framing" on this one.  I know how it''s done on film but how did you do it here???  Don''t know if it woulda been possible from your potential vantage points but if ya woulda got just the tall ship and some coast and the roundness of the shot it would have been a 9!</td>', 'I love what you were trying in this shot but the modern stuff ruins the effect for me.  Maybe if you coulda moved around a bit or done more with the ''croping''...  I do want to know how you got the nice round "framing" on this one.  I know how it''s done on film but how did you do it here???  Don''t know if it woulda been possible from your potential vantage points but if ya woulda got just the tall ship and some coast and the roundness of the shot it would have been a 9!', '2003-10-11 05:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(447008, 40870, 10275, '<td valign="top">Fun setup, great centre composition which in this case works. Interesting use of sepia tone. The face in the centre is almost creepy :-))) Well done.</td>', 'Fun setup, great centre composition which in this case works. Interesting use of sepia tone. The face in the centre is almost creepy :-))) Well done.', '2003-10-11 05:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(447009, 40737, 10275, '<td valign="top">I really like the shadow the bears cast on the wall. It makes it into interesting shot. The only distracting element is that diagonal line runnig from top centre dowards left. My other suggestion would be to make this image either b&amp;w since there is very little colour or using some prop to cast a bit of colour onto the bears (maybe a lamp with coloured celphane over it). But maybe you dream in b&amp;w - which is OK with me :-))</td>', 'I really like the shadow the bears cast on the wall. It makes it into interesting shot. The only distracting element is that diagonal line runnig from top centre dowards left. My other suggestion would be to make this image either b&w since there is very little colour or using some prop to cast a bit of colour onto the bears (maybe a lamp with coloured celphane over it). But maybe you dream in b&w - which is OK with me :-))', '2003-10-11 05:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(447010, 40545, 10275, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo. Good triangle composition. Like that it is b&amp;w. The only thing distracting is the tie hanging over the left ghost image. Pretty good shot.</td>', 'Interesting photo. Good triangle composition. Like that it is b&w. The only thing distracting is the tie hanging over the left ghost image. Pretty good shot.', '2003-10-11 05:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(447011, 40866, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry to say this shot doesn''t work for me.  I like the Idea but this didn''t ''pop''.  There is a lot of noise in the image.  This to me means (and I may be wrong) that the ISO is too high.  Focus is good!  Who is sitting on the left side???  You can just see from knees down.  This terribly detracts from the shot.  Who sleeps with someone sitting behind them watching them???  More light, different crop, a touch of sharpening and a little more color (B/W???) and this could work.</td>', 'I''m sorry to say this shot doesn''t work for me.  I like the Idea but this didn''t ''pop''.  There is a lot of noise in the image.  This to me means (and I may be wrong) that the ISO is too high.  Focus is good!  Who is sitting on the left side???  You can just see from knees down.  This terribly detracts from the shot.  Who sleeps with someone sitting behind them watching them???  More light, different crop, a touch of sharpening and a little more color (B/W???) and this could work.', '2003-10-11 05:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(447012, 40960, 10275, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of the scene from the movie Sixth Sense. Good use of b&amp;w. The elements on the right and left of the chair are a bit distracting - removing them could have made it cleaner. I am aslo not too keen on the thick black border. It is the darkest part of your photo and takes a bit from the over all dreamy feel of the image.</td>', 'This reminds me of the scene from the movie Sixth Sense. Good use of b&w. The elements on the right and left of the chair are a bit distracting - removing them could have made it cleaner. I am aslo not too keen on the thick black border. It is the darkest part of your photo and takes a bit from the over all dreamy feel of the image.', '2003-10-11 05:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(447013, 40642, 10275, '<td valign="top">Something tells me you know quite a bit about dream translation. This photo is great in every way. Sharpness is superb, composition is very nice, the idea behind this shot is amazingly artistic, and I really like the lighting of this shot. The colours of the sead pod nicely contrast with the greyness of the ground. Sorry I cannot tell you what''s wrong with this, as I would not change a thing. Very well done.</td>', 'Something tells me you know quite a bit about dream translation. This photo is great in every way. Sharpness is superb, composition is very nice, the idea behind this shot is amazingly artistic, and I really like the lighting of this shot. The colours of the sead pod nicely contrast with the greyness of the ground. Sorry I cannot tell you what''s wrong with this, as I would not change a thing. Very well done.', '2003-10-11 05:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(447014, 40831, 10275, '<td valign="top">Great triangular composition. I am not too keen on the colour desaturation as it only works if one part of the photo has colour and the rest is without. Also the border is very overpowering your otherwise great image. Making it thinner would have helped a lot.</td>', 'Great triangular composition. I am not too keen on the colour desaturation as it only works if one part of the photo has colour and the rest is without. Also the border is very overpowering your otherwise great image. Making it thinner would have helped a lot.', '2003-10-11 05:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(447015, 40807, 10275, '<td valign="top">Simplicity. This is fun image and the idea behind it. You could have used different coloured background to add some spunk, but it is not bad as is. Centred composition is OK in this case as you cropped it creatively.</td>', 'Simplicity. This is fun image and the idea behind it. You could have used different coloured background to add some spunk, but it is not bad as is. Centred composition is OK in this case as you cropped it creatively.', '2003-10-11 05:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(447016, 40855, 10275, '<td valign="top">I would like to know the idea behind this shot, as it doens''t immediately portrais dream or nightmare. But if you explain it to me I might score you higher.</td>', 'I would like to know the idea behind this shot, as it doens''t immediately portrais dream or nightmare. But if you explain it to me I might score you higher.', '2003-10-11 05:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(447017, 40922, 10275, '<td valign="top">This is funny. Love the b&amp;w treatment of it as well as the title. I don''t usually die in my dreams, but some of them ARE b&amp;w. Do you in your dream see more detail in the dark parts of the shot? Also are your lighter dream parts as grainy? Just a suggestion. Good fun shot.</td>', 'This is funny. Love the b&w treatment of it as well as the title. I don''t usually die in my dreams, but some of them ARE b&w. Do you in your dream see more detail in the dark parts of the shot? Also are your lighter dream parts as grainy? Just a suggestion. Good fun shot.', '2003-10-11 05:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(447018, 40831, 9906, '<td valign="top">This looks like a stock foto so will critique as such.  Focus is nice one the nands/glue/car!  Not sure I like the apparent desaturation down to the red car.  IHMO in this shot I would like the color back.   The glue tube is backwards.  Would raher not see the UPC<br/> <br/> (Not DPC legal) After voting of course...get rid of the (clone out?) the counter top under the kids left hand.</td>', 'This looks like a stock foto so will critique as such.  Focus is nice one the nands/glue/car!  Not sure I like the apparent desaturation down to the red car.  IHMO in this shot I would like the color back.   The glue tube is backwards.  Would raher not see the UPC  (Not DPC legal) After voting of course...get rid of the (clone out?) the counter top under the kids left hand.', '2003-10-11 05:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(447020, 40900, 10275, '<td valign="top">Scary. You have probably added noise to this image on purpose, so I woun''t comment on that. Composition is not bad as my eyes go from the front foot to the axe directly. If you wanted to portray fear, dirty dark feeling of despair, you have succeeded. It reminds me of some scene from X-Files :-)))</td>', 'Scary. You have probably added noise to this image on purpose, so I woun''t comment on that. Composition is not bad as my eyes go from the front foot to the axe directly. If you wanted to portray fear, dirty dark feeling of despair, you have succeeded. It reminds me of some scene from X-Files :-)))', '2003-10-11 05:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(447021, 40667, 10275, '<td valign="top">Nicely setup. It makes me want to come into your image and open that door :-)) The composition works well, as the small hallway leads you to the door. The colours are really dream-like.  I don''t like the black border as there is almost no black in the image itself so it overpowers it a bit.</td>', 'Nicely setup. It makes me want to come into your image and open that door :-)) The composition works well, as the small hallway leads you to the door. The colours are really dream-like.  I don''t like the black border as there is almost no black in the image itself so it overpowers it a bit.', '2003-10-11 05:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(447022, 40172, 10275, '<td valign="top">This is very interesting shot. I cannot figure out how you did it and it intriques me. It looks very artistic. I love the texture of the water and the contrast between the light and the darks.</td>', 'This is very interesting shot. I cannot figure out how you did it and it intriques me. It looks very artistic. I love the texture of the water and the contrast between the light and the darks.', '2003-10-11 05:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(447024, 40509, 10275, '<td valign="top">Sweet image. Nice, gentle pastel colours fit well with the theme. It has dreamy feeling to it. Here are my suggestions: when using flash, in this case, it would have helped to diffuse it tiny bit to avoid the hot spots - the highlight areas with pure white that distract from the very soft feeling. The other thing, I would have pulled up the right string a bit more to tilt the moon making it into more pleaseing composition. Itsy bitsy sharpenning could help as well.</td>', 'Sweet image. Nice, gentle pastel colours fit well with the theme. It has dreamy feeling to it. Here are my suggestions: when using flash, in this case, it would have helped to diffuse it tiny bit to avoid the hot spots - the highlight areas with pure white that distract from the very soft feeling. The other thing, I would have pulled up the right string a bit more to tilt the moon making it into more pleaseing composition. Itsy bitsy sharpenning could help as well.', '2003-10-11 05:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(447026, 40539, 10275, '<td valign="top">I can really identify with this idea. Composition is good, but the whole image needs a tiny bit of more light to balance it off. The hot spot around the nightlight draws your eyes away from the main subject.</td>', 'I can really identify with this idea. Composition is good, but the whole image needs a tiny bit of more light to balance it off. The hot spot around the nightlight draws your eyes away from the main subject.', '2003-10-11 05:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(447028, 40337, 10275, '<td valign="top">Interesting colour contrast. This is good closeup. Like the positioning of the face diagonally. I like the border as it mimics some of the lines in the face. The blurriness is OK as this is a dream. Scary childhood you must have had :-))) (just kidding).</td>', 'Interesting colour contrast. This is good closeup. Like the positioning of the face diagonally. I like the border as it mimics some of the lines in the face. The blurriness is OK as this is a dream. Scary childhood you must have had :-))) (just kidding).', '2003-10-11 06:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(447029, 40960, 10858, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo, congratulations!</td>', 'Wonderful photo, congratulations!', '2003-10-11 06:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(447031, 40735, 10275, '<td valign="top">Yes, this is my nightmare too. Many times. I am terrified of them, so when they creep into my dreams I am ready to scream.<br/> <br/>I really like that you have it as a silluette with shallow dof. It works well. It''s still pretty sharp as I can see the tiny creepy hair on the legs. You succeeded in creeping me out :-))</td>', 'Yes, this is my nightmare too. Many times. I am terrified of them, so when they creep into my dreams I am ready to scream. I really like that you have it as a silluette with shallow dof. It works well. It''s still pretty sharp as I can see the tiny creepy hair on the legs. You succeeded in creeping me out :-))', '2003-10-11 06:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(447033, 40780, 10858, '<td valign="top">That''s a wondereous one. Was the noise used on purpose?</td>', 'That''s a wondereous one. Was the noise used on purpose?', '2003-10-11 06:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(447034, 40831, 10858, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Maybe the frame is a bit wide...</td>', 'Very nice shot. Maybe the frame is a bit wide...', '2003-10-11 06:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(447035, 40348, 10275, '<td valign="top">The bottom of the image is gloomy and dark and definitely dream-like, but the top is bright and cheery which throws it off. I do like the symetry of it. Why not photograph the bell tower if that''s what you are affraid off.</td>', 'The bottom of the image is gloomy and dark and definitely dream-like, but the top is bright and cheery which throws it off. I do like the symetry of it. Why not photograph the bell tower if that''s what you are affraid off.', '2003-10-11 06:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(447036, 40211, 10858, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, and the reflection is also enermous!</td>', 'Beautiful, and the reflection is also enermous!', '2003-10-11 06:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(447038, 40493, 10858, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!</td>', 'Very nice shot!', '2003-10-11 06:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(447039, 40457, 10858, '<td valign="top">A wonderful, living topic!</td>', 'A wonderful, living topic!', '2003-10-11 06:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(447040, 40634, 10275, '<td valign="top">Nice cloud opening. You get a good scale of shades without having the lights blown out which is very good. <br/> <br/>But I can see lots of grain/noise in the darker parts - which means either you have oversharpened it or used faster ISO. I would have also cropped out the blue bit in the upper right corner.</td>', 'Nice cloud opening. You get a good scale of shades without having the lights blown out which is very good.  But I can see lots of grain/noise in the darker parts - which means either you have oversharpened it or used faster ISO. I would have also cropped out the blue bit in the upper right corner.', '2003-10-11 06:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(447041, 40846, 10858, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot! Congratulations!</td>', 'Very nice shot! Congratulations!', '2003-10-11 06:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(447043, 40974, 10858, '<td valign="top">Good idea, the ball of lightning. Was the reflection of the face on purpose? Very nice shot, congratulations!</td>', 'Good idea, the ball of lightning. Was the reflection of the face on purpose? Very nice shot, congratulations!', '2003-10-11 06:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(447044, 40445, 10275, '<td valign="top">Looks like alient planet :-)) Interesting choice of colours - makes it feel very cheery. I do not like the centre composition in this case and the sky is a bit pixelated. Love the clouds though (best part of your image).</td>', 'Looks like alient planet :-)) Interesting choice of colours - makes it feel very cheery. I do not like the centre composition in this case and the sky is a bit pixelated. Love the clouds though (best part of your image).', '2003-10-11 06:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(447046, 40934, 10858, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot! Although, it may be a bit more realistic with some bars of grids, but the look of the bear is very talking.</td>', 'Wonderful shot! Although, it may be a bit more realistic with some bars of grids, but the look of the bear is very talking.', '2003-10-11 06:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(447047, 40933, 10275, '<td valign="top">I can''t stop lauging. Looks like dracula on vacation... The composition is very interesting, but the front branch across the image somehow doesn''t work for me. Maybe just separating the face a bit from the branch. You have good clarity in this image. Everything is sharp. The face shines like a moon :-)) This is one bad dream allright :-))</td>', 'I can''t stop lauging. Looks like dracula on vacation... The composition is very interesting, but the front branch across the image somehow doesn''t work for me. Maybe just separating the face a bit from the branch. You have good clarity in this image. Everything is sharp. The face shines like a moon :-)) This is one bad dream allright :-))', '2003-10-11 06:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(447048, 40733, 10858, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot! Maybe if you turn the frog a bit more out, it seems much more like a frog. But very good topic, very good technics.</td>', 'Very nice shot! Maybe if you turn the frog a bit more out, it seems much more like a frog. But very good topic, very good technics.', '2003-10-11 06:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(447049, 40708, 10858, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, talking shot!</td>', 'Beautiful, talking shot!', '2003-10-11 06:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(447051, 40211, 10275, '<td valign="top">Dream on... (just kidding :-)))  Lovely dreamy picture. Too bad your sun is too centred. But I really love the fog in the image - it is very beautiful. Unless you intended it, it also out of focus slightly.</td>', 'Dream on... (just kidding :-)))  Lovely dreamy picture. Too bad your sun is too centred. But I really love the fog in the image - it is very beautiful. Unless you intended it, it also out of focus slightly.', '2003-10-11 06:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(447052, 40971, 10858, '<td valign="top">Wow, really shocking. :-) Did you make the "closed webpage" at your own?</td>', 'Wow, really shocking. :-) Did you make the "closed webpage" at your own?', '2003-10-11 06:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(447053, 40834, 10858, '<td valign="top">Nice one.</td>', 'Nice one.', '2003-10-11 06:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(447055, 40445, 10858, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot!</td>', 'Wonderful shot!', '2003-10-11 06:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(447057, 40866, 10275, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.... after full night on DPC no wonder :-)))  Good sharpness and light. Colour is well balanced (no cast). If this is a candid snapshot - then good work, otherwise you shoul have asked the other person in the shot to move away. Somehow the legs don''t belong in the image.</td>', 'Hmmm.... after full night on DPC no wonder :-)))  Good sharpness and light. Colour is well balanced (no cast). If this is a candid snapshot - then good work, otherwise you shoul have asked the other person in the shot to move away. Somehow the legs don''t belong in the image.', '2003-10-11 06:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(447058, 40936, 10275, '<td valign="top">Nice dream, can I join in?  Like the soft feeling of this shot. My suggestion - more space above and below the angel, and less space on the left to balance the image off.</td>', 'Nice dream, can I join in?  Like the soft feeling of this shot. My suggestion - more space above and below the angel, and less space on the left to balance the image off.', '2003-10-11 06:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(447059, 40744, 10275, '<td valign="top">Hmm.... there is nothing better than monching on some plaster :-))) (just kidding).<br/>I really love your smoke effect. It certainly ads dreaminess into your image. Composition is good, but I wouldn''t have chopped off the knife and spoon.  I also do not like the thin border as the rest of the image is very soft - the border is too sharp for it (just my taste).</td>', 'Hmm.... there is nothing better than monching on some plaster :-))) (just kidding).I really love your smoke effect. It certainly ads dreaminess into your image. Composition is good, but I wouldn''t have chopped off the knife and spoon.  I also do not like the thin border as the rest of the image is very soft - the border is too sharp for it (just my taste).', '2003-10-11 06:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(447060, 40741, 10275, '<td valign="top">Uuuu, are you a forensic pathologist? Great shot and really good portrayal of grittiness. The forefront is a bit fuzzy, and I would also suggest not to cut off the thumb - either leave it in or cropp it off.</td>', 'Uuuu, are you a forensic pathologist? Great shot and really good portrayal of grittiness. The forefront is a bit fuzzy, and I would also suggest not to cut off the thumb - either leave it in or cropp it off.', '2003-10-11 06:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(447061, 40576, 10275, '<td valign="top">Nice couple. His head shouldn''t have been cut off. Her skin looks very waxy. Are these mannekins? (just kidding). Your photo does have a dreamy look.</td>', 'Nice couple. His head shouldn''t have been cut off. Her skin looks very waxy. Are these mannekins? (just kidding). Your photo does have a dreamy look.', '2003-10-11 06:32:13.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(447062, 40889, 10275, '<td valign="top">Great portrayal of agnry nightmare. It almost looks like the hand belongs to the shadow. The shadow adds drama. Good composition as your eyes glide from his face to the axe and back. Good that this is in b&amp;w. Halloween is coming, no mask neede for you :-))</td>', 'Great portrayal of agnry nightmare. It almost looks like the hand belongs to the shadow. The shadow adds drama. Good composition as your eyes glide from his face to the axe and back. Good that this is in b&w. Halloween is coming, no mask neede for you :-))', '2003-10-11 06:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(447063, 40972, 10275, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Love the texture on the statue. You have nice contrast of the black with the colours of the statue and the sky. My only suggestion would be to boost the sky colour a bit to complement the orange in the statue.</td>', 'Interesting shot. Love the texture on the statue. You have nice contrast of the black with the colours of the statue and the sky. My only suggestion would be to boost the sky colour a bit to complement the orange in the statue.', '2003-10-11 06:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(447064, 40708, 10275, '<td valign="top">Very good sad portrait. The skin looks really good and soft. Great diagonal composition. I would have included more space above her and on the right for better balance.</td>', 'Very good sad portrait. The skin looks really good and soft. Great diagonal composition. I would have included more space above her and on the right for better balance.', '2003-10-11 06:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(447066, 40969, 10275, '<td valign="top">Great colours and clarity. Good focus. My suggestion - prop the helmet and don''t include the hand in the image. Also use smaller aperture to have the helmet in focus but the background blurry to emphasize the helmet not the green pompons. Composition is good.</td>', 'Great colours and clarity. Good focus. My suggestion - prop the helmet and don''t include the hand in the image. Also use smaller aperture to have the helmet in focus but the background blurry to emphasize the helmet not the green pompons. Composition is good.', '2003-10-11 06:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(447067, 40544, 10275, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of yellow flower. It would have been nice if you removed the bottom right flower out of the way to only have the grea pattern of the main flower. Also, the image appears quite grainy - maybe you are using high ISO or you are oversharpening. I don''t want to hurt your feelings, but without the title, this doesn''t belong in this challenge.</td>', 'Nice shot of yellow flower. It would have been nice if you removed the bottom right flower out of the way to only have the grea pattern of the main flower. Also, the image appears quite grainy - maybe you are using high ISO or you are oversharpening. I don''t want to hurt your feelings, but without the title, this doesn''t belong in this challenge.', '2003-10-11 06:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(447068, 40863, 10275, '<td valign="top">Without the title, this has nothing to do with dreams or nightmares. Sorry.</td>', 'Without the title, this has nothing to do with dreams or nightmares. Sorry.', '2003-10-11 06:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(447069, 40542, 10275, '<td valign="top">good concept, nice motion blurr. you met the challenge in an interesting way. I can still see remnants of a hand or something behind it - the black is not completely black. Also it is cropped in such a way, that the image is not balanced - meaning you need more on the left and bottom. There is tiny bit of colour noise present - did you considered running this as b&amp;w...</td>', 'good concept, nice motion blurr. you met the challenge in an interesting way. I can still see remnants of a hand or something behind it - the black is not completely black. Also it is cropped in such a way, that the image is not balanced - meaning you need more on the left and bottom. There is tiny bit of colour noise present - did you considered running this as b&w...', '2003-10-11 06:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(447071, 40457, 10275, '<td valign="top">Good concept and setup. I like that you used b&amp;w. There are few things that could be fixed - the darks lost all deatils, the right upper corner hightlights are blown out, the whole image could be rotated very slightly counterclockwise (it''s leaning towards right), and the person should be more in focus than the train.</td>', 'Good concept and setup. I like that you used b&w. There are few things that could be fixed - the darks lost all deatils, the right upper corner hightlights are blown out, the whole image could be rotated very slightly counterclockwise (it''s leaning towards right), and the person should be more in focus than the train.', '2003-10-11 06:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(447072, 40868, 10275, '<td valign="top">As you title suggests, there somehow should be a person in this shot. Your photo has a nice abastractiveness to it. Lovely blue colour - too bad the sand is not more oringy to give contrast to the blue. Love how it sparkles, but it could be more in focus (the whole image is a bit pixelated).</td>', 'As you title suggests, there somehow should be a person in this shot. Your photo has a nice abastractiveness to it. Lovely blue colour - too bad the sand is not more oringy to give contrast to the blue. Love how it sparkles, but it could be more in focus (the whole image is a bit pixelated).', '2003-10-11 06:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(447073, 40876, 10275, '<td valign="top">Funny. I got your joke, but I do not like the colour treatment of this (just my taste). The whole image could be rotated clockwise to adjust that it''s leaning towards the laft. It is also too centred for this to be effective. It looks really like a quick snapshot of someone with fancy colour-channel work. Sorry.</td>', 'Funny. I got your joke, but I do not like the colour treatment of this (just my taste). The whole image could be rotated clockwise to adjust that it''s leaning towards the laft. It is also too centred for this to be effective. It looks really like a quick snapshot of someone with fancy colour-channel work. Sorry.', '2003-10-11 07:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(447074, 40958, 10275, '<td valign="top">Concept and idea is very good, but the image suffers from serious pixelation problem. The texture looks nice but because it is pixelated, you loose most of it. Also the spider is too centered (it is only slightly off centre but not enough for it to work). The whole shot could also use a contrast adjustment.</td>', 'Concept and idea is very good, but the image suffers from serious pixelation problem. The texture looks nice but because it is pixelated, you loose most of it. Also the spider is too centered (it is only slightly off centre but not enough for it to work). The whole shot could also use a contrast adjustment.', '2003-10-11 07:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(447075, 40656, 10275, '<td valign="top">I know you tried for a misty look, but the whole image lacks contrast which makes it harder to look at. The lady also looks like half laughing - her eyes give her away. She doesn''t look scared. Are you using too much compression? - the image is pixelated and grainy.</td>', 'I know you tried for a misty look, but the whole image lacks contrast which makes it harder to look at. The lady also looks like half laughing - her eyes give her away. She doesn''t look scared. Are you using too much compression? - the image is pixelated and grainy.', '2003-10-11 07:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(447077, 40939, 10275, '<td valign="top">I respect your vision of nuclear, but this to me doesn''t portray it. Your image is very pixelated and grainy. Your border is greenishgrey - make it black to be more effective. I don''t want to hurt your feelings, but this is just not very interesting to look at.</td>', 'I respect your vision of nuclear, but this to me doesn''t portray it. Your image is very pixelated and grainy. Your border is greenishgrey - make it black to be more effective. I don''t want to hurt your feelings, but this is just not very interesting to look at.', '2003-10-11 07:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(447078, 40962, 10275, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but your image is to posterized and pixelated to be effective. It lacks the needed contrast between lights and darks. It doesn''t look like photograph at all. Why the coloured border? It doesn''t fit with the image.</td>', 'I like the concept, but your image is to posterized and pixelated to be effective. It lacks the needed contrast between lights and darks. It doesn''t look like photograph at all. Why the coloured border? It doesn''t fit with the image.', '2003-10-11 07:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(447079, 40893, 10275, '<td valign="top">I sure hope my son never gets to meet this creature. Scarry... Great colours and contrasts. What is it picture of? Almost doesn''t look like a photo at all.</td>', 'I sure hope my son never gets to meet this creature. Scarry... Great colours and contrasts. What is it picture of? Almost doesn''t look like a photo at all.', '2003-10-11 07:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(447080, 40537, 10275, '<td valign="top">The whole image is pixelated and out of focus. I am sure it has a great emotional value to you, but IMO it doesn''t have much of an artistic value. I don''t want to hurt your feelings, but it is very boring to look at.</td>', 'The whole image is pixelated and out of focus. I am sure it has a great emotional value to you, but IMO it doesn''t have much of an artistic value. I don''t want to hurt your feelings, but it is very boring to look at.', '2003-10-11 07:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(447081, 40857, 10275, '<td valign="top">You have some great colour in this image. It''s simple, like the black background. But was the blur intentional? It really spoiled otherwise OK image.</td>', 'You have some great colour in this image. It''s simple, like the black background. But was the blur intentional? It really spoiled otherwise OK image.', '2003-10-11 07:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(447083, 40723, 10275, '<td valign="top">This image looks like you accidentally pressed the shutter without knowing it, while having a finger over your lense. I don''t want to sound harsh or hurt your feelings (in case you are a young child), but you should not be submitting photos if you are not sure that they are your best. In case this is your best, than I apologize.</td>', 'This image looks like you accidentally pressed the shutter without knowing it, while having a finger over your lense. I don''t want to sound harsh or hurt your feelings (in case you are a young child), but you should not be submitting photos if you are not sure that they are your best. In case this is your best, than I apologize.', '2003-10-11 07:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(447085, 40527, 10275, '<td valign="top">What could help this photo is a closer zoom to the subject and different cropping. There is way to much black negative space for this to be effective photo. The colours are really nice and it''s pretty sharp.</td>', 'What could help this photo is a closer zoom to the subject and different cropping. There is way to much black negative space for this to be effective photo. The colours are really nice and it''s pretty sharp.', '2003-10-11 07:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(447087, 40780, 10275, '<td valign="top">This is very powerfu image of a child''s fear. But I don''t like the noise you added to it. It really distracts from the shadowy feeling. (just my taste)</td>', 'This is very powerfu image of a child''s fear. But I don''t like the noise you added to it. It really distracts from the shadowy feeling. (just my taste)', '2003-10-11 07:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(447088, 40947, 10275, '<td valign="top">Good colour of the dolls, they almost glow. This is highly symbolic as I suspect. I don''t like the composition. It looks too quickly prepared, not enough time spent carefully framing the shot.</td>', 'Good colour of the dolls, they almost glow. This is highly symbolic as I suspect. I don''t like the composition. It looks too quickly prepared, not enough time spent carefully framing the shot.', '2003-10-11 07:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(447089, 40915, 10275, '<td valign="top">Of course, it''s that time of the year. Without the title, this doesn''t belong in this challenge. Unless you freequently dream about pumpkins :-)) But for what it''s worth - the centre composition and the tight crop makes this a very average photo.</td>', 'Of course, it''s that time of the year. Without the title, this doesn''t belong in this challenge. Unless you freequently dream about pumpkins :-)) But for what it''s worth - the centre composition and the tight crop makes this a very average photo.', '2003-10-11 07:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(447103, 40313, 10275, '<td valign="top">I didn''t mean to offend you with my original comment. This was more than 2 years ago. I meant no harm. Sorry.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-03-31 02:35:14.</i></td>', 'I didn''t mean to offend you with my original comment. This was more than 2 years ago. I meant no harm. Sorry.', '2003-10-11 08:45:54.000000', '2006-03-31 03:35:14.000000', 1),
(447104, 40695, 10275, '<td valign="top">Good sharpness. Clock has almost midnight - funny. It is a bit too busy though. Also, technicolour means almost like a rainbow colours. Yours seem more pastel like. All I suggest is - simplify.</td>', 'Good sharpness. Clock has almost midnight - funny. It is a bit too busy though. Also, technicolour means almost like a rainbow colours. Yours seem more pastel like. All I suggest is - simplify.', '2003-10-11 08:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(447115, 40545, 10510, '<td valign="top">I love this photo even though the shadow of the man with the knife is very disturbing.  Scary!  Do you have any outtakes without the man that would depict an out of body experience?  That would be cool.  10</td>', 'I love this photo even though the shadow of the man with the knife is very disturbing.  Scary!  Do you have any outtakes without the man that would depict an out of body experience?  That would be cool.  10', '2003-10-11 09:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(447117, 40659, 10510, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  I''m thinking it is smoke so it is fascinating how you captured it to actually look like shrouded souls.  10</td>', 'This is beautiful.  I''m thinking it is smoke so it is fascinating how you captured it to actually look like shrouded souls.  10', '2003-10-11 10:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(447119, 40946, 10510, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  Very funny too.</td>', 'Great photo.  Very funny too.', '2003-10-11 10:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(447134, 40642, 6624, '<td valign="top">I love the originality of this response to the challenge - I wish the ''fruit/seeds'' had more impact or that the rock were more exciting so I could have put it at the top 7</td>', 'I love the originality of this response to the challenge - I wish the ''fruit/seeds'' had more impact or that the rock were more exciting so I could have put it at the top 7', '2003-10-11 11:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(447164, 40862, 8953, '<td valign="top">Nice interplay of hue and light. the trail moves me into the image well. I had scored this a 6 the first time through, but looking again, I find this a strong interpretation of the challenge...Good Luck 9</td>', 'Nice interplay of hue and light. the trail moves me into the image well. I had scored this a 6 the first time through, but looking again, I find this a strong interpretation of the challenge...Good Luck 9', '2003-10-11 12:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(447165, 40833, 8953, '<td valign="top">Droping through the trees to the ground...wow! I can feel it! the colors add a dark ominous sense. good job 8</td>', 'Droping through the trees to the ground...wow! I can feel it! the colors add a dark ominous sense. good job 8', '2003-10-11 12:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(447167, 40893, 8953, '<td valign="top">very artistic take on the challenge. hard to see any distinct focus point other than the teeth. It appears to be a photo of a picture. not a bad take overall on the challenge IMO but just a bit to abstract. 6<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-10-13 23:54:10.</i></td>', 'very artistic take on the challenge. hard to see any distinct focus point other than the teeth. It appears to be a photo of a picture. not a bad take overall on the challenge IMO but just a bit to abstract. 6', '2003-10-11 12:31:21.000000', '2003-10-14 00:54:10.000000', 1),
(447172, 40972, 8953, '<td valign="top">I would love to know more about this monument. A nice use of low light. the way the statue is surounded by the dark and the age of the metal, gives this an almost foreboding quality with also a feeling of hope in the way its gaze is to the heavens. though i do not get the feeling of dream or nightmare, i still think this is a well done photo. 7</td>', 'I would love to know more about this monument. A nice use of low light. the way the statue is surounded by the dark and the age of the metal, gives this an almost foreboding quality with also a feeling of hope in the way its gaze is to the heavens. though i do not get the feeling of dream or nightmare, i still think this is a well done photo. 7', '2003-10-11 12:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(447174, 40219, 8953, '<td valign="top">The light not having made it all the way down the well gives this a nice spooky feel. I would have liked it more if you could have used a more natural light or if ther were away to have soften the contrast. hope I helped</td>', 'The light not having made it all the way down the well gives this a nice spooky feel. I would have liked it more if you could have used a more natural light or if ther were away to have soften the contrast. hope I helped', '2003-10-11 12:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
