(447204, 40954, 2612, '<td valign="top"><br/>First let me say that this is a really nice image, so take my comments as thoughts rather than  negatives. The blue affect is slick, but the models shadow on the left is well defined which doesn''t support the mode. I''m not sure why the camera is facing back, but that is probably just an artistic element that I''m missing, so no impact to score. I think I have some of the same photographer dreams, to bad I don''t have the creativity to come through with an image like this.</td>', 'First let me say that this is a really nice image, so take my comments as thoughts rather than  negatives. The blue affect is slick, but the models shadow on the left is well defined which doesn''t support the mode. I''m not sure why the camera is facing back, but that is probably just an artistic element that I''m missing, so no impact to score. I think I have some of the same photographer dreams, to bad I don''t have the creativity to come through with an image like this.', '2003-10-11 14:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
