(447218, 40733, 8953, '<td valign="top">what a pucker! wonderful image. and I get a kick out of the way you interpreted the challenge good colors and use of thirds. nice manicure on the models hands as well. I think important in keeping from distracting from the rest of the shot. Lots of Luck! 8</td>', 'what a pucker! wonderful image. and I get a kick out of the way you interpreted the challenge good colors and use of thirds. nice manicure on the models hands as well. I think important in keeping from distracting from the rest of the shot. Lots of Luck! 8', '2003-10-11 14:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
