(447571, 40833, 10275, '<td valign="top">Ok, I am such a goof, that when I went to add text to my original comment on this image, I accidentally removed it. Please forgive me. <br/> <br/>I missed the point of this photo the first time around. Thank you for explaining it to me. It makes total sense now as does the border around it. I also know why I didn''t get it the first time. It has to do with my own perception of what you are trying to convey.<br/> <br/>Now that I had time to think about it, I think this would have been more powerful if it were shot from higher above. It only looks few feet of the ground. That''s why it didn''t click with me as fear of heights. I stil stand by my original comment that it is a pretty good photo. So there you have it, I am done for now :-))) Hopefully this time I will add this comment as opposed to removing it...</td>', 'Ok, I am such a goof, that when I went to add text to my original comment on this image, I accidentally removed it. Please forgive me.  I missed the point of this photo the first time around. Thank you for explaining it to me. It makes total sense now as does the border around it. I also know why I didn''t get it the first time. It has to do with my own perception of what you are trying to convey. Now that I had time to think about it, I think this would have been more powerful if it were shot from higher above. It only looks few feet of the ground. That''s why it didn''t click with me as fear of heights. I stil stand by my original comment that it is a pretty good photo. So there you have it, I am done for now :-))) Hopefully this time I will add this comment as opposed to removing it...', '2003-10-12 03:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
