(447770, 40889, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun, dramatic shot. You might want to experiment with point of view. The viewer is currently above the attacker, visually weakening him. The lighting is very nicely done!</td>', 'Fun, dramatic shot. You might want to experiment with point of view. The viewer is currently above the attacker, visually weakening him. The lighting is very nicely done!', '2003-10-12 12:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(447771, 40457, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty good interpretation of the challenge.  Nice focus on the train, a little soft on the victim (IMHO).  I would have liked a little more DOF.  As far as composition, is that really a train (you''re too close to tell what it is...)?  Is she really on train tracks (looks like a barn floor or something)?  The glasses and the t-shirt kinda detract from the feel you get with the B/W treatment here also.  Still a great entrie!</td>', 'This is a pretty good interpretation of the challenge.  Nice focus on the train, a little soft on the victim (IMHO).  I would have liked a little more DOF.  As far as composition, is that really a train (you''re too close to tell what it is...)?  Is she really on train tracks (looks like a barn floor or something)?  The glasses and the t-shirt kinda detract from the feel you get with the B/W treatment here also.  Still a great entrie!', '2003-10-12 12:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(447772, 40934, 6870, '<td valign="top">Now THAT is a dreamy expression, captured well.</td>', 'Now THAT is a dreamy expression, captured well.', '2003-10-12 12:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
