(447777, 40930, 9906, '<td valign="top">I have looked at this shot SOOOO many times.  Couldn''t make myself vote on it though.  It is definatly a parents worst nightmare.  Awesome (if emotionaly hard to look at) shot!  What would have made it perfect?  The model (your son?  How old?) looks a little forced.  The head being perfectly up and down and the arm outside the tub makes it look like a breath holding contest.  Love the focus, B/W treatment, DOF.  One of my top votes if not one of my favorites!</td>', 'I have looked at this shot SOOOO many times.  Couldn''t make myself vote on it though.  It is definatly a parents worst nightmare.  Awesome (if emotionaly hard to look at) shot!  What would have made it perfect?  The model (your son?  How old?) looks a little forced.  The head being perfectly up and down and the arm outside the tub makes it look like a breath holding contest.  Love the focus, B/W treatment, DOF.  One of my top votes if not one of my favorites!', '2003-10-12 13:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
