(447921, 40934, 7504, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, he does have a whistful look in his eyes.</td>', 'Ahhh, he does have a whistful look in his eyes.', '2003-10-12 19:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(447923, 40971, 7504, '<td valign="top">NO!!!!!!!!!! Good shot I like the effect and the clean lines.</td>', 'NO!!!!!!!!!! Good shot I like the effect and the clean lines.', '2003-10-12 19:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(447924, 40915, 7504, '<td valign="top">Hooray for Linus!!  I like this, good job.</td>', 'Hooray for Linus!!  I like this, good job.', '2003-10-12 19:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(447934, 40933, 7711, '<td valign="top">strange, twisted and brilliant tones. Well done.</td>', 'strange, twisted and brilliant tones. Well done.', '2003-10-12 19:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(447950, 40780, 8860, '<td valign="top">Perhaps over-FX''d - even for this subject but that does not detract from an excellent shot. The model''s face looks genuinely scared of something with the fear captured beautifully in the eye. It''s dramatically lit, well composed, very impactful and successful in its aim. [8]</td>', 'Perhaps over-FX''d - even for this subject but that does not detract from an excellent shot. The model''s face looks genuinely scared of something with the fear captured beautifully in the eye. It''s dramatically lit, well composed, very impactful and successful in its aim. [8]', '2003-10-12 20:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(447986, 40578, 8860, '<td valign="top">Yeah I like this for its Child''s Play / Omen / General Sicko genre of scary stuff! That doll thing looks very, very ill indeed. It''s not at all right and I would NOT like that to appear in my dreams - that''s for sure. Simply a haunting image - although the blue is so primary that it nearly kills the scary vibe to it. I''d like to see if it looks more ill if the colours were muted.<br/> <br/>That doll thing''s not right you know... not right at all. [8]   ; )</td>', 'Yeah I like this for its Child''s Play / Omen / General Sicko genre of scary stuff! That doll thing looks very, very ill indeed. It''s not at all right and I would NOT like that to appear in my dreams - that''s for sure. Simply a haunting image - although the blue is so primary that it nearly kills the scary vibe to it. I''d like to see if it looks more ill if the colours were muted. That doll thing''s not right you know... not right at all. [8]   ; )', '2003-10-12 20:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(447989, 40889, 8860, '<td valign="top">Thank you. But if it''s alright with you my diary''s a bit full at the moment. You''re not well mate.</td>', 'Thank you. But if it''s alright with you my diary''s a bit full at the moment. You''re not well mate.', '2003-10-12 20:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(447992, 40977, 8860, '<td valign="top">This looks too pretty to denote a form of imprisonment. I share a claustrophobic fear but this doesn''t capture it for me. The hand is too unstressed and gentle. Nice colours though outside of the challenge.</td>', 'This looks too pretty to denote a form of imprisonment. I share a claustrophobic fear but this doesn''t capture it for me. The hand is too unstressed and gentle. Nice colours though outside of the challenge.', '2003-10-12 20:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(447993, 40974, 8860, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately I''ve seen the plasma ball shot so many times that I''m a bit anaesthetised to this one. I can see what you''re getting at but it''s too distracting with the pretty plasma stuff.</td>', 'Unfortunately I''ve seen the plasma ball shot so many times that I''m a bit anaesthetised to this one. I can see what you''re getting at but it''s too distracting with the pretty plasma stuff.', '2003-10-12 20:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(447996, 40834, 8860, '<td valign="top">The gaze is a bit too intent for a daydream. I see a daydream as a more wistful, unfocused look - which is really the entire premise of this shot. The border is unnecessary/pointless but it''s nicely lit and quite crisp.</td>', 'The gaze is a bit too intent for a daydream. I see a daydream as a more wistful, unfocused look - which is really the entire premise of this shot. The border is unnecessary/pointless but it''s nicely lit and quite crisp.', '2003-10-12 20:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(447999, 40868, 8860, '<td valign="top">Dream or Nightmare?  ; )<br/> <br/>Colours are a bit harsh and the definition is lost through glare. I can''t see much to lock on to so for me it lacks a focal point.</td>', 'Dream or Nightmare?  ; ) Colours are a bit harsh and the definition is lost through glare. I can''t see much to lock on to so for me it lacks a focal point.', '2003-10-12 20:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(448001, 40457, 8860, '<td valign="top">Amazing that you shoud have a camera at hand for this. What incredible photojournalism.  ; )</td>', 'Amazing that you shoud have a camera at hand for this. What incredible photojournalism.  ; )', '2003-10-12 20:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(448004, 40741, 8860, '<td valign="top">Yup - that would scare me too. Looks like you''ve been almost murdered and dumped in a shallow grave too. Bummer!</td>', 'Yup - that would scare me too. Looks like you''ve been almost murdered and dumped in a shallow grave too. Bummer!', '2003-10-12 20:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(448008, 40545, 8860, '<td valign="top">Yeah - this is creative thinking. Nice exposure too with some acting going on. Pretty confincing film noir for me. Could be a winner this.  [[9]]</td>', 'Yeah - this is creative thinking. Nice exposure too with some acting going on. Pretty confincing film noir for me. Could be a winner this.  [[9]]', '2003-10-12 20:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(448009, 40642, 8860, '<td valign="top">Are you a tree or something?  ; )  Nice composition and lighting.</td>', 'Are you a tree or something?  ; )  Nice composition and lighting.', '2003-10-12 20:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(448010, 40857, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good UV kind of vibe and very Wiz of OZ / Fantasia. Nice take.</td>', 'Good UV kind of vibe and very Wiz of OZ / Fantasia. Nice take.', '2003-10-12 20:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(448011, 40971, 8860, '<td valign="top">My worst nightmare is not having my G4 Powerbook!  ; )  But yes, your scenario would be a nightmare for me too, but probably a dream for my wife and kids!!</td>', 'My worst nightmare is not having my G4 Powerbook!  ; )  But yes, your scenario would be a nightmare for me too, but probably a dream for my wife and kids!!', '2003-10-12 20:58:57.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(448017, 40934, 8860, '<td valign="top">That is so sad and I''m giving it 10 for your brave social comment. He looks pitiful and I share the sentiment. I hate the human race sometimes...</td>', 'That is so sad and I''m giving it 10 for your brave social comment. He looks pitiful and I share the sentiment. I hate the human race sometimes...', '2003-10-12 21:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(448019, 40972, 8860, '<td valign="top">Yes, a very moody shot with intriguing subject. The flash is too hard and kills the vibe slightly but it''s still good. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-10-13 04:40:36.</i></td>', 'Yes, a very moody shot with intriguing subject. The flash is too hard and kills the vibe slightly but it''s still good. ', '2003-10-12 21:03:38.000000', '2003-10-13 05:40:36.000000', 1),
(448022, 40337, 8860, '<td valign="top">Why were dolls ever invented? They were destined to wake up at odd hours of the night with a latent ability to inflict untold harm by simply staring really hard and speaking in a monotone!! Well lit and atmospheric. Does the job nicely.</td>', 'Why were dolls ever invented? They were destined to wake up at odd hours of the night with a latent ability to inflict untold harm by simply staring really hard and speaking in a monotone!! Well lit and atmospheric. Does the job nicely.', '2003-10-12 21:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(448023, 40755, 8860, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - just beautiful. You managed to shoehorn this into the challenge but I think it was worth it! Great stuff.</td>', 'Beautiful - just beautiful. You managed to shoehorn this into the challenge but I think it was worth it! Great stuff.', '2003-10-12 21:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(448025, 40735, 8860, '<td valign="top">Fly''s nightmare maybe - but I love spiders!</td>', 'Fly''s nightmare maybe - but I love spiders!', '2003-10-12 21:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(448028, 40960, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great idea this. I think there''ll be lots of people who''ve lost someone dear who will relate to this - including me. Well executed shot too. [9]</td>', 'Great idea this. I think there''ll be lots of people who''ve lost someone dear who will relate to this - including me. Well executed shot too. [9]', '2003-10-12 21:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(448029, 40743, 8860, '<td valign="top">I think everyone''s had that dream and this does a fairly good job of representing it. Makes me feel that weird sensation at the back of my head just thinking about it!</td>', 'I think everyone''s had that dream and this does a fairly good job of representing it. Makes me feel that weird sensation at the back of my head just thinking about it!', '2003-10-12 21:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(448032, 40539, 8860, '<td valign="top">Yup - that''s pretty grim. It''s not a technical masterpiece but it does kind of help this scenario. Very worrying - and sad that it really happens sometimes. Certainly spooks me - and I''m a father!</td>', 'Yup - that''s pretty grim. It''s not a technical masterpiece but it does kind of help this scenario. Very worrying - and sad that it really happens sometimes. Certainly spooks me - and I''m a father!', '2003-10-12 21:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(448050, 40722, 12131, '<td valign="top">That looks half real, half fake but entirely fun.</td>', 'That looks half real, half fake but entirely fun.', '2003-10-12 22:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(448051, 40948, 12131, '<td valign="top">That''s an impressive sculpture.  Love the background and the mixture of light.</td>', 'That''s an impressive sculpture.  Love the background and the mixture of light.', '2003-10-12 22:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(448054, 40539, 12448, '<td valign="top">What am I missing?  I''ve looked at this for several minutes but the left side is so dark I''m not sure what I''m looking at.<br/> <br/>Ammendmum:  I readjusted my monitor''s brightness and contrast settings and WOW!  What a difference!  I can now see the picture much more clearly and you are right, this is a REAL NIGHTMARE!  Your score just went WAY UP!<br/> <br/>Another addition, after going back through these again, I again bumped your score, this is really a frightening thought, having a small baby myself, 16 months old, the thought of losing him in the middle of the night, you captures that perfectly.  It''s not a perfect picture but darn close in my book.</td>', 'What am I missing?  I''ve looked at this for several minutes but the left side is so dark I''m not sure what I''m looking at. Ammendmum:  I readjusted my monitor''s brightness and contrast settings and WOW!  What a difference!  I can now see the picture much more clearly and you are right, this is a REAL NIGHTMARE!  Your score just went WAY UP! Another addition, after going back through these again, I again bumped your score, this is really a frightening thought, having a small baby myself, 16 months old, the thought of losing him in the middle of the night, you captures that perfectly.  It''s not a perfect picture but darn close in my book.', '2003-10-12 22:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(448097, 40976, 5705, '<td valign="top">OMG-- this looks exactlly like the hallway from the Shining-- very cool to get this wide!  10</td>', 'OMG-- this looks exactlly like the hallway from the Shining-- very cool to get this wide!  10', '2003-10-13 00:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(448098, 40658, 5705, '<td valign="top">the colors are very dreamy-- emotive pic-- 9</td>', 'the colors are very dreamy-- emotive pic-- 9', '2003-10-13 00:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(448099, 40673, 5705, '<td valign="top">I can relate-- nice job-- 9</td>', 'I can relate-- nice job-- 9', '2003-10-13 00:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(448100, 40743, 5705, '<td valign="top">Nice Job-- conveys the falling nightmare perfect-- 10</td>', 'Nice Job-- conveys the falling nightmare perfect-- 10', '2003-10-13 00:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
