(448177, 40900, 11800, '<td valign="top">Sorry you didn''t get a higher score. Some people must not like to use their imagination very much. Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Sorry you didn''t get a higher score. Some people must not like to use their imagination very much. Keep up the good work.', '2003-10-13 01:12:49.000000', NULL, 0),
