(449227, 40876, 3889, '<td valign="top">Hi --<br/> <br/>This picture has some eerie effect to it.  I like it!  Very original.<br/> <br/>Framing was great also.  <br/> <br/>A great attempt on being a stand out from the crowd.<br/> <br/>This reminds me a a television intro used around 10 years ago.  I was always intrigued on how they produced this effect.<br/> <br/>Great work --<br/> <br/>Sandy</td>', 'Hi -- This picture has some eerie effect to it.  I like it!  Very original. Framing was great also.   A great attempt on being a stand out from the crowd. This reminds me a a television intro used around 10 years ago.  I was always intrigued on how they produced this effect. Great work -- Sandy', '2003-10-13 18:54:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(449234, 40744, 5112, '<td valign="top">Hey, David, thanks for your comment on my dreams entry!!!  This one (your picture) had me all freaked out during voting, I was hoping whoever entered it didn''t have to eat plaster all the time :))  And so formal.  Cool idea, I liked it.<br/> <br/>Ursula</td>', 'Hey, David, thanks for your comment on my dreams entry!!!  This one (your picture) had me all freaked out during voting, I was hoping whoever entered it didn''t have to eat plaster all the time :))  And so formal.  Cool idea, I liked it. Ursula', '2003-10-13 19:04:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(449434, 40960, 259, '<td valign="top">two 1st in a row.  nice job.  having my measly pic next to it makes yours look all that much better.  keep it up.</td>', 'two 1st in a row.  nice job.  having my measly pic next to it makes yours look all that much better.  keep it up.', '2003-10-13 20:37:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(449435, 40673, 2223, '<td valign="top">I thought i left a comment during voting because when i saw this for the first time i got shivers up my back because i have these anxiety type dreams involving bridges and my intention was to photograph a scary bridge like this one but didn''t get a chance too. I''m so glad this got a ribbon. Congrats on a fab photo!!</td>', 'I thought i left a comment during voting because when i saw this for the first time i got shivers up my back because i have these anxiety type dreams involving bridges and my intention was to photograph a scary bridge like this one but didn''t get a chance too. I''m so glad this got a ribbon. Congrats on a fab photo!!', '2003-10-13 20:40:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(449521, 40954, 4482, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everone for your wonderful comments! :o)</td>', 'Thanks to everone for your wonderful comments! :o)', '2003-10-13 22:13:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(449597, 40935, 11738, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all for the votes and the comments.<br/> <br/>First, I would like to say that this shot was not staged.  As I state in my Photographer''s Comments, I stumbled onto this kid while looking for my "Urban" submission.  I thought this shot would be interesting since his panhandling cup was out of the ordinary being tied to the end of a stick.<br/> <br/>I thought it was neat, although I felt sad that he had to do this to get by.  I feel sorry for all these young adults that have to live in the streets, either on the short or long term, because they feel thay do not have anywhere to go.  A true nightmare for those who live like this day-in, day-out...</td>', 'Thanks to all for the votes and the comments. First, I would like to say that this shot was not staged.  As I state in my Photographer''s Comments, I stumbled onto this kid while looking for my "Urban" submission.  I thought this shot would be interesting since his panhandling cup was out of the ordinary being tied to the end of a stick. I thought it was neat, although I felt sad that he had to do this to get by.  I feel sorry for all these young adults that have to live in the streets, either on the short or long term, because they feel thay do not have anywhere to go.  A true nightmare for those who live like this day-in, day-out...', '2003-10-13 23:09:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(449643, 40976, 10419, '<td valign="top">Thank you very much to everyone for their comments. I had especially good chuckle with the "Shning" comments.</td>', 'Thank you very much to everyone for their comments. I had especially good chuckle with the "Shning" comments.', '2003-10-13 23:59:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(449687, 40893, 8953, '<td valign="top">as one of the guilty parties, that inferred a photo of a picture, I apologize. The image is not one I would have identified as yours. And no question you are not a photographer that would take a photo of a picture. <br/> <br/>Richard</td>', 'as one of the guilty parties, that inferred a photo of a picture, I apologize. The image is not one I would have identified as yours. And no question you are not a photographer that would take a photo of a picture.  Richard', '2003-10-14 01:03:09.000000', NULL, 0),
